<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Biblica® Open Akuapem Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">5 Mose (Deuteronomium)</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mose Nhoma A Ɛto So Anum (Deuteronomium)</para>
  <para style="toc2">5 Mose</para>
  <para style="toc3">5 Mose</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mose Nhoma A Ɛto So Anum</para>
  <para style="mt4">Anaase</para>
  <para style="mt3">Deuteronomium</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Wotu Fi Horeb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1"/>Eyi ne nsɛm a Mose ka kyerɛɛ Israelfo nyinaa wɔ sare no so wɔ Yordan apuei. Wɔbɔɔ atenae wɔ Yordan bon a ɛbɛn Suf, wɔ Paran, Tofel, Laban, Haserot ne Di-Sahab ntam no. <verse eid="DEU 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2"/>Efi Horeb de kɔ Kades-Barnea no, ɔkwan a ɛfa bepɔw Seir no, yɛ nnafua dubaako kwan.<verse eid="DEU 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3"/>Israelfo fii Bepɔw Sinai no, afe a ɛto so aduanan no ɔsram dubaako no da a edi kan no, Mose kaa nsɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ no sɛ ɔnka nkyerɛ Israelfo no pɛpɛɛpɛ kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4"/>Ɔkaa saa asɛm yi wɔ bere a na wɔadi Amorifo hene Sihon a na odi ade wɔ Hesbon ne Basanhene Og a na odi ade wɔ Astarot ne Edrei so nkonim.<verse eid="DEU 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5"/>Yordan apuei fam a ɛwɔ Moab asase so na Mose fii ase kyerɛkyerɛɛ mmara no mu se:<verse eid="DEU 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ yɛn wɔ Horeb se: “Moatena saa bepɔw yi so akyɛ dodo. <verse eid="DEU 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7"/>Muntutu nkɔtena Amorifo nkoko no so; monkɔtena nnipa a wɔbemmɛn Araba mmepɔw no mu ne atɔe mmepɔw ayaase hɔ nyinaa mu; monkɔ Negeb na momfa mpoano nkosi Kanaanfo asase so ne Lebanon nkodu Asubɔnten Eufrate ho. <verse eid="DEU 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8"/>Muntie! Mede saa asase yi ama mo. Monkɔ na monkɔfa asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ bɔ sɛ ɔde bɛma mo agyanom Abraham, Isak ne Yakob ne wɔn asefo no.”<verse eid="DEU 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akannifo No Yiyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9"/>Saa bere no, meka kyerɛɛ mo se, “Me nko ara merentumi nyɛ mo ho adwuma. <verse eid="DEU 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, ama mo ase adɔ enti nnɛ yi, mo ase afɛe te sɛ ɔsoro nsoromma. <verse eid="DEU 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo agyanom Nyankopɔn mma mo nnɔ mmɔho mpempem na onhyira mo sɛnea wahyɛ mo bɔ no! <verse eid="DEU 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12"/>Na ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na me nko metumi asoa mo haw ne mo nnesoa ne mo ntawntaw? <verse eid="DEU 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13"/>Mompaw mmarima bi a wɔwɔ nyansa, ntease na wɔwɔ din pa mfi abusuakuw biara mu na memfa wɔn ntuatua mo ano.”<verse eid="DEU 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14"/>Mubuaa me se, “Dwuma a woasusuw sɛ wubedi no ye.”<verse eid="DEU 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15"/>Enti mede mo mmusuakuw mu mmarima atitiriw, anyansafo a wɔn anim wɔ nyam no tuatuaa mo ano apem apem, ɔha ɔha, aduonum aduonum ne du du so mpanyin ne mo mmusuakuw so sɛ ahwɛfo. <verse eid="DEU 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16"/>Na atemmufo a wɔwɔ hɔ saa bere no nso, mehyɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Sɛ akasakasa ba anuanom ntam, sɛ asɛm no yɛ Israelni ne ne nua bi anaa Israelni ne ɔhɔho bi a, monhwɛ na mummu atɛntrenee. <verse eid="DEU 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17"/>Mo atemmu mu, mummmu ntɛnkyew. Muntie ɔketewa ne ɔkɛse pɛ. Munnsuro onipa biara, efisɛ Onyankopɔn na obu atɛn. Asɛm a ɛyɛ den ma mo no, momfa mmrɛ me na minni.” <verse eid="DEU 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18"/>Na saa bere no, mekaa biribiara a ɛsɛ sɛ moyɛ kyerɛɛ mo.<verse eid="DEU 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsoma Akwansrafo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19"/>Na sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ yɛn no, yefii Horeb de yɛn ani kyerɛɛ Amorifo bepɔw a yɛnam sare pradada a moahu no so koduu Kades-Barnea. <verse eid="DEU 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20"/>Afei, meka kyerɛɛ mo se, “Moadu Amorifo bepɔw man a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de rema yɛn no so. <verse eid="DEU 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de asase no ama mo. Momforo nkɔfa, sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo agyanom Nyankopɔn, ka kyerɛɛ mo no. Munnsuro: mommma obi mmu mo aba mu.”<verse eid="DEU 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22"/>Na mo nyinaa baa me nkyɛn bɛkae se, “Momma yɛnsoma mmarima nni yɛn anim na wɔnkɔsra asase no so mma yɛn na wɔmmɛka nea wobehu nkyerɛ yɛn na ɛno na ɛbɛkyerɛ yɛn kwan ne nkurow ko a yɛbɛfa so.”<verse eid="DEU 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23"/>Na saa nsusuwii yi ye ma me nti mepaw akwansrafo dumien a mo mmusuakuw dumien no mu nnipa biara wɔ mu. <verse eid="DEU 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24"/>Wɔforoo bepɔw no na wokoduu Eskol subon mu sraa hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25"/>Na wɔfaa asase no so aba bi de brɛɛ yɛn. Na wɔkae se, asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Nyankopɔn de ama yɛn no yɛ asase pa.<verse eid="DEU 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Israelfo Atuatew</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26"/>Nanso na mompɛ sɛ moforo kɔ soro. Motew <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm so atua. <verse eid="DEU 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27"/>Munwiinwii wɔ mo ntamadan mu kae se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> tan yɛn nti na ɔde yɛn fi Misraim de yɛn abɛhyɛ Amorifo nsam sɛ wonkunkum yɛn no. <verse eid="DEU 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28"/>Yɛrekɔ he? Yɛn akwansrafo no amanneɛbɔ no abu yɛn aba mu. ‘Wɔka se nnipa yɛ atenten ahoɔdenfo sen yɛn. Wɔn nkurow yɛ akɛse a afasu a wɔatoto afa ho no kɔ sorosoro. Na mpo, yehuu Anakfo wɔ hɔ!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29"/>Na meka kyerɛɛ mo se, “Mommɔ hu, munnsuro wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> di mo anim. Ɔbɛko ama mo sɛnea muhuu no sɛ ɔyɛɛ wɔ Misraim no. <verse eid="DEU 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31"/>Na muhuu nso sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kɔɔ so hwɛɛ mo ntoatoaso wɔ sare so ha sɛnea agya hwɛ ne ba no. Moatwa kwan no nyinaa de abedu beae ha.”<verse eid="DEU 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32"/>Nanso eyi nyinaa akyi no, moannya <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, mu awerehyɛmu. <verse eid="DEU 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33"/>Ɔno na odii mo akwantu no anim, pɛɛ beae pa maa mo tenae, de ogya dum kyerɛɛ mo kwan anadwo de omununkum dum kyerɛɛ mo kwan awia.<verse eid="DEU 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tee sɛ morenwiinwii no, ne bo fuw yiye na ɔkaa ntam se, <verse eid="DEU 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35"/>“Saa awo ntoatoaso bɔne yi mu onipa baako koraa nni hɔ a obehu asase pa a, maka ho ntam sɛ mede bɛma mo agyanom no, <verse eid="DEU 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36"/>gye Yefune babarima Kaleb. Ɔno na obehu saa asase yi. Mede asase a ne nan sii so no bɛma ɔne nʼasefo, efisɛ ɔde ne koma nyinaa dii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyi.”<verse eid="DEU 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37"/>Me nso, esiane mo nti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuw me. Ɔka kyerɛɛ me se, “Wo nan rensi Bɔhyɛ Asase no so da. <verse eid="DEU 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38"/>Na mmom, wo boafo Nun babarima Yosua na obedi ɔmanfo no anim akɔ asase no so. Hyɛ no nkuran, efisɛ obedi Israelfo no anim akɔfa asase no. <verse eid="DEU 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39"/>Mede asase no bɛma wo mma a wonnim biribiara. Wo mma a wonnim papa nnim bɔne no a na wusuro sɛ wɔbɛkyere wɔn nnommum no na mede asase no bɛma wɔn. Wɔn na wɔbɛtena asase no so. <verse eid="DEU 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40"/>Na wo de, dan wʼani kɔ sare so a ɛkeka kɔ Po Kɔkɔɔ no so hɔ.”<verse eid="DEU 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41"/>Ɛno na mugye too mu se “Yɛayɛ bɔne atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Yɛbɛkɔ asase no so akɔko sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ yɛn no.” Enti mo mu biara faa nʼakode hyehyɛe. Na mususuwii sɛ ɔman a ɛda bepɔw so no sokɔ yɛ mmerɛw.<verse eid="DEU 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42"/>Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Ka kyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Monnkɔ hɔ nkɔko, efisɛ merenka mo ho nkɔ. Mo atamfo no bedi mo so.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43"/>Meka kyerɛɛ mo, nanso moantie. Mosɔre tiaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛde no na monam ahomaso so foro kɔɔ asase no so kɔkoe. <verse eid="DEU 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44"/>Amorifo a wɔte bepɔw no so nso sɔre baa mo so; wɔtaa mo sɛ nnowa, boroo mo fi Seir koduu Horma. <verse eid="DEU 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45"/>Afei, mosan ba besuu wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim, nanso osiw nʼaso a wantie mo su no. <verse eid="DEU 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46"/>Ɛno nti, motenaa Kades nna bebree.<verse eid="DEU 1:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Sare So Ananteanantew</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1"/>Afei, yɛsan yɛn akyi de yɛn ani kyerɛɛ sare so wɔ baabi a Po Kɔkɔɔ no da hɔ sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛɛ me sɛ menyɛ no. Yɛnantenantew faa Seir bepɔw man no ho nna bebree.<verse eid="DEU 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, <verse eid="DEU 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3"/>“Moatwa afa saa ɔman a ɛda bepɔw yi so no ho mmere sann, enti monnan mo ani nkyerɛ atifi fam. <verse eid="DEU 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4"/>Hyɛ ɔman no se, ‘Morebɛfa mo nuanom Edomfo, a wɔyɛ Esau asefo a wɔte Seir no asase so. Edomfo no besuro mo, nanso monhwɛ yiye. <verse eid="DEU 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5"/>Monnhyɛ wɔn abufuw a ɛde ɔko bɛba na meremfa wɔn nsase no mu biara mma mo; mpo, baabi a mode mo anan besisi, efisɛ mede Seir bepɔw kurow ama Esau sɛ nʼatenae. <verse eid="DEU 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6"/>Aduan biara a mubedi ne nsu biara a mobɛnom no, momfa dwetɛ ntua wɔn ho ka.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, ahyira mo nsa ano nnwuma nyinaa. Wahwɛ mo so wɔ mo akwantu wɔ sare kakraa yi nyinaa so. Saa mfe aduanan yi nyinaa mu no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka mo ho na hwee ho anhia mo.<verse eid="DEU 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8"/>Yetwa faa yɛn nuanom a wɔyɛ Esau asefo a wɔte Seir ho no. Yɛfaa Araba subon kwan no a efi Elat ne Esion-Geber no so na yɛbɛfaa Moab sare so kwan no so.<verse eid="DEU 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Monnhaw Moabfo no anaa monhyɛ wɔn abufuw a ɛde ɔko bɛba, na meremfa wɔn nsase no mu biara mma mo. Efisɛ mede Ar ama Lot asefo sɛ agyapade.”<verse eid="DEU 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10"/>Kan no na Emifo na wɔte hɔ. Na wɔsoso na wɔdɔɔso a wɔwoware te sɛ Anakfo no. <verse eid="DEU 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11"/>Wɔn nso, na wɔyɛ abran sɛ Anakfo no ara pɛ, a na wɔfrɛ wɔn Refaitefo, nanso Moabfo de, na wɔfrɛ wɔn Emifo. <verse eid="DEU 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12"/>Kan no na Horifo na wɔte Seir, nanso Esau asefo no tuu wɔn fii hɔ. Wɔsɛee Horifo no tenaa wɔn anan mu sɛnea Israel yɛɛ wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de maa wɔn sɛ wɔn agyapade no so no pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="DEU 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kae se, “Afei, sɔre na kotwa Sered bon no.” Enti yekotwaa obon no.<verse eid="DEU 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14"/>Na nna dodow a yɛde nantew fi Kades-Barnea besii sɛ yetwaa Sered bon no yɛ mfirihyia aduasa awotwe. Saa bere no, na mmarima a wɔanyinyin yiye a wobetumi akɔ ɔko no nyinaa awuwu wɔ sare no so sɛnea Awurade kaa ho ntam no. <verse eid="DEU 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsa tiaa wɔn ara kosi sɛ wɔn nyinaa wuwuu wɔ wɔn atenae hɔ.<verse eid="DEU 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16"/>Saa nnipa yi mu akofo a otwa to wuu no pɛ, <verse eid="DEU 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17"/>na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, <verse eid="DEU 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18"/>“Nnɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wofa Ar wɔ Moab mantam mu. <verse eid="DEU 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19"/>Na sɛ wudu Amonfo mu a, nhaw wɔn anaa nhyɛ wɔn abufuw a ɛde ɔko bɛba, efisɛ meremma mo Amorifo nsase no bi. Mede ama Lot asefo sɛ agyapade.”<verse eid="DEU 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20"/>Saa beae hɔ na abran akɛse a na Amonfo frɛ wɔn Samsumifo no te kan no. <verse eid="DEU 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21"/>Na wɔyɛ nnipa ahoɔdenfo a wɔdɔɔso na wɔwoware te sɛ Anakfo no. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛee Samsumifo no wɔ Amonfo anim ma wɔpam wɔn tenaa wɔn anan mu. <verse eid="DEU 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22"/>Saa ara na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛee Horifo wɔ Esau asefo a na wɔte Seir no anim ma wɔpam wɔn, tenaa wɔn anan mu de besi nnɛ yi. <verse eid="DEU 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23"/>Na Awifo a wɔtenaa nkuraa nkuraa trɛw koduu Gasa no nso, Kaftorfo a wofi Kaftor bɛsɛee wɔn, tenaa wɔn anan mu.<verse eid="DEU 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hesbonhene Sihon So Nkonimdi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24"/>“Sɔre kotwa Arnon Subon. Mede Hesbonhene Sihon a ɔyɛ Amorini no ne man ahyɛ wo nsa. Kɔtow hyɛ ne so, na monko, na fa. <verse eid="DEU 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25"/>Efi nnɛ yi ara, mede mo ho suro ne hu bɛhyɛ aman a wɔwɔ ɔsoro ase nyinaa mu. Wɔbɛte mo ho nsɛm na wɔn ho bɛpopo na mo nti, wɔanya adwenemhaw esiane mo nti.”<verse eid="DEU 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26"/>Mituu abɔfo fii Kedemot sare so kɔɔ Hesbonhene Sihon nkyɛn asomdwoe so kɔka kyerɛɛ no se, <verse eid="DEU 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27"/>“Ma yentwa mu mfa wo man mu ha. Yɛbɛfa ɔtempɔn no so tee; yɛremman mfa benkum anaa nifa. <verse eid="DEU 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28"/>Tɔn aduan ma yenni na tɔn nsu nso ma yɛnnom. Nea yɛrehwehwɛ ara ne ɔkwan a wobɛma yɛn ama yɛanantew atwa mu, <verse eid="DEU 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29"/>sɛnea Esau asefo a na wɔte Seir ne Moabfo a na wɔte Ar yɛɛ yɛn no akosi sɛ yebetwa Yordan akɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn, de rema yɛn no so.” <verse eid="DEU 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30"/>Nanso Hesbonhene Sihon amma yɛantwa mu wɔ hɔ. Efisɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, ayɛ ne honhom sisirii, apirim ne koma sɛnea ɔnam so de no bɛhyɛ mo nsam, sɛnea wayɛ no nnɛ yi.<verse eid="DEU 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Hwɛ, mafi ase de Sihon ne ne man ahyɛ wo nsam. Afei, fi ase na di wɔn so, na fa nʼasase no.”<verse eid="DEU 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32"/>Bere a Sihon ne ne dɔm behyiaa yɛn sɛ wɔne yɛn rebɛko wɔ Yahas no, <verse eid="DEU 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn, yii no maa yɛn ma yɛbobɔɔ ɔno, ne mmabarima ne nʼasraafo nyinaa hwehwee. <verse eid="DEU 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34"/>Na yɛfaa ne nkurow nyinaa saa bere no sɛee ne mmarima, mmea ne mmofra a yɛannyaw obiara. <verse eid="DEU 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35"/>Mmom, nyɛmmoa ne asade ahorow a ɛwɔ nkurow a yedii so no mu no de, yɛsoa kɔe. <verse eid="DEU 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36"/>Efi Aroer a ɛda Arnon Subon ano ne kurow a ɛda subon no mu no, ne mpo, de kosi Gilead no, kurow biara nni hɔ a na ɛsodi yɛ den ma yɛn; <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn de ne nyinaa hyɛɛ yɛn nsa. <verse eid="DEU 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37"/>Nanso, yɛankɔ Amorifo asase ne asase a ɛda Asubɔnten Yabok ho ne mmepɔw no so nkurow no baabiara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Nyankopɔn hyɛɛ yɛn sɛ yɛnnkɔ so no so.<verse eid="DEU 2:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Basanhene Og So Nkonimdi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1"/>Afei, yɛde yɛn ani kyerɛɛ Basan kwan so. Basanhene Og ne nʼasrafo nyinaa fi behyiaa yɛn wɔ Edrei ne yɛn koe. <verse eid="DEU 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2"/>Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Nsuro no, efisɛ mede ɔno ne nʼakofo ne nʼasase nyinaa ahyɛ wo nsa. Sɛnea woyɛɛ Amorihene Sihon a odii ade wɔ Hesbon dii no, yɛ no saa ara.”<verse eid="DEU 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3"/>Enti <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn, san de Basanhene Og ne nʼakofo nyinaa hyɛɛ yɛn nsa. Yɛbɔɔ wɔn gui a anka wɔn mu baako koraa. <verse eid="DEU 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4"/>Saa bere no, yɛfaa ne nkuropɔn nyinaa. Nkuropɔn aduosia no mu baako koraa nni hɔ a yɛannye amfi wɔn nsam. Argob mantam a ɛyɛ Og ahemman wɔ Basan nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5"/>Na wɔato afasu atenten afa saa nkuropɔn yi nyinaa ho de nnade apon atoto ano. Saa bere koro no ara mu, yɛfaa nkuraa a na wɔntoo afasu mfaa ho no bebree. <verse eid="DEU 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6"/>Yɛsɛee Basan kuropɔn no pasaa sɛnea yɛsɛee Hesbonhene Sihon no. Yɛsɛee nkurow no ne mu mmarima, mmea ne mmofra nyinaa pasapasa. <verse eid="DEU 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7"/>Nanso nkuropɔn no mu nyɛmmoa ne asade ahorow no de, yɛsoa kɔe.<verse eid="DEU 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8"/>Saa bere no, yɛfaa Amorifo ahemfo baanu no nsase a na ɛdeda Asubɔnten Yordan apuei fam no nyinaa; nsase a efi Arnon subon mu de kosi bepɔw Hermon so nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9"/>Sidonfo frɛ no Hermon Sirion na Amorifo frɛ no Senir. <verse eid="DEU 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10"/>Yɛfaa nkuropɔn a ɛwɔ bepɔw no atifi no nyinaa so a Gilead ne Basan ka ho de kosi nkurow a ɛwɔ Saleka ne Edrei a na ɛyɛ Og ahemman wɔ Basan no nso ka ho bi. <verse eid="DEU 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11"/>Abran no de, Basanhene Og nko na na waka. Ne dade mpa tenten boro anammɔn dumiɛnsa na ne trɛw yɛ anammɔn asia. Ɛda so wɔ Amonfo kuropɔn Raba mu mprempren ara.<verse eid="DEU 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsase No Mu Kyekyɛ Wɔ Yordan Apuei Fam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12"/>Nsase a yɛfaa no saa bere no, mede ne fa a ɛda fi Aroer Arnon subon mu ne ɔman a ɛda Gilead bepɔw no fa ne ne nkurow no maa Rubenfo ne Gadfo. <verse eid="DEU 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13"/>Afei, mede asase no nkae a ɛyɛ Gilead ne Basan nyinaa a na anka ɛyɛ Og ahemman no maa Manase abusua fa no. Na wɔfrɛ Argob mantam a ɛwɔ Basan no nyinaa se Abran asase. <verse eid="DEU 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14"/>Manase aseni bi a wɔfrɛ no Yair faa Argob mantam no nyinaa de kosii Gesurfo ne Maakatfo hye so. Ɔde ne din too asase no frɛɛ hɔ Hawot-Yair de besi nnɛ. <verse eid="DEU 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15"/>Mede Gilead maa Makir, <verse eid="DEU 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16"/>Rubenfo ne Gadfo no, memaa wɔn asase bi a efi Gilead fa bi, kosi Arnon subon ho, de kosii Asubɔnten Yabok a ɛyɛ Amonfo hye no so. <verse eid="DEU 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17"/>Atɔe hye no fi Asubɔnten Yordan a ɛda Araba a efi Kineret kosi Araba Po (a ɛne Nkyene Po no) wɔ Pisga bepɔw no ase.<verse eid="DEU 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18"/>Na mehyɛɛ mo saa bere no se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de asase yi ama mo sɛ momfa. Nanso mo mmarima akofo nyinaa nhyɛ akode nni mo nuanom Israelfo no anim ntwa Yordan. <verse eid="DEU 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19"/>Mo yerenom, mo mma ne mo nyɛmmoa bebrebe a minim sɛ mowɔ no de, mubetumi agyaw wɔ nkurow a mede ama mo no so. <verse eid="DEU 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔ Israelfo a wɔaka no ho ban na wɔtena asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de rema wɔn wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan agya no so a, ansa na mo mu biara betumi asan akɔ asase a mede ama mo no so.”<verse eid="DEU 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔamma Mose Antwa Yordan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21"/>Saa bere no, meka kyerɛɛ Yosua se, “Wode wʼani ahu nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Nyankopɔn, ayɛ saa ahemfo baanu yi nyinaa. Saa ara na ɔbɛyɛ ahemman a ɛwɔ faako a morekɔ no nso. <verse eid="DEU 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22"/>Nsuro wɔn, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Nyankopɔn, bɛko ama wo.”<verse eid="DEU 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23"/>Saa bere no, mesrɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, <verse eid="DEU 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24"/>“Otumfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, woafi ase reda wo kɛseyɛ ne wo nsa a ɛyɛ den no adi akyerɛ wʼakoa. Na onyame bɛn na ɔwɔ ɔsoro anaa asase so a obetumi ayɛ mmaninne te sɛ wo? <verse eid="DEU 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25"/>Mesrɛ wo, ma mintwa Yordan nkɔhwɛ asase pa a ɛda hɔ no, Lebanon mmepɔw asase fɛfɛ no.”<verse eid="DEU 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26"/>Nanso esiane mo nti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuw me. Na wantie me. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Nka saa asɛm yi ho hwee bio nkyerɛ me. <verse eid="DEU 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27"/>Foro kɔ Pisga na hwɛ atɔe, atifi, anafo ne apuei. Esiane sɛ, worentwa Yordan no nti, wʼankasa fa wʼani hwɛ asase no. <verse eid="DEU 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28"/>Nanso soma Yosua, hyɛ no nkuran na hyɛ no den, efisɛ ɔno na obedi saa nnipa yi anim atwa na wama wɔadi asase a wʼani tua yi.” <verse eid="DEU 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29"/>Ɛno nti, yɛtenaa subon a ɛbɛn Bet-Peor no mu.<verse eid="DEU 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Osetie Ho Afotu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1"/>Afei, Israel, muntie mmara ne nhyehyɛe a merebɛkyerɛkyerɛ mo yi. Munni so na moanya nkwa, na moatumi akɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo agyanom Nyankopɔn, de rema mo no so akɔtena hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2"/>Mommfa bi nka ho, na munnyi biribiara nso mmfi ahyɛde a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de ama me se memfa mma mo no mu, na mmom munni so.<verse eid="DEU 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3"/>Mode mo ani huu nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛɛ mo wɔ Baal-Peor no. Ɔsɛee onipa biara a na ɔsom Baal-Peor no. <verse eid="DEU 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4"/>Nanso wɔn a na wodi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn nokware nyinaa da so te ase besi nnɛ.<verse eid="DEU 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5"/>Sɛ mudu asase a mobɛtena so no so a, eyinom ne mmara ne ahyɛde a makyerɛkyerɛ mo a ɛsɛ sɛ mudi so. Efi Awurade, yɛn Nyankopɔn, nkyɛn. Ɔde ama me se memfa mma mo. <verse eid="DEU 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6"/>Sɛ mudi so a, ɛbɛda mo nyansa ne ntease a mowɔ no adi akyerɛ aman a wɔbɛte saa ahyɛde yi nyinaa no na wɔaka se, “Ampa, nnipa yi yɛ ɔman kɛse a wonim nyansa na wɔwɔ ntease.” <verse eid="DEU 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7"/>Ɔman kɛse bɛn na ɔwɔ onyame a ɔbɛn wɔn pɛɛ te sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn, a yɛfrɛ no a ogye yɛn so yi? <verse eid="DEU 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8"/>Na ɔman kɛse bɛn na ɛwɔ trenee ahyɛde ne mmara sɛ saa mmara yi a mede rema mo nnɛ yi?<verse eid="DEU 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9"/>Monhwɛ yiye, na mo ani nna hɔ yiye pa ara na nna dodow a mote nkwa mu no, mo werɛ amfi nea moahu, anaa ampa amfi mo koma mu. Monkyerɛkyerɛ mo mma na awo ntoatoaso a ɛbɛba no nhu. <verse eid="DEU 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10"/>Ka kyerɛ wɔn, ne titiriw no, da a mokogyinaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, anim wɔ bepɔw Horeb so a ɔka kyerɛɛ me se, “Frɛ nnipa no wɔ mʼanim na wontie me nsɛm na wɔasua sɛnea wobedi me ni bere dodow a wɔte asase no so na ama wɔatumi akyerɛkyerɛ wɔn mma.” <verse eid="DEU 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11"/>Mubegyina bɛnee bepɔw no ase bere a na bepɔw no rehyew na ogyaframa no retu kɔ ɔsoro a omununkum ne esum kabii aduru no. <verse eid="DEU 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kasa fii ogya no mu kyerɛɛ mo. Motee nsɛm no nanso, moanhu no, nne kɛkɛ na ɛbae. <verse eid="DEU 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13"/>Ɔdaa nʼapam a ɔkyerɛɛ mo sɛ munni so no adi; Mmaransɛm du a ɔkyerɛw guu abo pon abien so no. <verse eid="DEU 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14"/>Saa bere no na Awurade kyerɛɛ me sɛ menkyerɛkyerɛ mo ahyɛde ne mmara a ɛsɛ sɛ mudi so wɔ asase a morebetwa Yordan akɔfa no so.<verse eid="DEU 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahonisom Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15"/>Da a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kasa fii ogya mu kyerɛɛ mo wɔ bepɔw Horeb so no moanhu no. Enti monhwɛ mo akwan yiye, <verse eid="DEU 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16"/>na porɔwee annidi mo amma moanyɛ ɔbosom, ohoni bi sɛso; sɛ ɛyɛ ɔbarima anaa ɔbea sɛso, <verse eid="DEU 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17"/>anaa nea ɛsɛ asase so aboa bi, anaa anomaa a otu fa wim, <verse eid="DEU 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18"/>anaa nea ɛsɛ aboa bi a ɔwea wɔ fam anaa apataa bi a ɔwɔ nsu ase. <verse eid="DEU 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19"/>Na sɛ mohwɛ wim na muhu owia, ɔsram ne nsoromma, wim abɔde nyinaa a, momma ɛnntwetwe mo mma monnkotow nsom nneɛma a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de ama ɔsoro ase aman no nyinaa no. <verse eid="DEU 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20"/>Na mo de, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yii mo fii ogya framfram a ɛnan dade mu wɔ Misraim sɛ mommɛyɛ nʼadiadefo sɛnea mote nnɛ yi.<verse eid="DEU 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21"/>Mo nti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuw me yiye. Ɔkaa ntam se, merentwa Asubɔnten Yordan nkɔ asase pa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de rema mo sɛ mo agyapade no so. <verse eid="DEU 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22"/>Mewu wɔ asase yi so; merentwa Yordan; nanso morebetwa akɔfa asase pa no. <verse eid="DEU 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23"/>Monhwɛ yiye na moammu apam a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, ne mo ayɛ no so. Monyɛ abosom a ɛyɛ biribiara nsɛso a mo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, abra mo no. <verse eid="DEU 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24"/>Efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, yɛ Onyame ninkufo, ogya a ɔhyew ade.<verse eid="DEU 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25"/>Moawowo mma anya nananom akyi no na moatena asase no so akyɛ no, sɛ moma porɔwee didi mo na moyɛ ohoni bi nam so yɛ bɔne wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn ani so hyɛ no abufuw a, <verse eid="DEU 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26"/>mefrɛ ɔsoro ne asase sɛ nnansefo de tia mo saa da yi sɛ, mobɛhyew afi asase a moretwa Yordan akɔfa no so. Morentena hɔ nkyɛ na wɔbɛsɛe mo ampa. <verse eid="DEU 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ mo apansam akɔ aman so a mo mu kakraa bi na ɛbɛka wɔ aman a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>bɛpam mo akɔ so no so. <verse eid="DEU 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28"/>Ɛhɔ na mobɛsom onipa nsa ano ahoni a wɔde nnua ne abo na ayɛ, anyame a wonhu ade na wɔnte asɛm na wonnidi nte hua no. <verse eid="DEU 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29"/>Ɛhɔ na mobɛpere bio ahwehwɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no. Na sɛ mode mo koma ne mo kra nyinaa hwehwɛ no a, mubehu no. <verse eid="DEU 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30"/>Sɛ ɔhaw bi to mo na eyinom nyinaa ba mo so a, akyiri no, mobɛsan akɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, nkyɛn na moayɛ osetie ama no. <verse eid="DEU 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31"/>Efisɛ Awurade, mo Nyankopɔn, no yɛ mmɔborɔhunu Nyankopɔn; ɔrennyaw mo na ɔrensɛe mo anaa ne werɛ remfi apam a ɔne mo agyanom pamee a ɔkaa ntam sii so no.<verse eid="DEU 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Yɛ Baako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32"/>Hwehwɛ abakɔsɛm mu fi bere a Onyankopɔn bɔɔ nnipa wɔ asase so besi nnɛ yi; hwehwɛ fi ɔsoro ti de kosi ti. Hwɛ sɛ biribi kɛse a ɛte sɛ eyi asi pɛn anaasɛ woate biribi saa pɛn? <verse eid="DEU 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33"/>So nnipa foforo bi ate Onyankopɔn nne sɛ ɔrekasa afi ogya mu sɛnea motee no na wɔda so te ase yi ana? <verse eid="DEU 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34"/>So onyame foforo bi nam ogye a ɔnam amanehunu, nsɛnkyerɛnne a ɛyɛ nwonwa, ɔko, tumidi ne ahodwiriwde so agye ɔman bi afi ɔman foforo bi nsam afa sɛ ne de, sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, yɛ maa mo wɔ Misraim a na mo ani tua no?<verse eid="DEU 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35"/>Ɔdaa eyinom nyinaa adi kyerɛɛ mo sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a mubehu sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ Onyankopɔn a nʼakyi obi nni hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36"/>Ɔma motee ne nne fi ɔsoro nam so teɛteɛɛ mo so. Ɔma muhuu ne gya fadum asase so na motee ne nsɛm fii ogya no mu. <verse eid="DEU 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37"/>Esiane sɛ na ɔpɛ mo agyanom asɛm, na ɔpɛɛ sɛ ohyira wɔn asefo nti na ɔno ara de nʼanim ne ne tumi kɛse no yii mo fii Misraim no. <verse eid="DEU 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38"/>Ɔpam aman a na wɔn ho yɛ den sen mo no wɔ mo anim sɛnea ɔde mo bɛba wɔn asase so abɛfa sɛ mo agyapade, sɛnea ɛte nnɛ yi.<verse eid="DEU 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39"/>Enti munhu na momma ɛntena mo koma mu nnɛ yi sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ Onyankopɔn wɔ ɔsoro ne asase so. Obi nni hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40"/>Munni saa ahyɛde ne mmara yi a mede rema mo nnɛ no so na ama asi mo ne mo mma yiye, na moanyin akyɛ wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn de rema mo afebɔɔ no so.<verse eid="DEU 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Guankɔbea Nkuropɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41"/>Afei, Mose yii nkuropɔn abiɛsa bi wɔ Yordan apuei fam <verse eid="DEU 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42"/>a, sɛ ɛba sɛ obi kum obi na wanhyɛ da na onni onipa ko no ho menasepɔw bi a otumi guan kɔ kɔ emu baako so kɔbɔ ne ho aguaa. <verse eid="DEU 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43"/>Oyii Beser a ɛda sare ne asase tataw so no maa Rubenfo. Ɔde Ramot a ɛwɔ Gilead no maa Gadfo na ɔde Golan a ɛwɔ Basan no nso maa Manase abusuakuw.<verse eid="DEU 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔda Mmara No Adi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44"/>Eyinom ne mmara a Mose de maa Israelfo no. <verse eid="DEU 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45"/>Israelfo no fii Misraim no, akwankyerɛ, mmara ne ahyɛde a Mose de maa wɔn <verse eid="DEU 4:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46"/>bere a na wɔwɔ obon a ɛbɛn Bet-Peor a ɛda Asubɔnten Yordan apuei fam, wɔ Amorifo hene Sihon a odii ade wɔ Hesbon, a na Mose ne Israelfo no fi Misraim ɛreba no, wɔko dii ne so no. <verse eid="DEU 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47"/>Wɔfaa nʼasase no san faa Basanhene Og asase kaa ho. Saa ahemfo baanu yi na wɔyɛ Amorifo ahemfo a wɔte Yordan apuei fam. <verse eid="DEU 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48"/>Saa asase yi na efi Aroer a ɛda Arnon subon no ano kosi Sion bepɔw a ɛyɛ Hermon ho. <verse eid="DEU 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49"/>Israelfo no san faa nsase a ɛwɔ Araba po no ano wɔ Yordan apuei fam de kosi Nkyene Po wɔ Pisga mmepɔw no ase.<verse eid="DEU 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Mmaransɛm Du No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1"/>Mose frɛɛ Israelfo no nyinaa ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:1">Israel, muntie, mmara ne ahyɛde a mede rema mo nnɛ no. Munsua na munni so. <verse eid="DEU 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2"/>Bere a yɛwɔ Horeb no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Nyankopɔn ne yɛn yɛɛ apam bi. <verse eid="DEU 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3"/>Ɛnyɛ yɛn agyanom na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne wɔn yɛɛ apam no, na mmom, ɔne yɛn a yɛte ase nnɛ yi nyinaa na ɛyɛe. <verse eid="DEU 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi bepɔw so ogya mu ne mo kasaa anikann. <verse eid="DEU 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5"/>Migyinaa mo ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ntam, na mekaa Awurade asɛm kyerɛɛ mo efisɛ na musuro ogya no nti, moamforo bepɔw no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:5">Nsɛm a ɔkae no ni:<verse eid="DEU 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6"/>“Mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, a miyii mo fii nkoasom mu wɔ Misraim no.<verse eid="DEU 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7"/>“Monnsom onyame foforo biara nka me ho.<verse eid="DEU 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8"/>Monnyɛ ohoni anaa biribiara a ɛsɛ ade a ɛwɔ wim, anaa nea ɛwɔ asase so, anaa nea ɛwɔ nsu mu, anaa nea ɛwɔ asase ase. <verse eid="DEU 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9"/>Monnkotow ohoni biara nsom no wɔ ɔkwan biara so, na me, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, meyɛ ninkufo a metwe mma a wɔtan me no aso wɔ awofonom bɔne a wɔyɛ no ho kɔ awo ntoatoaso abiɛsa ne anan mu, <verse eid="DEU 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10"/>nanso meda ɔdɔ adi kyerɛ awo ntoatoaso mpem a wɔdɔ me na wodi mʼahyɛde so no.<verse eid="DEU 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11"/>Mommmɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, din basabasa. Sɛ moyɛ saa a, obebu mo fɔ.<verse eid="DEU 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12"/>Monkae homeda na munni no sɛ da kronkron. <verse eid="DEU 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13"/>Nnansia na momfa nyɛ mo nnwuma nyinaa, <verse eid="DEU 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14"/>na da a ɛto so ason no yɛ Homeda ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn. Saa da no, ɛnsɛ sɛ moyɛ adwuma biara; ɛnsɛ sɛ mo mmabarima, mo mmabea anaa mo asomfo anaa mo anantwi ne mo mfurum anaa mo ahɔho yɛ adwuma biara. <verse eid="DEU 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15"/>Monkae sɛ bere bi a atwa mu no na moyɛ nkoa wɔ Misraim na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, nam anwonwatumi ne tumi nnwuma so na oyii mo fii hɔ. Ɛno nti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn hyɛ mo sɛ munni Homeda no.<verse eid="DEU 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16"/>Di wʼagya ne wo na ni sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, ahyɛ mo no, na ama wo nkwanna aware, na asi wo yiye wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wo Nyankopɔn de rema wo no so.<verse eid="DEU 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17"/>Nni awu.<verse eid="DEU 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18"/>Nsɛe aware.<verse eid="DEU 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19"/>Mmɔ korɔn<verse eid="DEU 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20"/>Nni wo yɔnko ho adansekurum<verse eid="DEU 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21"/>Mma wʼani mmere wo yɔnko yere. Mma wʼani mmere wo yɔnko fi anaa nʼasase anaa nʼakoa anaa nʼafenaa, ne nʼanantwi, nʼafurum anaa biribiara a ɛyɛ wo yɔnko dea.”<verse eid="DEU 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22"/>Eyinom ne mmaransɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de nne kɛse a efi ogyaframa no mu pae mu ka kyerɛɛ mo fii omununkum a esum kabii atwa ho ahyia mu wɔ bepɔw no so a wamfa hwee anka ho. Na ɔkyerɛw guu abo pon abien so de maa me.<verse eid="DEU 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23"/>Motee nne no fii esum mu bere a bepɔw no so redɛw ogya framfram no, mmusuakuw mu ntuanofo no nyinaa baa me nkyɛn. <verse eid="DEU 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24"/>Wɔkae se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn, akyerɛ yɛn nʼanuonyam ne ne tumi na yɛate ne nne afi ogya no mu. Nnɛ, yɛahu sɛ, sɛ Onyankopɔn ne onipa kasa koraa a, onipa tumi tena ase. <verse eid="DEU 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25"/>Na afei, adɛn nti na ɛsɛ sɛ yewuwu? Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn, kasa kyerɛ yɛn bio a, akyinnye biara nni ho sɛ yebewu na ogya no ahyew yɛn pasaa. <verse eid="DEU 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26"/>Efisɛ ɔkra teasefo bɛn na wate Onyankopɔn teasefo no nne sɛ ɛrekasa fi ogyaframa no mu na watena ase ana? <verse eid="DEU 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27"/>Kɔ na kotie nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn no, ka no. Na afei, bra na bɛka biribiara a ɔka kyerɛɛ wo no kyerɛ yɛn, na yebetie na yɛadi so.”<verse eid="DEU 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tee mo nne bere a mokasa kyerɛɛ me no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Mate nsɛm a saa nnipa yi ka kyerɛɛ wo no. Nsɛm a wɔkaa no nyinaa ye. <verse eid="DEU 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29"/>Ao, sɛ daa wobenya koma sɛnea ɛbɛma wɔasuro me na wɔadi mʼahyɛde nyinaa so a, anka ebeye ama wɔn ne wɔn asefo nyinaa afebɔɔ.<verse eid="DEU 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30"/>“Kɔ na kɔka kyerɛ wɔn se, wɔnsan mmra wɔn ntamadan mu. <verse eid="DEU 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31"/>Nanso wo de, wo ne me ntena ha sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a metumi de mʼahyɛde ne me mmara ama wo. Wobɛkyerɛkyerɛ nnipa no sɛnea wobetie wɔ asase a mede rema wɔn no so sɛ wɔn agyapade no.”<verse eid="DEU 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32"/>Enti mohwɛ yiye na n monyɛ nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn ahyɛ mo no; momman mfa nifa anaa benkum. <verse eid="DEU 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33"/>Munni nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, ahyɛ mo no nyinaa so na ama moanya nkwa, na asi mo yiye, na no nna aware wɔ asase a morekɔfa no so.<verse eid="DEU 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Dɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Wo Nyankopɔn No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1"/>Eyinom ne ahyɛde, mmara ne nhyehyɛe a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn ka kyerɛɛ me se menkyerɛkyerɛ mo na munni so wɔ asase a moretwa Yordan akɔfa no so, <verse eid="DEU 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2"/>sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a mo mma ne wɔn mma besuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, mmere dodow a mote ase no, na moadi ne mmara ne nʼahyɛde a mede ma mo no nyinaa so nyinaa so a mo nkwanna aware. <verse eid="DEU 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3"/>Muntie, Ao Israel, na monhwɛ yiye nni so sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a ebesi mo yiye na mo ase atrɛw yiye wɔ asase a nufusu ne ɛwo resen wɔ so no so sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo agyanom Nyankopɔn, hyɛɛ mo ho bɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4"/>Tie, Ao Israel, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Nyankopɔn yɛ Awurade koro. <verse eid="DEU 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5"/>Dɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wo Nyankopɔn fi wo koma nyinaa mu ne wo kra nyinaa mu ne wʼahoɔden nyinaa mu. <verse eid="DEU 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6"/>Momma saa mmaransɛm a mede rema wo nnɛ yi ntena mo koma mu. <verse eid="DEU 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7"/>Momfa nhyɛ mo mma mu. Sɛ mote fie anaa monam ɔkwan so, sɛ moda hɔ anaa mosɔre a, monka ho asɛm. <verse eid="DEU 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8"/>Monkyekye no sɛ agyiraehyɛde mmɔ mo nsa na momfa bi mmɔ abotiri. <verse eid="DEU 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9"/>Monkyerɛw ngu mo afi apongua ne mo abobow ano apon so.<verse eid="DEU 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn de mo ba asase a ɔkaa ntam sɛ ɔde bɛma mo agyanom Abraham, Isak ne Yakob no, asase a nkuropɔn a ɛnyɛ mo na mokyekyeree ahyɛ so ma no so, <verse eid="DEU 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11"/>afi a nneɛma pa ahorow a ɛnyɛ mo na moyɛe ahyɛ no ma, mmura a ɛnyɛ mo na mututui, bobeturo a ɛnyɛ mo na moyɛe ne ngonnua a ɛnyɛ mo na muduae no so. Sɛ mudidi mee wɔ saa asase yi so a, <verse eid="DEU 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12"/>monhwɛ yiye na mo werɛ amfi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ogyee mo fii nkoasom mu wɔ Misraim asase so no.<verse eid="DEU 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ musuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, na mosom ɔno nko ara. Ne din nko ara na momfa nka ntam. <verse eid="DEU 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14"/>Munnni anyame foforo akyi; anyame a wɔyɛ nnipa a wɔatwa mo ho ahyia no anyame no; <verse eid="DEU 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15"/>na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn a ɔwɔ mo ntam no yɛ Onyankopɔn ninkufo a nʼabufuw no bɛhyew mo, na ɔbɛsɛe mo afi asase no so. <verse eid="DEU 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16"/>Monnsɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, nhwɛ sɛnea moyɛe bere a na mowɔ Masa no. <verse eid="DEU 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mudi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, ahyɛde ne nea ɛwɔ mmara a ɔde ama mo no mu no so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="DEU 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18"/>Monyɛ de ɛteɛ na eye wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so na biribiara awie mo yiye. Na moakɔ akɔfa asase pa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ ho bɔ kyerɛɛ mo agyanom no, <verse eid="DEU 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19"/>na moapam atamfo a wɔwɔ mo anim no nyinaa sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kae no.<verse eid="DEU 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20"/>Daakye bi, sɛ mo mma bisa mo se, “Saa mmara ne nʼahyɛde a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn, de ama mo yi ase ne dɛn?” <verse eid="DEU 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21"/>a monka nkyerɛ wɔn se, “Na yɛyɛ Farao nkoa wɔ Misraim nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam anwonwatumi so yii yɛn fii Misraim. <verse eid="DEU 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22"/>Yɛn ani tua <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsɛnkyerɛnne ne anwonwade akɛse na ɛyɛ hu a ɔyɛ tiaa Misraim, Farao ne ne nkurɔfo nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23"/>Oyii yɛn fii Misraim sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a, obetumi de asase a wahyɛ yɛn agyanom ho bɔ no ama yɛn. <verse eid="DEU 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Nyankopɔn hyɛɛ yɛn sɛ yenni mmara no nyinaa so na yɛmfa obu ne nidi mma no sɛnea ɛbɛma asi yɛn yiye daakye sɛnea ɛte nnɛ yi. <verse eid="DEU 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25"/>Efisɛ sɛ yedi mmara no nyinaa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn, de ama yɛn no so a, ɛbɛyɛ yɛn trenee.”<verse eid="DEU 6:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔpam Amanaman No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de mo ba asase a morebɛkɔ akɔtena so no so, na ɔpam amanaman pii a wɔwɔ mo anim, a wɔyɛ Hetifo, Girgasifo, Amorifo, Kanaanfo, Perisifo, Hewifo ne Yebusifo, aman ason a wɔwɔ so na wɔyɛ den sen mo, <verse eid="DEU 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2"/>na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de saa aman yi hyɛ mo nsa na mudi wɔn so a, monsɛe wɔn pasapasa. Mo ne wɔn nhyehyɛ apam biara na munnhu wɔn mmɔbɔ. <verse eid="DEU 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3"/>Mo ne wɔn nni aware na mommma mo mmabea ne mo mmabarima nware wɔn mmabarima ne wɔn mmabea. <verse eid="DEU 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4"/>Efisɛ wɔbɛma mo mma asan afi mʼakyi akɔsom wɔn anyame foforo. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuw bɛdɛw atia mo na wasɛe mo ntɛm. <verse eid="DEU 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5"/>Nea ɛsɛ sɛ moyɛ wɔn ne sɛ, mummubu wɔn afɔremuka na munnwiriw wɔn abosom adum no ngu. Muntwitwa wɔn abosompɔw ngu na monhyew wɔn ahoni. <verse eid="DEU 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6"/>Na moyɛ nnipa kronkron a moyɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de. Nnipa a wɔwɔ asase so nyinaa mu no, mo na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, ayi mo sɛ nʼagyapade a ɛsom no bo.<verse eid="DEU 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7"/>Ɛnyɛ sɛ modɔɔso sen nnipa a aka no nti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anya mo ho dɔ no, mo na na musua koraa wɔ nnipa no nyinaa mu. <verse eid="DEU 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8"/>Na mmom, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> dɔɔ mo na odii ne ntam a ɔka kyerɛɛ mo agyanom sɛ ɔde ne nsa a tumi wɔ mu no beyi wɔn afi nkoasom asase so ne Misraimhene Farao tumi ase no. <verse eid="DEU 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9"/>Enti munhu sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, yɛ Onyankopɔn; ɔyɛ nokware Nyankopɔn a odi wɔn a wɔdɔ no na wodi nʼahyɛde so no dɔ apam so kosi awo ntoatoaso apem so. <verse eid="DEU 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10"/>Nanso, ɔntwentwɛn na ɔtwe wɔn a wokyi no no aso, sɛe wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11"/>Ɛno nti, monhwɛ yiye na munni ahyɛde ne mmara a mede rema mo nnɛ yi nyinaa so.<verse eid="DEU 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12"/>Sɛ mutie mmara yi na mudi ne nyinaa so nokware mu a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, nso bedi nʼapam a ofi ne nokware dɔ mu ne mo agyanom pamee no so. <verse eid="DEU 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13"/>Ɔbɛdɔ mo na wahyira mo na wama mo ase afɛe. Obehyira mo yafunu mu ade; mo asase so nnɔbae, mo atoko, nsa foforo ne ngodua, mo nantwimma ne nguamma wɔ asase a ɔkaa ho ntam kyerɛɛ mo agyanom se ɔde bɛma mo no so. <verse eid="DEU 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14"/>Wobehyira mo akyɛn aman a wɔwɔ asase so no nyinaa. Mo mmarima renyɛ asaadwe na mo mmea nso renyɛ abonin na mo nyɛmmoa nso bɛwowo. <verse eid="DEU 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ mo ho ban afi ɔyare nyinaa ho. Ɔremma owuyare a bi bɔɔ mo wɔ Misraim no bi mmɔ mo na ɔde saa ɔyare no nyinaa begu mo atamfo so. <verse eid="DEU 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16"/>Monsɛe aman a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn de bɛhyɛ mo nsa no nyinaa. Munhu wɔn mmɔbɔ na monnsom wɔn anyame. Sɛ moyɛ saa a, ebesum mo afiri.<verse eid="DEU 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17"/>Mubebisa mo ho se, “Na sɛ saa aman yi yɛ den kyɛn yɛn. Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na yɛatumi apam wɔn?” <verse eid="DEU 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18"/>Nanso munnsuro wɔn. Monkae ade a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de yɛɛ Farao ne ne manfo nyinaa wɔ Misraim no. <verse eid="DEU 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19"/>Mode mo ankasa mo ani huu amanehunu, nsɛnkyerɛnne a ɛyɛ hu ne anwonwasɛm a ɛbaa wɔn so, tumi nsa ne abasa a wɔatrɛw mu a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, nam so yii mo fii hɔ no. Nnipa a musuro wɔn mprempren no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Nyankopɔn de wɔn bɛfa saa ɔkwan koro no ara so. <verse eid="DEU 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20"/>Ɛno akyi no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, bɛma mpenaa abɛpam kakra a wɔaka no afi wɔn ahintawee mu kosi sɛ wɔn ase bɛtɔre. <verse eid="DEU 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21"/>Munnsuro saa aman no, efisɛ Awurade, mo Nyankopɔn, a ɔso na ne ho yɛ nwonwa no wɔ mo afa. <verse eid="DEU 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22"/>Nkakrankakra, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, bedi mo anim kan apam saa aman no. Ɔrenyi wɔn nyinaa mfi hɔ prɛko pɛ; anyɛ saa a, nkekaboa no ase bɛdɔ ntɛm na wɔaba mo so. <verse eid="DEU 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23"/>Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de wɔn bɛhyɛ mo nsa, na ɔbɛma wɔn adwene ayɛ basabasa akosi sɛ ɔbɛsɛe wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24"/>Ɔde wɔn ahemfo bɛhyɛ mo nsa na mobɛpepa wɔn din afi ɔsoro ase. Obiara rentumi nsɔre ntia mo; mobɛsɛe wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25"/>Momfa ogya nhyew wɔn anyame ahoni no. Mommma mo ani mmere dwetɛ anaa sikakɔkɔɔ a egugu so no na mommfa; anyɛ saa a ɛbɛyɛ mfiri ayi mo, efisɛ ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, akyiwade. <verse eid="DEU 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26"/>Mommfa akyiwade biara mma mo fi na wɔanyi mo angu nkyɛn amma ɔsɛe sɛ ɛno ara pɛ. Munhu no sɛ enye a wokyi korakora; efisɛ wɔayi ato hɔ ama ɔsɛe.<verse eid="DEU 7:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Mommma Mo Werɛ Mfi <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1"/>Monhwɛ yiye na munni ahyɛde a merema mo nnɛ yi biara so, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a mubenya nkwa na mo ase adɔ dɔɔso na moakɔfa asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa ntam de hyɛɛ mo agyanom bɔ no atena so. <verse eid="DEU 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2"/>Monkae sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn dii mo anim faa sare so mfe aduanan, nam so brɛɛ mo ase de sɔɔ mo suban hwɛe sɛ mubedi ne mmara so anaasɛ morenni so no. <verse eid="DEU 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3"/>Nokware, ɔmaa ɔkɔm dee mo nam so brɛɛ mo ase na ɔmaa mo mana, aduan a na anka mo ne mo agyanom nnii bi da, dii. Ɔyɛɛ saa de kyerɛɛ mo sɛ, ɛnyɛ aduan nko ara na ɛho hia onipa wɔ nʼasetena mu, na mmom, asɛm biara a efi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anom. <verse eid="DEU 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4"/>Mfe aduanan yi nyinaa mu, mo ntade antetew na mo anan ammɔ mpumpunnya na anhonhon nso. <verse eid="DEU 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5"/>Munhu wɔ mo koma mu sɛ, sɛnea ɔbeatan teɛ ne ba no, saa ara nso na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, teɛ mo de siesie mo no.<verse eid="DEU 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6"/>Munni <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, ahyɛde so na monnantew nʼakwan so na momfa nidi mma no. <verse eid="DEU 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7"/>Efisɛ mo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de mo rekɔ asase pa so; asase a nsuten, mmura ne nsuti sen wɔ abon ne mmepɔw mu; <verse eid="DEU 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8"/>asase a atoko, awi, bobe, borɔdɔma, atoaa, ngodua ne ɛwo wɔ so. <verse eid="DEU 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9"/>Ɛyɛ asase a aduan abu wɔ so a wonni biribiara ho hia wɔ so; asase a ɛso abo yɛ adaban na wobetumi atu kɔbere wɔ ne mmepɔw mu.<verse eid="DEU 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10"/>Sɛ mudidi mee a, munhyira <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, wɔ asase pa a ɔde ama mo no nti. <verse eid="DEU 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11"/>Na monhwɛ yiye na mo werɛ amfi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, sɛ morenni ne mmara ne nʼahyɛde a merehyɛ mo nnɛ yi so. <verse eid="DEU 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12"/>Anyɛ saa na sɛ mudidi na momee na musisi mo afi afɛfɛ, na mokɔtenatena mu <verse eid="DEU 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13"/>na mo anantwi ne nguan ase dɔ, na munya dwetɛ ne sika pii, na mo agyapade nyinaa dɔɔso <verse eid="DEU 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14"/>a, saa bere no na ɛsɛ sɛ mohwɛ yiye. Monnyɛ ahomaso na mommma mo werɛ mmfi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn a oyii mo fii Misraim nkoasom asase so no. <verse eid="DEU 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15"/>Ɔno na odii mo anim yii mo fii sare a na ɛso yɛ hu, asase sakoo a osukɔm wɔ so, na awɔ ne nkekantwɛre a wɔn ano wɔ bɔre wɔ so no so. Ɔmaa mo nsu fi ɔbotan mu. <verse eid="DEU 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16"/>Ɔmaa mo mana aduan a mo agyanom nnim dii wɔ sare so. Ɔyɛɛ eyi de brɛɛ mo ase, de sɔɔ mo hwɛe na wama awiei no asi mo yiye. <verse eid="DEU 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17"/>Ɔyɛɛ saa de kyerɛɛ mo sɛ, ɛnsɛ sɛ modwene sɛ mo ahonya no fi mo ankasa mo ahoɔden mu. <verse eid="DEU 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18"/>Daa monkae sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, a ɔma mo tumi ma moyɛ adefo no, ɔyɛ saa de di apam a ɔne mo agyanom hyɛe no so.<verse eid="DEU 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19"/>Sɛ mo werɛ fi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, na mokodi anyame afoforo akyi, som wɔn, kotow wɔn a, sɛe na wɔbɛsɛe mo. <verse eid="DEU 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20"/>Sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛe amanaman a na wɔwɔ mo anim no, mo nso sɛ moantie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no a, saa ara na wɔbɛsɛe mo.<verse eid="DEU 8:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Israel Nkonimdi Fi Onyankopɔn Adom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1"/>Israel, muntie: Morekotwa Yordan na moawura mu akogye aman a ɛsoso na wɔwɔ ahoɔden kyɛn mo na wɔwɔ nkuropɔn akɛse wɔ mu na wɔn afasu kɔka sorosoro no, agyapade. <verse eid="DEU 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2"/>Nnipa no wɔ ahoɔden na wɔwoware; Anakfo! Moate wɔn nka na moate sɛ wɔka se, “Hena na obetumi ne Anakfo agyina?” <verse eid="DEU 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3"/>Nanso merehyɛ mo ase nnɛ sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, na ɔredi mo anim te sɛ ogyaframa a ɛresɛe ade. Ɔbɛsɛe wɔn. Ɔbɛbrɛ wɔn ase wɔ mo anim. Na moapam wɔn na moatɔre wɔn ase ntɛm pa ara sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ mo bɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4"/>Sɛ Awurade, mo Nyankopɔn, tu wɔn gu a, monnka wɔ mo koma mu se, “Esiane yɛn trenee nti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de saa asase yi ama yɛn.” Dabi, ɛyɛ aman no amumɔyɛsɛm nti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> redi mo anim apam wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5"/>Ɛnyɛ sɛ moyɛ atreneefo ne nokwafo nti na morekɔfa wɔn asase no; mmom, efi wɔn amumɔyɛ nti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, bɛpam saa aman yi adi mo anim de ahyɛ ntam a wadi kan aka akyerɛ mo agyanom Abraham, Isak ne Yakob no ma. <verse eid="DEU 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6"/>Monte ase sɛ, ɛnyɛ sɛ moyɛ atreneefo nti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de saa asase pa yi rema mo. Moyɛ ɔman a asoɔden ahyɛ mo ma.<verse eid="DEU 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sikakɔkɔɔ Nantwi Ba No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7"/>Monkae eyi na mommma mo werɛ mmfi sɛnea mohyɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn abufuw wɔ sare so hɔ no. Efi bere a mutu fii Misraim besi sɛ muduu ha yi, moakɔ so atew <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim atua. <verse eid="DEU 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8"/>Mohyɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuw wɔ Horeb a anka ɔpɛ sɛ ɔsɛe mo. <verse eid="DEU 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9"/>Mekɔɔ bepɔw no so sɛ merekogye abo kyerɛwpon a na wɔakyerɛw apam a na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne mo apam no agu so no, metenaa hɔ nnafua aduanan, mannidi na mannom. <verse eid="DEU 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de apam a ɛwɔ abo kyerɛwpon a Onyankopɔn ankasa akyerɛw nsɛm a ofi ogya a ɛwɔ bepɔw no so no mu ka kyerɛɛ mo no nyinaa maa me.<verse eid="DEU 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11"/>Na awia ne anadwo adaduanan no baa awiei no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de abo pon abien a wɔakyerɛw apam no wɔ so no maa me. <verse eid="DEU 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Sian fi ha ntɛm kɔ, efisɛ nnipa a wudii wɔn anim fi Misraim no adan abɔnefo. Wɔaman afi ahyɛde a memaa wɔn no ho na wɔayɛ ohoni afa.”<verse eid="DEU 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Mahwɛ saa nnipa yi ara ahu sɛ, wɔn aso yɛ den pa ara. <verse eid="DEU 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14"/>Ma me kwan na mensɛe na mempepa wɔn din mfi ɔsoro ase. Na menam so mayɛ wʼasefo ɔman kɛse; ɔman a ɛso na ɛwɔ ahoɔden sen sɛnea ɛte nnɛ yi.”<verse eid="DEU 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15"/>Enti misian fii ogya bepɔw no so a na mikura abo apon abien a apam no wɔ so no. <verse eid="DEU 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16"/>Mehwɛe no, mihuu sɛ moayɛ bɔne atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn; Moagu nantwi ba sɛso honi ama mo ho. Moaman afi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kwan a ɔkyerɛɛ mo sɛ momfa so no so ntɛm. <verse eid="DEU 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17"/>Enti memaa ɔbo apon no so kɔɔ soro na metow hwee fam. Mibubuu no wɔ mo anim.<verse eid="DEU 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18"/>Afei, medaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim awia ne anadwo adaduanan a manni brodo, annom nsu. Meyɛɛ eyi, efisɛ sɛ moayɛ ade a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyi nti, moayɛ bɔne na ɛnam so ama ne bo afuw yiye. <verse eid="DEU 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19"/>Misuroo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuw ne so asotwe, efisɛ na ne bo afuw yiye a obetumi asɛe mo. Nanso, otiee me bio. <verse eid="DEU 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuw Aaron a na anka ɔpɛ sɛ ɔsɛe no. Nanso mebɔɔ mpae maa Aaron nso. <verse eid="DEU 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21"/>Mefaa mo bɔne, nantwi ba a moayɛ no, na menan no wɔ gya mu yam no muhumuhu. Metow ne mfutuma no guu asuwa bi a ɛsen fi bepɔw no mu no mu.<verse eid="DEU 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22"/>Mohyɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuw wɔ Tabera, Masa ne Kibrot-Hataawa nso.<verse eid="DEU 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23"/>Kades-Barnea nso, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> somaa mo wɔ saa ɔhyɛ yi so se, “Monkɔ soro hɔ nkɔfa asase a mede ama mo no.” Nanso mubuu <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, ahyɛde so na moamfa mo ho anto no so antie nʼasɛm. <verse eid="DEU 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24"/>Efi bere a mihuu mo no, daa mosɔre tia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="DEU 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25"/>Ɛno nti na bere a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sii nʼadwene pi sɛ ɔbɛsɛe mo no, mekɔdaa nʼanim awia ne anadwo nnafua aduanan no. <verse eid="DEU 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26"/>Mebɔɔ mpae srɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, “Otumfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, nsɛe wo man ne wʼagyapade a wode wo kɛseyɛ agye asi hɔ na wode wo nsa a ɛyɛ den ayi wɔn afi Misraim no. <verse eid="DEU 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27"/>Yi wʼani fi saa nnipa yi komapirim ne asoɔden ne wɔn bɔne so na kae wo nkoa Abraham, Isak ne Yakob. <verse eid="DEU 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28"/>Anyɛ saa a, Misraimfo no bɛka se, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛee wɔn, efisɛ wantumi amfa wɔn ankɔ asase a ɔkaa ntam sɛ ɔde bɛma wɔn no so. Anaasɛ nso, wɔbɛka se, ɔsɛee wɔn, efisɛ ɔtan wɔn; ɔde wɔn baa sare so sɛ ɔrekokunkum wɔn.’ <verse eid="DEU 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29"/>Nanso wɔyɛ wo nkurɔfo ne wʼagyapade a wonam tumi a ɛso ne wʼabasa a woatrɛw mu so yii wɔn.”<verse eid="DEU 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Abo Pon Foforo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1"/>Saa bere no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Twa abo apon no abien te sɛ kan de no na foro bra me nkyɛn wɔ bepɔw no so. Afei, yɛ dua adaka a wobɛkora wɔ mu. <verse eid="DEU 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2"/>Mɛkyerɛw nsɛm a mekyerɛw guu abo apon abien a edi kan a wububuu mu no bi pɛpɛɛpɛ agu so. Na fa hyɛ adaka no mu.”<verse eid="DEU 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3"/>Na mede dua ɔkanto yɛɛ adaka, sen abo apon abien sɛ kan de no, na meforoo bepɔw no a na mikura apon abien no. <verse eid="DEU 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛw nsɛm a wakyerɛw bi dedaw, Mmaransɛm Du, a ɔkaa ho asɛm kyerɛɛ mo fi ogya mu wɔ bepɔw no so wɔ mo nhyiamu ase no guu apon no so. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de maa me. <verse eid="DEU 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5"/>Na misan fii bepɔw no so na mede abo apon no bɛhyɛɛ adaka a mayɛ no mu sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ me sɛ menyɛ no, na ɛwɔ hɔ besi nnɛ.<verse eid="DEU 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6"/>Na Israelfo tu fii Beerot-Bene-Yaakan mmura ho kɔɔ Mosera. Ɛhɔ na Aaron wu ma wosiee no. Aaron babarima Eleasar sii nʼanan mu dii sɔfo. <verse eid="DEU 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7"/>Wofi hɔ tu kɔɔ Gudgod. Wofi Gudgod no, wɔkɔɔ Yotbata, asase a nsuten pii wɔ so. <verse eid="DEU 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8"/>Ɛhɔ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yii Lewifo abusuakuw sɛ wɔnsoa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apam adaka no na wonnyina <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim nsom no na wɔmfa ne din so nhyira, sɛnea wɔyɛ no nnɛ yi. <verse eid="DEU 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9"/>Ɛno nti na Lewifo no nni agyapade wɔ wɔn mfɛfo Israelfo no mu no. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no ankasa ne wɔn agyapade sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, ka kyerɛɛ wɔn no.<verse eid="DEU 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10"/>Na metenaa bepɔw no so wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim adaduanan, awia ne anadwo sɛnea meyɛɛ kan no. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tiee me bio. Na ɛnyɛ ne pɛ sɛ ɔbɛsɛe mo. <verse eid="DEU 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Sɔre na di nnipa no anim fa wɔn kɔ asase a mekaa ntam sɛ mede bɛma wɔn agyanom no so na wɔmfa no sɛ agyapade.”<verse eid="DEU 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Munsuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12"/>Na afei, Israel, dɛn na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, hwehwɛ afi mo nkyɛn? Ɔhwehwɛ sɛ musuro no na moyɛ nʼapɛde, na mode mo koma ne mo kra nyinaa dɔ no na mosom no, <verse eid="DEU 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13"/>na mudi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛde ne ne mmara a mede rema mo nnɛ yi so, na asi mo yiye.<verse eid="DEU 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14"/>Ɔsorosoro mu soro ne asase ne nea ɛwɔ mu nyinaa yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de. <verse eid="DEU 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15"/>Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nyaa abadae maa mo agyanom na ɔdɔ wɔn, na ɔpaw mo a moyɛ wɔn asefo gyaa aman nyinaa sɛnea ɛte nnɛ yi. <verse eid="DEU 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16"/>Ɛno nti, monhohoro mo koma mu bɔne na munnyae asoɔden no. <verse eid="DEU 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, yɛ ahene mu hene ne anyame mu nyame. Ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn kɛse, otumfo ne ɔnwonwani a ɔnkyea nʼaso na onnye adanmude nso. <verse eid="DEU 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18"/>Ɔko ma nyisaa ne akunafo, na ɔdɔ ahɔho a wɔte mo mu. Ɔma wɔn aduan ne ntama. <verse eid="DEU 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19"/>Mo nso, ɛsɛ sɛ modɔ ahɔho, efisɛ bere bi na mo ankasa nso yɛ ahɔho wɔ Misraim asase so. <verse eid="DEU 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20"/>Munsuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, na mosom no. Moka mo ho mmata ne ho, na mo ntam a moka nyɛ ne din nko ara. <verse eid="DEU 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21"/>Ɔyɛ mo Nyankopɔn a ɛsɛ sɛ mokamfo no. Ɔno na wayɛ anwonwade akɛse a mo nyinaa ahu bi. <verse eid="DEU 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22"/>Na mo agyanom a wɔkɔɔ Misraim no nyinaa dodow yɛ aduɔson. Nanso afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no ama mo ase adɔ te sɛ soro nsoromma.<verse eid="DEU 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Monnɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Na Muntie No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1"/>Monnɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn na munni nʼapɛde, ne mmara ne nʼahyɛde so bere nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2"/>Nnɛ, muntie, sɛ ɛnyɛ mo mma na wonyaa osuahu, huu <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no nteɛso, ne tumi, ne basa kɛse, ne nsa a wateɛ mu; <verse eid="DEU 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3"/>nsɛnkyerɛnne a ɔyɛe ne nneɛma a ɔyɛɛ wɔ Misraim pɛɛ maa bi kaa Misraimhene Farao ne ɔman mu no nyinaa no; <verse eid="DEU 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4"/>dwuma a odii Misraim asraafo, wɔn apɔnkɔ ne wɔn nteaseɛnam no; sɛnea ɔmaa Po Kɔkɔɔ yiri faa wɔn bere a wɔtaa mo no ne sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛee wɔn bere a wɔtaa mo no; ne sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ɔsɛe a to ntwa baa wɔn so no. <verse eid="DEU 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5"/>Ɛnyɛ mo mma na wohuu nea ɔyɛ maa mo wɔ sare so hɔ de kosii sɛ mubeduu ha yi; <verse eid="DEU 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6"/>ne nea ɔde yɛɛ Eliab a na ɔyɛ Rubenni no mma Datan ne Abiram bere a ɔmma asase buee nʼanom wɔ mo Israelfo no anim menee wɔn ne wɔn afi ne wɔn ntamadan ne biribiara a na ɛyɛ wɔn agyapade a nkwa wɔ mu no. <verse eid="DEU 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7"/>Mmom, ɛyɛ mo ankasa mo ani na mode ahu saa nneɛma akɛse a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayɛ yi nyinaa.<verse eid="DEU 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8"/>Enti munni mmara a merehyɛ mo nnɛ yi nyinaa so sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a mubenya ahoɔden akɔfa asase a morebetwa Yordan akɔ so akɔfa yi, <verse eid="DEU 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9"/>na mo nna aware asase a nufusu ne ɛwo sen wɔ so a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa ntam kyerɛɛ mo agyanom sɛ ɔde bɛma wɔn ne wɔn asefo no so. <verse eid="DEU 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10"/>Asase a morekɔ so akɔfa no nte sɛ Misraim asase a mufi so bae no a na mudua nnɔbae a mode mo nan twa suka te sɛnea moyɛ atomude turo no. <verse eid="DEU 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11"/>Na asase a moretwa Yordan akɔfa no yɛ mmepɔw ne abon a enya osu a efi ɔsoro. <verse eid="DEU 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12"/>Ɛyɛ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, ani wɔ ho. Daa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, ani wɔ so fi afe no mfiase de kosi nʼawie.<verse eid="DEU 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13"/>Sɛ mufi nokwaredi mu di mmara a merehyɛ ama mo nnɛ yi so sɛ mode mo koma ne mo kra nyinaa bɛdɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, na moasom no a, <verse eid="DEU 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14"/>ɛno de, ɔbɛtɔ osu agu no asase so ne bere mu ama mo, na moatumi atwa mo awi, nsa foforo ne ngo. <verse eid="DEU 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15"/>Ɔbɛma mo sare pii na mo anantwi awe na mo nso mubedidi amee.<verse eid="DEU 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16"/>Monhwɛ yiye, anyɛ saa a wɔbɛtwetwe mo ama moakɔsom anyame afoforo na moakotow wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17"/>Ɛno na ɛbɛma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuw ahuru atia mo; na ɔbɛto ɔsoro mu, na osu rentɔ, na asase remmɔ aduan biara, na ɛrenkyɛ na moawuwu afi asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de rema mo no so. <verse eid="DEU 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18"/>Enti momma me nsɛm yi ntim wɔ mo koma ne mo adwene mu. Momfa nkyekyere mo nsa sɛ nkae ade na momfa mmɔ abotiri. <verse eid="DEU 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19"/>Monkyerɛkyerɛ mo mma na monka ho asɛm nkyerɛ wɔn bere a mote fie ne bere a monam akwan so; bere a modeda hɔ ne bere a mosɔre. <verse eid="DEU 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20"/>Monkyerɛw ngu mo afi apongua ne mo abobow ano apon so, <verse eid="DEU 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21"/>sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔsoro da so kata asase ani yi, mo ne mo mma nkwa bɛware wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa ho ntam sɛ ɔde bɛma mo agyanom no so.<verse eid="DEU 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22"/>Sɛ mudi ahyɛde ahorow a mede rema mo sɛ munni so; sɛ monnɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, nyɛ osetie mma no na munni no ni, yi so pɛpɛɛpɛ a, <verse eid="DEU 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23"/>ɛno de, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛpam saa aman yi nyinaa wɔ mo anim, na mubetu aman a ɛsoso na wɔyɛ den sen mo no agu. <verse eid="DEU 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24"/>Baabiara a mode mo anan betia no bɛyɛ mo de. Mo ahye bɛtrɛw afi sare so akosi Lebanon, na afi Asubɔnten Eufrate akosi Ntam Po no. <verse eid="DEU 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25"/>Obiara rentumi nsɔre ntia mo, efisɛ sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, ahyɛ bɔ no, ɔde mo ho huboa ne osuro bɛto asase no nyinaa so wɔ baabiara a mobɛkɔ.<verse eid="DEU 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26"/>Hwɛ, nnɛ mede nhyira ne nnome resi mo anim; <verse eid="DEU 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27"/>sɛ mudi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, mmara a merehyɛ ama mo nnɛ yi so a, ɛbɛyɛ nhyira. <verse eid="DEU 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28"/>Na sɛ mopo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn mmara dan fi nʼakwan a merehyɛ mo nnɛ yi so, kɔsom anyame afoforo a, ɛbɛyɛ nnome. <verse eid="DEU 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29"/>Na sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de mo du asase a morekɔ so akɔfa no a, monka nhyira nsɛm mfi Gerisim Bepɔw no so na monka nnome nsɛm nso mfi Ebal Bepɔw so. <verse eid="DEU 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30"/>Sɛnea munim no, mmepɔw abien yi wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan agya wɔ atɔe fam, a ɛkyerɛ owitɔe na ɛbɛn More kwae wɔ Kanaanfo a wɔte Araba no asase so; faako a wɔn ani tua Gilgal no. <verse eid="DEU 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31"/>Moreyɛ atwa Yordan akɔfa asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de rema mo no. Sɛ mokɔfa saa asase no kɔtena so a, <verse eid="DEU 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32"/>monhwɛ yiye na munni mmara ne ahyɛde ahorow a mede rema mo nnɛ yi no nyinaa so.<verse eid="DEU 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Baabi A <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Ayi Ama Ɔsom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1"/>Eyinom ne mmara ne ahyɛde a ɛsɛ sɛ mohwɛ na mudi so, mmere dodow a mote asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo agyanom Nyankopɔn, de ama mo no so. <verse eid="DEU 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2"/>Sɛ mutu aman a wɔtete hɔ no fi hɔ a, mosɛe mmeae ahorow bi sɛ mmepɔw atifi, nkoko so, ne nnua a atrɛtrɛw no ase a wɔsom wɔn anyame no nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3"/>Mummubu wɔn afɔremuka nyinaa na monyam wɔn ɔsom adum no. Momfa ogya nhyew wɔn abosompɔw na mommobɔ wɔn ahoni a wɔayeyɛ no. Mompepa wɔn ahoni no din mfi mmeae ahorow a ɛwɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4"/>Mommfa wɔn akwan no so nsom <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn. <verse eid="DEU 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5"/>Na mmom, monhwehwɛ faako a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, beyi afi mo mmusuakuw mu ama mo no na munnyina ne din wɔ hɔ sɛ nʼatenae. Beae hɔ na ɛsɛ sɛ mokɔ. <verse eid="DEU 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6"/>Ɛhɔ na momfa mo hyew afɔrebɔde mmra mmɛbɔ a mo ntotoso du du, akyɛde sononko, ade a moaka ho ntam sɛ mode bɛba ne afɔrebɔde a efi mo pɛ mu, mo anantwi ne mo nguan mu mmakan nso nka ho. <verse eid="DEU 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7"/>Ɛhɔ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no anim hɔ no, na mo ne mo abusuafo bedidi na mo ani agye wɔ biribiara a mode mo nsa aka ho, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, ahyira mo.<verse eid="DEU 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8"/>Nnɛ yi, nea mopɛ biara na moyɛ, nanso ɛnsɛ sɛ ɛba saa, <verse eid="DEU 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9"/>efisɛ munnuu ahomegyebea ne agyapade a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de rebɛma mo no hɔ ɛ. <verse eid="DEU 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10"/>Nanso mubetwa Asubɔnten Yordan akɔtena asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de rema mo sɛ agyapade no so. Na ɔbɛma mo ahomegye ne bammɔ afi mo atamfo a wɔatwa mo ho ahyia no nsam na moatena ase dwoodwoo. <verse eid="DEU 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11"/>Momfa biribiara a mehyɛ mo sɛ momfa mmra sɛ ɛyɛ mo ɔhyew afɔrebɔde, ntotoso du du, akyɛde sononko ne mo ɔma ahorow no mfa nhyɛ mo ntanka no mu kena wɔ beae a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, beyi ama mo a sɛ monsɔre ne din wɔ hɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12"/>Mo ne mo mmabarima, mo mmabea ne mo nkoa nyinaa nnye mo ani wɔ hɔ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim. Na monkae Lewifo a wɔtete mo nkurow so no a wonni wɔn ankasa agyapade no. <verse eid="DEU 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13"/>Monhwɛ yiye na moammɔ mo hyew afɔre wɔ baabiara a mopɛ. <verse eid="DEU 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14"/>Mommɔ wɔ baabi pɔtee a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi afi mo mmusua asase bi mu ama mo no nkutoo. Ɛhɔ na monyɛ biribiara a mehyɛ mo sɛ monyɛ no.<verse eid="DEU 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15"/>Nanso kurow biara a mopɛ so no, mutumi kum mmoa we sɛnea mukum atwe ne adabɔ no. Mutumi we nam dodow biara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de behyira mo no. Wɔn a wɔn ho tew ne wɔn a wɔn ho ntew no nyinaa tumi we bi. <verse eid="DEU 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16"/>Nanso ɛnsɛ sɛ mudi mogya no. Muntwa ngu fam te sɛ nsu. <verse eid="DEU 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ mudi mo afɔre, ntotoso du du a efi mo atoko mu, mo nsa foforo ne ngo anaa mo anantwi ne mo nguan abakan wɔ mo kurow mu. Biribiara a moaka ho ntam sɛ mode bɛma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anaa nea mufi mo koma mu ahyɛ ho bɔ anaa akyɛde sononko biara no, ɛnsɛ sɛ mudi. <verse eid="DEU 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18"/>Mmom, ɛsɛ sɛ mudi wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, anim wɔ faako a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛkyerɛ mo a mo, mo mmabarima ne mo mmabea, mo nkoa ne mo mfenaa ne Lewifo a wofi mo nkurow mu ka ho no, munnye mo ani wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim wɔ biribiara a mobɛyɛ no ho. <verse eid="DEU 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19"/>Monhwɛ yiye na moanyi Lewifo no mu wɔ mmere dodow a mote mo asase so no.<verse eid="DEU 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, trɛw mo hye mu sɛnea wahyɛ mo ho bɔ no, na sɛ mo kɔn dɔ nam ka se, “Yenya nam bi a anka yɛbɛwe” a, ɛno de, mubetumi awe nam dodow biara a mopɛ. <verse eid="DEU 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21"/>Sɛ faako a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, ayi ama mo sɛ monkamfo ne din hɔ no ne mmeae a mowɔ no ntam ware a, mutumi kum mo anantwi anaa nguan a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ama mo no dodow biara a mopɛ no wɔ mo afi mu sɛnea mahyɛ mo no. <verse eid="DEU 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22"/>Monwe sɛnea mowe atwe anaa adabɔ. Wɔn a wɔn ho ntew ne wɔn a wɔn ho tew no nyinaa tumi we bi. <verse eid="DEU 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23"/>Monhwɛ sɛ morenni mogya no, efisɛ mogya no ne nkwa no, na ɛnsɛ sɛ mudi nkwa no ne nam no. <verse eid="DEU 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24"/>Munni mogya no; mmom, munhwie ngu fam sɛ nsu. <verse eid="DEU 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25"/>Munnni mogya no na asi mo ne mo mma yiye, efisɛ moyɛ saa a na moayɛ nea ɛteɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so.<verse eid="DEU 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26"/>Momfa mo nneɛma a moatew ho ne nea moaka ho ntam sɛ mobɛma biara no, na monkɔ beae a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛpaw no. <verse eid="DEU 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27"/>Momfa mo ɔhyew afɔre, nam ne mogya no nyinaa, ngu Awurade, mo Nyankopɔn no, afɔremuka so. Ɛsɛ sɛ muhwie mo afɔrebɔde no mogya no gu <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, afɔremuka no nkyɛn. Mmom, mubetumi awe nam no. <verse eid="DEU 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28"/>Monhwɛ sɛ mubedi mmara ahorow a mede rema mo yi nyinaa so, na asi mo ne mo mma a wɔbɛba wɔ mo akyi no yiye, efisɛ ɛno na ɛbɛyɛ nea eye ne nea ɛteɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no ani so.<verse eid="DEU 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bedi mo anim kan akɔsɛe aman a morekɔtoa wɔn no na mopam wɔn. Na sɛ mopam wɔn kɔtena wɔn nsase no so, <verse eid="DEU 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30"/>na sɛ wonya di mo anim sɛe wɔn a, monhwɛ yiye na moammisa wɔn anyame no ase anka se, “Ɔkwan bɛn so na saa aman yi fa som wɔn anyame? Yɛpɛ sɛ yɛyɛ saa bi,” amfa so ankɔtɔ afiri mu. <verse eid="DEU 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31"/>Mommfa wɔn kwan so nsom <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, efisɛ wɔn anyame no som mu no, wɔyɛ akyiwade ahorow a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyi no nyinaa mpɛ. Mpo, wɔhyew wɔn mmabarima ne wɔn mmabea wɔ ogya sɛ wɔde rebɔ afɔre ama wɔn anyame no.<verse eid="DEU 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32"/>Monhwɛ sɛ mubedi nea mahyɛ mo no nyinaa so; mommfa bi nka ho na munnyi bi nso mfi mu.<verse eid="DEU 12:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Ahonisom Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1"/>Sɛ odiyifo anaa obi a ɔnam adaeso so ka ahintasɛm sɔre wɔ mo mu na ɔka nsɛnkyerɛnne a ɛyɛ hu ne anwonwasɛm kyerɛ mo, <verse eid="DEU 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2"/>na sɛ nsɛnkyerɛnne anaa anwonwasɛm no ba mu na ɔka se, “Momma yenni anyame afoforo akyi (anyame a munnim wɔn) na yɛnsom wɔn” a, <verse eid="DEU 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3"/>ɛnsɛ sɛ mutie saa odiyifo anaa ɔdaesofo no nsɛm. <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, resɔ mo ahwɛ sɛ mufi mo koma ne mo kra mu nyinaa dɔ no ana. <verse eid="DEU 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, na ɛsɛ sɛ mudi nʼakyi na ɔno na ɛsɛ sɛ mode obu ne nidi ma no. Munni ne mmara so na monyɛ osetie mma no; monsom no na mommata ne ho den. <verse eid="DEU 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wokum saa odiyifo anaa ɔdaesofo no, efisɛ ɔkasa tia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, a oyii mo fii Misraim nkoasom asase no so no; wayere ne ho sɛ ɔpɛ sɛ ɔtwe mo fi ɔkwan a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, ahyɛ sɛ momfa so no so. Ɛsɛ sɛ mututu abɔnefo nyinaa fi mo mu.<verse eid="DEU 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6"/>Sɛ wo nuabarima, wo babarima, wo babea, wo yere a wodɔ no anaa wʼadamfo pa bi fa sum ase twetwe wo, ka kyerɛ wo se, “Momma yɛnkɔsom anyame afoforo, anyame a wo anaa wʼagyanom nhuu bi da,” <verse eid="DEU 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7"/>anyame a ɛyɛ nnipa a atwa wo ho ahyia no de, sɛ wɔbɛn anaa wɔwɔ akyiri, fi asase ano kosi ano no a, <verse eid="DEU 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8"/>mommfa wo ho mma no anaasɛ ntie no. Nhu no mmɔbɔ. Mfa ne ho nkyɛ no na mmɔ ne ho ban nso. <verse eid="DEU 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9"/>Kum na ɛsɛ sɛ mukum no. Mo nsa na momma enni kan wɔ ne kum no mu ansa na nnipa nyinaa de wɔn nsa abɛka ho. <verse eid="DEU 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10"/>Munsiw no abo nkum no, efisɛ ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔtwe mo fi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, a oyii mo fii Misraim nkoasom asase so no ho. <verse eid="DEU 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11"/>Afei, Israel nyinaa bɛte na wɔasuro na obiara nni hɔ a obefi mo mu a, ɔbɛyɛ saa ade no bio.<verse eid="DEU 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12"/>Sɛ ɛba sɛ mote wɔ nkurow a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de rema mo no baako so sɛ <verse eid="DEU 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13"/>nnipa bɔnefo bi asɔre wɔ wɔn mu adi nnipa a wɔwɔ kurow no mu anim de wɔn akosi bɔne mu aka se, “Momma yɛnkɔsom anyame afoforo,” anyame a munhuu bi da a, <verse eid="DEU 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14"/>ɛsɛ sɛ mubisa mu, hwehwɛ mu yiye. Na sɛ ɛyɛ nokware na sɛ nhwehwɛmu ada no adi sɛ nneyɛe bɔne bi akɔ so wɔ mo mu a, <verse eid="DEU 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15"/>ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde afoa kunkum wɔn a wɔwɔ kurow no mu nyinaa. Monsɛe kurow no pasapasa, emu nnipa ne nyɛmmoa. <verse eid="DEU 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16"/>Afei, mommoaboa asade no nyinaa ano wɔ kurow no aguabɔbea na monhyew no. Monhyew kurow mu no ne emu nneɛma nyinaa mma ɛnyɛ sɛ ɔhyew afɔre mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no. Saa kurow no nyɛ amamfo daa; ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔsan kyekyere bio. <verse eid="DEU 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17"/>Asade a wɔde agu nkyɛn sɛ wɔbɛsɛe no no, mommfa bi. Saayɛ na ɛbɛma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adan afi nʼabufuwhyew no ho na wahu mo mmɔbɔ. Ne yam bɛhyehye no ama mo na wama mo adɔ sɛnea ɔkaa ntam hyɛɛ mo agyanom bɔ no, <verse eid="DEU 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18"/>efisɛ moyɛ osetie ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, na mudi ne mmara a mede rema mo nnɛ yi so na moyɛ nea ɛsɔ nʼani.<verse eid="DEU 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Nnuan A Ɛho Tew Ne Nea Ɛho Ntew</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1"/>Moyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, mma. Ɛno nti monnsesa mo ho anaa monntworɔtworɔw mo moma so mma awufo, <verse eid="DEU 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2"/>efisɛ, moyɛ nnipa kronkron ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no. Nnipa a wɔwɔ asase so nyinaa, mo na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi mo sɛ nʼagyapade a ɛsom bo.<verse eid="DEU 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3"/>Munnni akyiwade biara. <verse eid="DEU 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4"/>Eyinom ne mmoa a ɛsɛ sɛ mowe: nantwi, oguan, abirekyi <verse eid="DEU 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5"/>ɔforote, adowa, ɔwansan, ewi, ɔtwe, ne ɛko. <verse eid="DEU 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6"/>Na munni tɔteboa biara a ne tɔte mu apae abien na opuw wosaw. <verse eid="DEU 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7"/>Nanso ntɔteboa a wopuw wosaw anaa wɔn tɔte mu apae abien no mu no, monnwe yoma, adanko ne atwaboa, efisɛ, wopuw wosaw de, nanso wɔn tɔte mu mpae; wɔn ho ntew mma mo. <verse eid="DEU 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8"/>Prako nso ho ntew. Ɛwɔ mu sɛ ne tɔte mu apae de, nanso ompuw nwosaw. Ɛnsɛ sɛ mowe ne nam anaa mode mo nsa so ne funu mu koraa.<verse eid="DEU 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9"/>Nsumnam a wɔwɔ ntɛtɛ ne abon nyinaa mutumi we. <verse eid="DEU 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10"/>Nanso nsumnam a wonni ntɛtɛ ne abon de, monnwe. Wɔn ho ntew mma mo.<verse eid="DEU 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11"/>Anomaa biara a ne ho tew no, monwe. <verse eid="DEU 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12"/>Nnomaa a ɛnsɛ sɛ mowe ni: ɔkɔre, opete, asu so kɔre, <verse eid="DEU 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13"/>ɔkompete, nkorɔma ahorow nyinaa <verse eid="DEU 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14"/>kwaakwaadabi ahorow nyinaa, <verse eid="DEU 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15"/>sohori, anadwo akoroma, ɛpo so asomfena ne akoroma ahorow nyinaa, <verse eid="DEU 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16"/>patu, ɔpatukɛse, bakanoma <verse eid="DEU 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17"/>nantwinoma, opete ne ɛpo so kwaakwaadabi, <verse eid="DEU 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18"/>ne asukɔnkɔn ahorow nyinaa, asuɔkwaa ne ampan.<verse eid="DEU 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19"/>Ntummoa a wɔwea nyinaa ho ntew mma mo; monnwe. <verse eid="DEU 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20"/>Nanso aboa a ɔwɔ ntaban a ne ho tew biara no motumi we.<verse eid="DEU 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21"/>Monnwe aboa biara a mubehu sɛ wawu. Momfa mma ɔhɔho a ɔne mo te, anaasɛ montɔn ma ɔnanani. Na mo ankasa de, monnwe, efisɛ wɔayi mo asi nkyɛn sɛ ɔman kronkron ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">Monnnoa abirekyi ba wɔ ne na nufusu mu.<verse eid="DEU 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntotoso Du Du Ho Mmara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22"/>Afe biara monhwɛ na munyi mo mfuw mu nnɔbae nkyɛmu du mu baako. <verse eid="DEU 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23"/>Munni mo atoko, nsa, ne ngo, ne mo anantwi ne nguan abakan wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim wɔ faako a ɔbɛpaw sɛ ɛyɛ atenae wɔ ne din mu na ama moasua sɛnea wosi di <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no ni daa. <verse eid="DEU 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24"/>Sɛ beae a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛkyerɛ mo sɛ monkamfo ne din no ne nea mote no ntam kwan ware a, <verse eid="DEU 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25"/>ɛno de, momfa mo ntotoso du du no nsesa dwetɛ na momfa dwetɛ no nkɔ beae a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛpaw no. <verse eid="DEU 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26"/>Sɛ mudu hɔ a, momfa sika no ntɔ biribiara a mo kɔn dɔ, sɛ ebia, nantwi, oguan, bobesa, anaa nsa biara a ɛyɛ den ne ade biara a mo kra pɛ na mo ne mo fifo nni wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim na mo ani nnye. <verse eid="DEU 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27"/>Na mummu mo ani ngu Lewifo a wɔfra mo mu no so, efisɛ wonni wɔn ankasa wɔn agyapade biara.<verse eid="DEU 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28"/>Mfe abiɛsa biara awiei no, momfa mo nnɔbae so ntotoso du du no mmra mmɛkora wɔ mo nkurow mu, <verse eid="DEU 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29"/>sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a Lewifo a wonni agyapade mu kyɛfa wɔ mo mu no ne ananafo a wɔwɔ mo nkurow so ne nyisaa ne akunafo a wɔwɔ mo nkurow so no betumi adidi amee; na ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, ahyira mo nsa ano nnwuma nyinaa so.<verse eid="DEU 14:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Aka Mu Twa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1"/>Muntwa mo aka mu mfe ason awiei biara. <verse eid="DEU 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2"/>Ɔkwan a ɛsɛ sɛ mofa so ni: Ɛsɛ sɛ obiara a wabɔ ne yɔnko Israelni bosea no, de kyɛ no. Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔdan ne yɔnko no anaa ne busuani ka, efisɛ wɔapae mu aka <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bere a wɔde ka kyɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3"/>Saa ka a wotwa mu yi ka mo yɔnkonom Israelfo no nko ara. Ahɔho a wɔte mo mu no de, sɛ mopɛ a mobɛma wɔn atua. <verse eid="DEU 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4"/>Mmom, ɛnsɛ sɛ ahiafo ba mo mu efisɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no behyira mo wɔ asase a ɔde rema mo sɛ mo agyapade no so, <verse eid="DEU 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5"/>sɛ motɔ mo bo ase di <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, mmara a mede rema mo nnɛ yi nyinaa so a. <verse eid="DEU 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6"/>Efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, behyira mo sɛnea wahyɛ mo bɔ no. Mobɛbɔ aman bebree bosea, nanso moremmɔ obiara hɔ bosea da. Mubedi aman bebree so, nanso obiara renni mo so da.<verse eid="DEU 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7"/>Sɛ mudu nkurow a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo no so na sɛ ehia mo yɔnkonom Israelfo no bi a, mummpirim mo koma anaa mommma mo nsam nyɛ den wɔ wɔn so. <verse eid="DEU 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8"/>Mmom, mungow mo nsam na momfɛm wɔn nea ehia wɔn biara. <verse eid="DEU 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9"/>Monhwɛ na moannya saa adwemmɔne yi wɔ mo tirim sɛ: “Afe a ɛto so ason, afe a wotwa aka mu no, abɛn,” na moannyina so ammɔ mo mfɛfo Israelfo a ahia wɔn no atirimɔden a moremma wɔn hwee. Ɛba saa a, wobesu afrɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de atia mo, na ɛbɛma wɔabu mo bɔne ho fɔ. <verse eid="DEU 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10"/>Mumfi koma pa mu mma na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, behyira mo wɔ mo nnwuma nyinaa ne biribiara a mode mo nsa bɛka no mu. <verse eid="DEU 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11"/>Bere biara, mubehu ahiafo wɔ asase no so. Ɛno nti merehyɛ mo sɛ, biribiara a mowɔ no, mumfi ɔpɛ pa mu mma mo mfɛfo Israelfo a ahia wɔn wɔ asase no so no.<verse eid="DEU 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asomfo Ahofadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12"/>Sɛ wo nua Hebrini, sɛ ɔyɛ barima anaa ɔbea, tɔn ne ho ma wo na ɔsom wo mfirihyia asia a, ɛsɛ sɛ wugyaa no ma ɔde ne ho afe a ɛto so ason no. <verse eid="DEU 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13"/>Na sɛ woregya no kwan a, mma no nkɔ nsapan. <verse eid="DEU 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14"/>Fa nsa a emu gow so ma no wo nguan no bi, wʼawiporowbea mu ade ne wo nsakyi amoa mu ade bi. Hwɛ sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Nyankopɔn no, asi ahyira wo no so na ma no. <verse eid="DEU 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15"/>Monkae sɛ na moyɛ nkoa wɔ Misraim na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, yii mo fii hɔ. Ɛno nti na mede saa mmara yi rema mo nnɛ yi.<verse eid="DEU 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16"/>Na sɛ ɛba sɛ wʼakoa ka kyerɛ wo se, “Merennyaw wo hɔ nkɔ,” efisɛ ɔpɛ wo ne wʼabusuafo asɛm na ne ho tɔ no wɔ wo nkyɛn a, <verse eid="DEU 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17"/>ɛno de, fa fitii bɔre nʼaso mu na ɔnyɛ wʼakoa daa. Wo mfenaa nso, yɛ wɔn saa ara.<verse eid="DEU 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18"/>Momma no nyɛ wo den sɛ mubegyaa mo asomfo no ama wɔafa wɔn ho akodi. Monkae sɛ, mfe asia a wɔasom mo no sɛ wokɔfaa apaafo sɛ wɔnsom mo a, anka mubetua apaafo no sika mmɔho abien na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, behyira mo wɔ biribiara a moyɛ ho.<verse eid="DEU 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmoa Mmakan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19"/>Munyi mo anantwi ne mo nguan mmakan anini no nsi hɔ mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no. Mo anantwi mmakan no, mommfa wɔn nkɔ mo mfuw mu nkɔyɛ adwuma, na munntwitwa mo nguan mmakan ho nwi nso. <verse eid="DEU 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20"/>Mmom, mo ne mo abusuafo na afe biara monwe saa mmoa yi wɔ baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛpaw ama mo no wɔ nʼanim. <verse eid="DEU 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21"/>Na sɛ ɛba sɛ abakan no bi adi dɛm, sɛ ebia, ɔtɔ apakye anaa nʼani afura anaa wadi dɛm foforo bi a, mommfa no mmɔ afɔre mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no. <verse eid="DEU 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22"/>Mmom, momfa no nyɛ aduan mma abusuafo wɔ fie. Sɛ obi ho tew o, sɛ ne ho ntew o, otumi di bi sɛnea obiara tumi we ɔtwe anaa ɔdabɔ nam no. <verse eid="DEU 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23"/>Nanso ɛnsɛ sɛ mudi mogya no. Munhwie ngu fam te sɛ nsu.<verse eid="DEU 15:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Twam Afahyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1"/>Daa munni Twam Afahyɛ no wɔ ɔsram Abib<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrifo ɔsram Abib no taa si wɔ Ɔbɛnem ne Oforisuo ntam.</char></note> no mu mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, efisɛ ɔsram Abib mu da bi anadwo na Onyankopɔn yii mo fii Misraim. <verse eid="DEU 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2"/>Munkum anantwi anaa nguan sɛ Twam afɔrebɔde mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, wɔ faako a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> beyi sɛ atenae wɔ ne din mu no. <verse eid="DEU 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3"/>Munnni mmɔkaw brodo nka ho; na mmom, nnanson so na munni apiti amanehunu brodo, efisɛ mufii Misraim ɔhare so, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a mo nkwanna nyinaa mu no mobɛkae bere a mutu fii Misraim no. <verse eid="DEU 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4"/>Mommma wonhu sɛ mowɔ mmɔkaw wɔ mo nkyɛn wɔ mo nsase nyinaa so nnanson. Mommma nam a mode bɔɔ afɔre da a edi kan no anwummere no nka gya so nkosi anɔpa.<verse eid="DEU 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5"/>Mommɔ Twam Afahyɛ afɔre no wɔ nkurow a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo no mu biara so, <verse eid="DEU 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6"/>gye faako a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, beyi sɛ wɔnkamfo ne din wɔ hɔ no. Ɛhɔ na mommɔ Twam afɔre no anwummere mfa nni mo Misraimfi bere no afahyɛ. <verse eid="DEU 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7"/>Montoto na monwe no wɔ faako a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛpaw ama mo no. Na ade kye a, monsan nkɔ mo ntamadan mu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8"/>Nnansia na momfa nni apiti, na ne nnanson so no, nnipa no nyinaa nhyia wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim. Na saa da no, obiara nyɛ adwuma.<verse eid="DEU 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Otwabere Afahyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9"/>Mumfi bere a mubefi ase atwa atoko no nkan nnaawɔtwe ason. <verse eid="DEU 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10"/>Na monhwɛ sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, asi ahyira mo no so mfi mo pɛ mu mmɔ afɔre, nnyina so nni Asese Afahyɛ no mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no. <verse eid="DEU 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11"/>Na munnye mo ani wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim wɔ faako a ɔbɛpaw sɛ atenae ma ne din no. Mo ne mo mmabarima ne mo mmabea, mo nkoa ne mo mfenaa, Lewifo a wɔwɔ mo nkurow mu ne ahɔho, nyisaa ne akunafo a wɔne mo te nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12"/>Monkae sɛ na moyɛ nkoa wɔ Misraim enti monhwɛ yiye na munni saa mmara yi nyinaa so.<verse eid="DEU 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asese Afahyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13"/>Sɛ moboaboa mo awiporowbea ne mo nsakyi amoa mu ade ano wie a, momfa nnanson nni Asese Afahyɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14"/>Munnye mo ani wɔ mo afahyɛ yi se; mo ne mo abusuafo, mo asomfo ne Lewifo, ahɔho, nyisaa ne akunafo a wofi mo nkurow mu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15"/>Momfa nnanson nni saa afahyɛ yi mfa nhyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anuonyam wɔ faako a ɔbɛpaw, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, na ɔma mo nnɔbae bɔ pii na ohyira mo nnwuma nyinaa so; na mo anigye bewie pɛyɛ.<verse eid="DEU 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16"/>Afe biara mu no, ɛsɛ sɛ mo mmarima no nyinaa hyia wɔ mo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim faako a ɔbɛpaw no mprɛnsa de ama Apiti Afahyɛ, Otwabere Afahyɛ ne Asese Afahyɛ no. Ɛnsɛ sɛ obiara ba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim nsapan. <verse eid="DEU 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ obiara de akyɛde a ɛne nhyira a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, nhyira no no sɛ ba.<verse eid="DEU 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atemmufo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18"/>Munsisi atemmufo ne mpanyimfo mfi mo mmusuakuw biara mu wɔ nkurow a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo no mu, na wobebu nnipa no atɛntrenee. <verse eid="DEU 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19"/>Mummmu ntɛnkyew anaa monnhwɛ nnipa anim mmu atɛn. Monnnye adanmude, efisɛ adanmude fura onyansafo ani ma ɔdan nea odi bem no asɛm ani. <verse eid="DEU 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20"/>Mummu atɛntrenee nkutoo, na ama moatumi atena asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo no so.<verse eid="DEU 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahonisom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21"/>Mummfi afɔremuka a mubesi ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, akyi nsi abosonnua foforo biara, <verse eid="DEU 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22"/>na munnsi ɔbo kronkron, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, kyi eyinom.<verse eid="DEU 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1"/>Mommfa anantwi anaa nguan a wɔadi dɛm anaa wonnye mmɔ afɔre mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, efisɛ ɛyɛ nʼakyiwade.<verse eid="DEU 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2"/>Sɛ ɛba sɛ muhu sɛ ɔbarima anaa ɔbea a ɔka mo ho wɔ kurow baako bi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo no mu reyɛ bɔne wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim, atia nʼapam no, <verse eid="DEU 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3"/>na wabu mʼahyɛde so resom anyame afoforo, rekotow wɔn; anaa ɔresom owia, ɔsram anaa wim nsoromma, <verse eid="DEU 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4"/>na sɛ mote saa asɛm no a, monhwehwɛ mu yiye. Sɛ ɛyɛ nokware na wɔkɔ mu hu sɛ wɔayɛ saa akyiwade yi wɔ Israel a, <verse eid="DEU 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5"/>momfa saa ɔbarima anaa ɔbea a wayɛ saa bɔne no mmra mo kuropɔn pon ano na munsiw saa onipa no abo nkum no. <verse eid="DEU 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6"/>Nnansefo baanu anaa baasa ano asɛm so na ɛsɛ sɛ wogyina kum saa ɔbarima no. Nanso ɛnsɛ sɛ wogyina ɔdanseni baako pɛ ano asɛm so kum obi. <verse eid="DEU 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ nnansefo no nsa ano abo na wɔtow di kan na akyiri no, nnipa no nyinaa atotow wɔn de de akum no. Saa ɔkwan yi so na mobɛfa atu amumɔyɛfo ase afi mo mu.<verse eid="DEU 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asennii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8"/>Sɛ wɔde nsɛm bi ba mo asennii a ne di yɛ mo den sɛ mubebu ho atɛn, sɛ ɛyɛ awudi, nnipa bi ntam manso anaa ntɔkwaw a, momfa wɔn nkɔ faako a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛpaw no. <verse eid="DEU 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9"/>Monkɔ asɔfo a wɔyɛ Lewifo ne otemmufo a ɔte agua mu saa bere no nkyɛn. Mummisa wɔn na wɔbɛkyerɛ mo atɛn a mummu. <verse eid="DEU 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10"/>Munni gyinae a wobesi wɔ beae a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛpaw no so pɛpɛɛpɛ. Monhwɛ yiye na munni biribiara a wɔbɛkyerɛ mo sɛ monyɛ no so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="DEU 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11"/>Munni mmara a wɔkyerɛ mo ne gyinae a wobesi ama mo no so pɛpɛɛpɛ. Monnnan nea wɔka kyerɛ mo no ani. Monnkɔ nifa anaa benkum. <verse eid="DEU 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wokum obiara a obebu otemmufo anaa ɔsɔfo a ogyina hɔ resom <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, animtiaa no. Ɛsɛ sɛ motɔre amumɔyɛsɛm ase wɔ Israel. <verse eid="DEU 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13"/>Nnipa nyinaa bɛte na wɔasuro na wɔremmu animtiaa bio.<verse eid="DEU 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔhene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14"/>Sɛ mudu asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo no so na mofa tena so na moka se. “Momma yensi yɛn so hene te sɛ aman a atwa yɛn ho ahyia no nyinaa a,” <verse eid="DEU 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15"/>monhwɛ sɛ mobɛfa obi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛpaw no asi mo so hene. Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ mo nuanom no mu bi. Mommfa ɔhɔho a ɔnyɛ mo nua Israelni nsi mo so hene. <verse eid="DEU 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ saa ɔhene no pɛ apɔnkɔ dodow sɛ nʼagyapade anaasɛ ɔma nnipa san kɔ Misraim kɔtɔ apɔnkɔ dodow bi, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ mo se. “Ɛnsɛ sɛ mosan kɔ mo akyi bio.” <verse eid="DEU 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔware yerenom bebree anyɛ saa a, ne koma befi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> so. Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔboaboa dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ pii ano.<verse eid="DEU 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18"/>Sɛ ɔtena ahengua no so sɛ ɔhene a, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔkyerɛw saa mmara yi wɔ nhoma mmobɔwee so wɔ Lewifo asɔfo anim na ɔfa. <verse eid="DEU 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19"/>Mmere dodow a ɔte ase no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔkora mmara a ɛwɔ ne nkyɛn no na ɔkenkan no daa sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a, obedi mmara no so na wasuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, ne Nyankopɔn no. <verse eid="DEU 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20"/>Kenkan a ɔkenkan no daa no remma ɔnyɛ ahantan, nhoran ne ho nkyerɛ sɛ ɔsen ne manfo no. Ɛremma no ntwe ne ho mfi mmara no ho nkɔ nifa anaa benkum. Na ɔne nʼasefo bedi ade akyɛ wɔ nʼaheman Israel mu.<verse eid="DEU 17:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɔfo Ne Lewifo Akyɛde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1"/>Lewifo Asɔfo no, nokware Lewi abusuakuw nyinaa no, nni kyɛfa ne agyapade biara wɔ Israelman mu te sɛ mmusuakuw a wɔaka no. Wobedi aduan afɔre a wɔbɔ ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no bi, efisɛ wonni agyapade. <verse eid="DEU 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2"/>Israelfo mu de, wɔrennya agyapade biara sɛ wɔn ankasa kyɛfa. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ankasa bɛyɛ wɔn kyɛfa sɛnea ɔhyɛɛ wɔn bɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3"/>Eyi ne kyɛfa a asɔfo no benya afi nantwi ne oguan a nnipa no de bɛbɔ afɔre no mu: ne mmati, nʼabogye ne nʼayamde. <verse eid="DEU 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4"/>Afei, momma wɔn mo atokokan mu ade, nsa foforo ne ngo ne nwi a edi kan a wotwitwa fi mo nguan ho no. <verse eid="DEU 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5"/>Efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, apaw Lewifo ne wɔn asefo afi mo mmusuakuw nyinaa mu sɛ wonnyina, nsom daa wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu.<verse eid="DEU 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6"/>Sɛ Lewini bi pɛ na ofi mo nkurow no mu biara a ɔte so wɔ Israel kɔ baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi a, <verse eid="DEU 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7"/>otumi som wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, ne Nyankopɔn, din mu te sɛnea ne nkurɔfo Lewifo a wɔsom wɔ hɔ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim no yɛ no ara. <verse eid="DEU 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8"/>Sɛ mpo wanya sika bi afi abusua agyapade bi tɔn mu a, wɔde ne kyɛfa a ɛwɔ afɔrebɔde no mu sɛ Lewini no bɛma no sɛ asɛde.<verse eid="DEU 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nneyɛe A Ɛyɛ Akyiwade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9"/>Sɛ munya du asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo no so a, monhwɛ yiye na moansua amanaman a ɛwɔ hɔ no amanne a ɛyɛ akyiwade no. <verse eid="DEU 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10"/>Mommma wonhu sɛ mo mu bi de ne babarima anaa ne babea abɔ ɔhyew afɔre. Na mommma mo nnipa no nyɛ akɔmfo a wɔhyɛ abosom nkɔm, abayifo ne abisakɔfo, ne ntafowayifo <verse eid="DEU 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11"/>ne nkaberekyerefo ne samanfrɛfo, osumanni a ɔfrɛ ɔsaman. <verse eid="DEU 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12"/>Obiara a ɔyɛ saa ade yi bi no yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyiwade na saa akyiwade yi nti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛpam saa aman no afi mo anim. <verse eid="DEU 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13"/>Monyɛ pɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim.<verse eid="DEU 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Odiyifo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14"/>Aman a morekotu wɔn yi tie wɔn a wɔpɛ abayisɛm ne nkɔmhyɛnsɛm. Nanso mo de, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, mmaa mo kwan sɛ monyɛ saa ɛ. <verse eid="DEU 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, beyi odiyifo a ɔte sɛ me afi mo Israelfo yi ara mu. Ɛsɛ sɛ moyɛ osetie ma no. <verse eid="DEU 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16"/>Eyi ne nea mo ankasa mobisaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bere a muhyiaa wɔ Horeb no. Mosrɛɛ sɛ mompɛ sɛ mote <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, nne anaa muhu ogyaframa bio, efisɛ musuro sɛ anhwɛ a, mubewuwu.<verse eid="DEU 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buae se, “Mɛyɛ wɔn abisade ama wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18"/>Mɛda odiyifo te sɛ wo adi afi wɔn nkurɔfo Israelfo mu. Mede me nsɛm bɛhyɛ nʼanom, na ɔbɛka biribiara a mɛhyɛ wɔn no akyerɛ wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19"/>Mʼankasa me ne obiara a wantie asɛm a odiyifo no bɛka wɔ me din mu no bedi. <verse eid="DEU 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20"/>Na odiyifo biara bɛpatuw aka nea menhyɛe, anaa ɔnam onyame foforo bi din so ka asɛm no, ɛsɛ sɛ wokum no.”<verse eid="DEU 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21"/>Mubebisa mo ho se, “Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na yɛahu sɛ adiyisɛm no fi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anaasɛ emfi no?” <verse eid="DEU 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22"/>Sɛ odiyifo no hyɛ nkɔm wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu na amma mu a, na ɛnyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔde asɛm no mae. Na ɛkyerɛ sɛ, saa odiyifo no ara kaa ɔno ankasa nʼasɛm bi kwa enti ɛnsɛ sɛ musuro.<verse eid="DEU 18:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Guankɔbea Nkuropɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, sɛe aman a ɔde wɔn nsase rema mo no, na sɛ mopam wɔn na motena wɔn nkurow mu ne wɔn afi mu a, <verse eid="DEU 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2"/>munyi nkuropɔn abiɛsa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eyi yɛ nkuropɔn abiɛsa a ɛbɛkaa baako a na ɛwɔ hɔ dedaw a na ɛwɔ Yordan apuei fam sɛ guankɔbea no. Na eyinom wɔ Yordan atɔe fam.</char></note> a ɛwɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo no mfimfini. <verse eid="DEU 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3"/>Munyiyi akwan nkɔ hɔ na monkyɛ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de rema mo sɛ agyapade no mu abiɛsa sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a, sɛ obi kum obi a, obeguan akɔ hɔ.<verse eid="DEU 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4"/>Sɛ obi anhyɛ da na okum obi a onni ne ho menasepɔw anaa ɔntan no dedaw a, nea ne nsa apa no tumi guan kɔ saa nkuropɔn yi biara so de gye ne ho nkwa. <verse eid="DEU 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5"/>Sɛ ebia, obi ne ne yɔnko bi kɔ wuram sɛ wɔrekobu nnua na sɛ ɛba sɛ ɔbaako him abonnua no sɛ ɔde rebu dua bi na sɛ abonnua no hɔn fi ne dua mu kum ne yɔnko no a, saa onipa no tumi guan kɔ nkuropɔn no baako so de gye ne ho nkwa. <verse eid="DEU 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6"/>Sɛ anyɛ saa a ɔweretɔni no de abufuw bɛtaa no. Sɛ ɔkwan no ware dodo a ɔbɛto no akum no bi, a anka ɔmfata owu, esiane sɛ ɔnnam adwemmɔne biara so na okum no. <verse eid="DEU 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7"/>Eyi nti na merehyɛ mo sɛ munyi nkuropɔn abiɛsa nsi nkyɛn no.<verse eid="DEU 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, trɛw mo man mu sɛnea ɔkaa ho ntam kyerɛɛ mo agyanom no na ɔde asase no nyinaa ma mo sɛnea ɔhyɛɛ wɔn ho bɔ no a, <verse eid="DEU 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9"/>esiane sɛ motɔ mo bo ase di mmara a mehyɛ mo nnɛ yi sɛ monnɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, na daa monnantew nʼakwan so no so nti na, ɛsɛ sɛ muyi nkuropɔn abiɛsa si nkyɛn no. <verse eid="DEU 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10"/>Monyɛ eyi, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a wɔrenhwie mogya a enni fɔ no ngu mo asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo sɛ mo agyapade no so, na moanni mogyahwiegu ho fɔ.<verse eid="DEU 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11"/>Sɛ obi fi nitan mu hyɛ da kɔtɛw obi pira no, kum no na oguan kɔ nkuropɔn yi mu baako so a, <verse eid="DEU 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12"/>ɛsɛ sɛ mpanyimfo a wɔwɔ ne kurow no mu hɔ no soma ma wɔkɔfa no fi kuropɔn no mu brɛ ɔweretɔni no ma okum no. <verse eid="DEU 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13"/>Munnya ahummɔbɔ biara. Munyi awudi ho afɔdi biara mfi Israel na ama asi mo yiye.<verse eid="DEU 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14"/>Sɛ mudu asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo sɛ agyapade no so a, munntutu mo yɔnkonom ntɔmmɛ a mo agyanom asisi no ngu.<verse eid="DEU 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnansefo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15"/>Mummmu obi a ɔdanseni baako pɛ abedi atia no no fɔ. Sobobɔ bedi mu, bere a nnipa baanu anaa baasa abedi adanse atia obi.<verse eid="DEU 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16"/>Sɛ atoro danseni bi ba bɛbɔ obi amumɔyɛ bi ho kwaadu a, <verse eid="DEU 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17"/>ɛsɛ sɛ nnipa baanu a wodi asɛm no nyinaa ba asɔfo ne atemmufo a wɔreyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adwuma no anim. <verse eid="DEU 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ atemmufo no yɛ nhwehwɛmu a emu dɔ yiye, na sɛ ɛda adi sɛ ɔdanseni no retwa atoro, a ɔredi adansekurum agu ne yɔnko Israelni no so a, <verse eid="DEU 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19"/>ɛno de, monyɛ ɔdansekurumni no sɛnea anka ɔpɛe sɛ wɔyɛ ne yɔnko no. Muntu abɔnefo ase mfi mo mu. <verse eid="DEU 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20"/>Nnipa nkae no bɛte na wɔasuro, na wɔrenyɛ saa bɔne no wɔ mo mu bio. <verse eid="DEU 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21"/>Munnhu obiara mmɔbɔ! Mo mmara a ɛsɛ sɛ mudi so no yɛ nkwa nsi nkwa anan mu, aniwa nsi aniwa anan mu, ɛse nsi se anan mu, nsa nsi nsa anan mu na nan nsi nan anan mu.<verse eid="DEU 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Akodi Ho Nkyerɛkyerɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1"/>Sɛ mokɔ ɔko de tia mo atamfo na muhu apɔnkɔ ne nteaseɛnam ne asraafo a wɔdɔɔso sen mo a, munnsuro wɔn, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, a oyii mo fii Misraim no bɛka mo ho. <verse eid="DEU 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2"/>Sɛ morebɛkɔ ɔko a, ɔsɔfo no bɛba abɛkasa akyerɛ asraafo no. <verse eid="DEU 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3"/>Ɔbɛka se, “Muntie me, mo Israel mmarima! Nnɛ, morekɔ ɔsa atia mo atamfo. Mommma mo koma ntutu! Mommma mo aba mu mmu na momma mo ho mpopo. <verse eid="DEU 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, na ɔne mo rekɔ. Ɔbɛko atia mo atamfo no ama moadi nkonim.”<verse eid="DEU 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5"/>Asraafo mpanyimfo no bebisa asraafo no se, “Mo mu bi asi ɔdan foforo a ɔntenaa mu da? Onii no nsan nkɔ fie! Ebia na wɔakum no wɔ ɔko no mu na ama obi akɔtena mu. <verse eid="DEU 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6"/>Obi wɔ ha a wadɔw bobeturo na onnidii mu da? Onii no nsan nkɔ fie! Ebia na wɔakum no wɔ ɔko no mu na ama obi akodidi mu. <verse eid="DEU 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7"/>Obi wɔ ha a ɔne ɔbea bi akasa nanso ɔwaree no ana? Onii no nsan nkɔ fie! Ebia na wɔakum no wɔ ɔko no mu na ama obi akɔware no.” <verse eid="DEU 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8"/>Afei, mpanyimfo no bɛkɔ so abisa se, “So mo mu bi suro anaa ne koma atu ana? Ɛno de, ɔnkɔ fie sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a, ne nuabarimanom nso koma rentu.” <verse eid="DEU 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9"/>Sɛ mpanyimfo no wie asraafo no kasakyerɛ a, afei wɔbɛpaw asahene adeda wɔn ano.<verse eid="DEU 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10"/>Sɛ mudu kurow bi mu a mo ne wɔn nni kan nka asomdwoesɛm. <verse eid="DEU 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11"/>Sɛ wɔpene mo nhyehyɛe so na wobue wɔn apon ma mo a, mobɛhyɛ nnipa a wɔwɔ mu no nyinaa ama wɔayɛ adwumaden ama mo. <verse eid="DEU 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12"/>Na sɛ wɔampene asomdwoe nhyehyɛe no so na sɛ wose wɔne mo bɛko a, ɛno de, montow nhyɛ kurow no so. <verse eid="DEU 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, dan kurow no hyɛ mo nsa a, munkum kurow no mu mmarima nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14"/>Ɛyɛ a momfa kurow no mu mmea, mmofra, nyɛmmoa ne asade a aka nyinaa sɛ agyapade. Mubetumi de mo atamfo no asade a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de bɛma mo no ayɛ mo ade. <verse eid="DEU 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15"/>Eyi ne ɔkwan a ɛsɛ sɛ mode nkuropɔn a ɛwɔ akyiri na wɔnyɛ aman a ɛbemmɛn no fa so.<verse eid="DEU 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16"/>Na amanaman nkuropɔn a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo sɛ agyapade no de, monsɛe biribiara a nkwa wɔ mu wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17"/>Monsɛe Hetifo, Amorifo, Kanaanfo, Perisifo, Hewifo ne Yebusifo no pasaa sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, ahyɛ mo no. <verse eid="DEU 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18"/>Sɛ ɛba saa a, ɛremma nnipa a wɔte asase no so no nkyerɛ mo akyiwade a wɔyɛ wɔ wɔn abosonsom ho amma mo anyɛ bɔne antia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no.<verse eid="DEU 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19"/>Sɛ motua kuropɔn bi ano kyɛ, a moreko afa kurow no a, mommfa abonnua ntwitwa mu nnua nsɛe no. Efisɛ mubetumi adi nʼaba. Munntwitwa nnua no ngu. Nnua no nyɛ atamfo a ɛsɛ sɛ motow hyɛ so! <verse eid="DEU 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20"/>Nanso mutumi twa nnua a munim sɛ ɛnyɛ aduan; na momfa nyɛ ade a ɛho behia mo sɛ mode bɛboa atua kurow a mo ne wɔn reko no ano akosi sɛ mubedi so.<verse eid="DEU 20:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Awudi A Wonnim Owudifo No Ho Mpata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1"/>Sɛ wohu sɛ wɔakum obi da afum wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, de rema mo no so, na sɛ munnim owudifo no a, <verse eid="DEU 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2"/>mo ntuanofo ne atemmufo no bɛkɔ akosusuw ɔkwan a ɛda nea owufo no da hɔ ne kurow a ɛbɛn no ntam. <verse eid="DEU 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3"/>Afei, mpanyimfo a wɔwɔ kurow a ɛbɛn owufo no pɛɛ no mfa nantwi ba a ɔnyɛɛ adwuma da na ɔntwee konnua da <verse eid="DEU 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4"/>na wonni nʼanim mfa no nkɔ subon a womfuntumii anaa wonnuaa hwee wɔ hɔ da na nsu sen wɔ mu. Subon no mu na ɛsɛ sɛ wobu nantwi ba no kɔn mu. <verse eid="DEU 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5"/>Lewifo asɔfo bɛba hɔ, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, paw wɔn sɛ wɔnka asɛm na wonhyira wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu. Na wɔn na wosi ntawntaw ne dɛmdi asenni ne asotwe so dua. <verse eid="DEU 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ kurow a ɛbɛn funu no mu mpanyimfo no hohoro wɔn nsa gu nantwi ba a wobuu ne kɔn mu no so, <verse eid="DEU 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7"/>na wɔaka se, “Ɛnyɛ yɛn nsa na ehwiee mogya yi gui, na yɛn ani anhu nso. <verse eid="DEU 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, gye saa mpata ma wo man Israel a wugyee wɔn no. Mfa mogya a edi bem yi ho so nto wo nkurɔfo Israel so.” Wowie eyi a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ, wɔayi ɛso a ɛda wɔn so no afi hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9"/>Sɛ wodi saa nkyerɛkyerɛ yi so na wɔyɛ nea ɛteɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so a, na moayi awudi no ho afɔbu afi mo atenae hɔ.<verse eid="DEU 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmea Nnommumfo Aware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10"/>Sɛ mokɔ ɔko tia mo atamfo na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, dan wɔn hyɛ mo nsa na mofa wɔn nnommum, <verse eid="DEU 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11"/>na sɛ muhu ɔbea hoɔfɛfo bi wɔ wɔn mu na, mopɛ sɛ mofa no sɛ ɔyere a, mutumi ware no. <verse eid="DEU 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12"/>Momfa no mmra mo fi na munyi ne ti, mmubu ne werɛw, <verse eid="DEU 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13"/>na munyi ntade a na ɔhyɛ wɔ bere a mokyeree no no ngu hɔ. Na ɔntena mo fi nsu nʼagya ne ne na ɔsram akyi ansa na, moatumi akɔ ne ho sɛ ɔyere na wo nso woayɛ no okunu. <verse eid="DEU 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14"/>Sɛ mo ani nnye ne ho a, momma no nkɔ baabiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔkɔ. Monntɔn no na monnyɛ no sɛ afenaa, efisɛ moagu nʼanim ase.<verse eid="DEU 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abakan Ho Asɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15"/>Sɛ ɔbarima wɔ yerenom baanu na ɔdɔ ɔbaako kyɛn nea ɔka ho no, na wɔn baanu no mu biara ne no wɔ ɔbabarima, nanso nʼabakan no yɛ ɔbea a ɔmpɛ nʼasɛm no babarima, <verse eid="DEU 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16"/>na sɛ ɔhyɛ nsamansew de ma ne mmabarima a, ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔde kyɛfa kɛse no ma ɔbabarima kumaa a ɔyɛ ne yere a ɔdɔ no no babarima no. <verse eid="DEU 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17"/>Ɔbɛfa ne babarima a ɔyɛ ɔyere a ɔmpɛ nʼasɛm no sɛ nʼabakan no anam so ama no nʼagyapade no mmɔho abien. Saa ɔbabarima no yɛ nʼagya no ahoɔden nsɛnkyerɛnne a edi kan. Ɛno nti, abakan kyɛfa yɛ ne dea.<verse eid="DEU 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbabarima A Ɔtew Atua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18"/>Sɛ ɔbarima bi wɔ ɔbabarima a ɔyɛ asoɔden ne otuatewfo a ontie nʼagya ne ne na asɛm wɔ bere a wɔteɛ no so a, <verse eid="DEU 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19"/>nea ɛsɛ sɛ ɛba ara ne sɛ, agya no ne ɛna no de wɔn babarima no bɛkɔ mpanyimfo a wɔwɔ kurow no pon ano no anim. <verse eid="DEU 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20"/>Wɔbɛpae mu aka akyerɛ mpanyimfo no se, “Yɛn babarima yi yɛ ɔsoɔdenfo ne otuatewfo a ontie yɛn asɛm. Ɔyɛ odidifo ne ɔkɔwensani.” <verse eid="DEU 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21"/>Ɛba saa a, ɛsɛ sɛ mmarima a wɔwɔ kurow no mu nyinaa siw no abo kum no. Ɛsɛ sɛ mutu bɔne ase fi mo mu. Israel nyinaa bɛte na wɔabɔ hu.<verse eid="DEU 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara Ahorow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22"/>Sɛ obi yɛ amumɔyɛsɛm bi a ɛfata owu na enti wokum no na wɔde no sɛn dua so a, <verse eid="DEU 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23"/>ɛnsɛ sɛ nʼamu no sɛn dua no so ma ade kye so. Ɛsɛ sɛ da no ara, musie amu no, efisɛ obiara a wɔsɛn no wɔ dua so no wɔ Onyankopɔn nnome ase. Munngu asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo sɛ agyapade no ho fi.<verse eid="DEU 21:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1"/>Sɛ wuhu sɛ wo yɔnko Israelni bi nantwi anaa ne guan nam basabasa a, mmu wʼani ngu so; mmom kyere no kɔma ne wura. <verse eid="DEU 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2"/>Sɛ ne wura nte mmɛn wo, anaasɛ wunnim no a, fa no kɔ wo fi kosi sɛ ne wura no bɛba abɛhwehwɛ no na wode nʼaboa ma no. <verse eid="DEU 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3"/>Sɛ wuhu wo nua bi afurum anaa ne ntama anaa ne biribi a ayera a, yɛ no saa ara. Mmu wʼani ngu so.<verse eid="DEU 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4"/>Sɛ wuhu sɛ wo yɔnko Israelni bi afurum anaa ne nantwi bi atew ahwe wɔ ɔkwan mu a, mmu wʼani ngu so. Kɔboa ne wura no na ɔmma aboa no so nnyina hɔ.<verse eid="DEU 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔbea hyɛ mmarima atade, saa ara nso na ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔbarima hyɛ mmea atade, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, kyi obiara a ɔyɛ eyi.<verse eid="DEU 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6"/>Sɛ wokɔto anomaa berebuw wɔ ɔkwankyɛn, sɛ ɛhyɛ dua mu anaa ɛda fam, na sɛ anomaa no na butuw ne ba no so anaa obutuw nkesua so a, mfa anomaa no na ne ne ba no nkɔ. <verse eid="DEU 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7"/>Wutumi fa ne ba no nanso hwɛ sɛ wobɛma ne na no akɔ, sɛnea ebesi wo yiye na wo nkwanna aware.<verse eid="DEU 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8"/>Sɛ wusi ɔdan foforo a, yɛ ban fa wo dan no nkuruso no ho na obi amfi hɔ antew anhwe amma woamfa mogyahwiegu ho afɔdi amma wo ne wo dan no so.<verse eid="DEU 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9"/>Nnua nnɔbae foforo biara wɔ bobe ntam wɔ wo bobeturo mu. Sɛ woyɛ saa a, na wo nnɔbae no ne bobeturo no so aba nyinaa ho agu fi.<verse eid="DEU 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10"/>Nsa nantwi ne afurum mmɔ mu mfuntum afuw.<verse eid="DEU 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11"/>Mfura ntama a wɔde kuntu ne sirikyi afra anwen.<verse eid="DEU 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12"/>Yɛ ntama a wufura no ano anan no nyinaa mpɛsɛ.<verse eid="DEU 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nneyɛe A Ɛmfata Wɔ Aware Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13"/>Sɛ ɔbarima ware ɔbea na ɔne no da na akyiri no ɔmpɛ no bio, <verse eid="DEU 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14"/>na enti ɔka ne ho asɛmmɔne, bɔ no din bɔne se, “Mewaree no no, manhu biribiara a ɛkyerɛ sɛ ɔyɛ ɔbabun,” <verse eid="DEU 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15"/>a, ɔbea no agya ne ne na wɔ ho kwan sɛ wɔde adansede a ɛkyerɛ sɛ wɔn babea no yɛ ɔbabun bɛkyerɛ kurow no mpanyimfo wɔ kurow no pon. <verse eid="DEU 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔbea no agya ka kyerɛ wɔn se, “Mede me babea maa ɔbarima yi aware nanso ose ɔmpɛ no bio. <verse eid="DEU 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17"/>Wagu nʼanim ase aka se, ‘Manhu sɛ wo babea no yɛ ɔbabun.’ Nanso adansede a ɛkyerɛ sɛ ɔyɛ ɔbabun no ni.” Afei, wɔbɛtrɛw ntama no mu wɔ kurow no mpanyimfo anim, <verse eid="DEU 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18"/>na mpanyimfo no bɛfrɛ ɔbarima no atwe nʼaso. <verse eid="DEU 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19"/>Wɔbɛbɔ no ka kilogram baako sɛ wagu Israel ɔbabun no anim ase. Wobetua sika no ama ɔbea no agya. Afei, ɔbabea no bɛyɛ ɔbarima no yere a ɔrennyaa no bio.<verse eid="DEU 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20"/>Sɛ ɛkɔba sɛ kwaadu a wɔde bɔɔ no no yɛ nokware na wɔannya adansede a ɛfa ne babunyɛ no ho ankyerɛ a, <verse eid="DEU 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21"/>wɔde ɔbea no bɛba nʼagya fi abɔntenpon ano na kurom hɔ mmarima asiw no abo akum no. Ɔnam aguamammɔ so ayɛ animguase ade wɔ Israel, bere a ɔne nʼawofo te. Ɛsɛ sɛ mutu saa bɔne no ase fi mo mu.<verse eid="DEU 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22"/>Sɛ wohu sɛ ɔbarima bi ne ɔbarima foforo bi yere da a, ɛsɛ sɛ wokum ɔbarima a ɔne ɔbea no dae no ne ɔbea no nyinaa. Ɛsɛ sɛ mutu saa bɔne no ase wɔ Israel.<verse eid="DEU 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23"/>Sɛ ɔbarima bi hyia ababaa a ɔyɛ ɔbabun a ɔne obi ahyehyɛ aware na ɔbarima no ne ababaa no da na sɛ saa asɛm no sii wɔ kurow no mu a, <verse eid="DEU 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24"/>ɛsɛ sɛ mode wɔn baanu no kɔ kurow no apon ano kosiw wɔn abo kum wɔn. Ababaa no di fɔ, efisɛ na ɔwɔ kurom nanso wanteɛteɛ mu ampɛ mmoa. Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔbarima no nso wu, efisɛ wafa obi yere. Ɛsɛ sɛ mutu saa bɔne no ase fi mo mu.<verse eid="DEU 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25"/>Sɛ ɔbarima bi hyia ɔbea a obi ne no ahyehyɛ aware wɔ wuram, na ɔbarima no hyɛ no ne no da a, ɛsɛ sɛ wokum ɔbarima a ɔyɛɛ saa no nkutoo. <verse eid="DEU 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26"/>Monnyɛ ababaa no hwee, efisɛ ɔnyɛɛ bɔne biara a ɛma ɔfata owu. Saa asɛm yi te sɛ obi a watow ahyɛ ne yɔnko so akum no, <verse eid="DEU 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27"/>efisɛ ɔbarima no hyiaa ɔbea no wɔ wuram, na asiwa no teɛteɛɛ mu de, nanso wannya ogyefo biara.<verse eid="DEU 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28"/>Sɛ wɔkyere ɔbarima bi sɛ wahyɛ ababaa bi a obi ne no nhyehyɛe aware, ne no ada a, <verse eid="DEU 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29"/>ɛsɛ sɛ otua dwetɛ kilogram abien ne fa ma ababaa no agya. Na ɛno akyi no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔbarima no ware ababaa no, efisɛ wagu nʼanim ase na ɔrentumi nnyae no aware da.<verse eid="DEU 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30"/>Ɔbarima biara nni ho kwan sɛ ɔne nʼagya yere da; ɛnsɛ sɛ ogu nʼagya mpa ho fi.<verse eid="DEU 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Nnipa A Wɔmfata Awurade Bagua Asekɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1"/>Ɔbarima a wɔasa no anaa wɔatwa ne barima akyene no mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bagua ase.<verse eid="DEU 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2"/>Wɔn a wɔyɛ mpenamma ne wɔn aseni biara, mpo enkosi awo ntoatoaso du no, mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bagua ase.<verse eid="DEU 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3"/>Amonfo anaa Moabfo anaasɛ wɔn asefo biara, mpo enkosi awo ntoatoaso du no mu biara mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bagua ase. <verse eid="DEU 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4"/>Saa aman yi annye mo, amma mo aduan anaasɛ nsu, bere a mufi Misraim reba no. Mmom, wɔkɔbɔɔ Beor babarima Balaam a ofi Petor a ɛwɔ Mesopotamia paa sɛ ɔmmɛdome mo. <verse eid="DEU 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5"/>Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, antie Balaam. Ɔdan nnome no maa ɛyɛɛ nhyira maa mo, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn no, dɔ mo. <verse eid="DEU 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6"/>Na sɛ mote ase yi, mo ne Amonfo ne Moabfo nnyɛ ayɔnkofa apam koraa.<verse eid="DEU 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7"/>Munnkyi Edomfo anaa Misraimfo, efisɛ Edomfo yɛ mo nuanom, na motenaa Misraimfo nso mu sɛ ahɔho. <verse eid="DEU 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8"/>Wɔn awo ntoatoaso abiɛsa so mma no betumi akɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bagua ase.<verse eid="DEU 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atenae Hɔ Afide</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9"/>Sɛ mokɔ ɔko de tia mo atamfo a, montwe mo ho mfi nea ɛho ntew biara ho. <verse eid="DEU 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10"/>Sɛ ɔbarima bi ho gu fi esiane anadwo mu ho nsu a ɛsen a, ɛsɛ sɛ ofi atenae hɔ kɔtena baabi da mu no nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11"/>Edu anwummere a, ɛsɛ sɛ oguare na owia kɔtɔ a, otumi san ba atenae hɔ.<verse eid="DEU 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12"/>Muntwa asraafo atenae hɔ baabi nto hɔ a mubegya mo anan. <verse eid="DEU 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13"/>Mofa biribi nka ne nneɛma ho a mode betu fam. Bere biara a mubegya mo anan no, momfa sofi no ntu amoa na monkata agyanan no so. <verse eid="DEU 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ asraafo atenae hɔ yɛ kronkron, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, nam mo atenae no so bɔ mo ho ban na moadi mo atamfo so nkonim. Ɛnsɛ sɛ ohu animguasede biara wɔ mo mu; sɛ ɛba saa a, ɔbɛdan nʼakyi akyerɛ mo.<verse eid="DEU 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asetena Pa Ho Mmara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15"/>Sɛ nkoa guan ba mo nkyɛn bɛbɔ wɔn ho aguaa a, munnyi wɔn mma wɔn wuranom. <verse eid="DEU 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16"/>Momma wɔntena mo mu wɔ kurow biara a wɔpɛ so a monnyɛ wɔn ayayade.<verse eid="DEU 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ Israelni barima anaa ɔbea biara yɛ nsɔree so oguamanfo. <verse eid="DEU 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18"/>Mommfa afɔrebɔde anaa adenya bi a efi oguamanfo nkyɛn, sɛ ɔyɛ ɔbarima anaa ɔbea, mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, fi, efisɛ ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, akyiwade.<verse eid="DEU 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19"/>Bosea a mobɔ mo yɔnko Israelni no, sɛ ɛyɛ sika, aduan anaa biribi foforo bi a wogye ho mfɛntom no, monnnye ho mfɛntom. <verse eid="DEU 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20"/>Mutumi gye bosea ho mfɛntom fi ahɔho nkyɛn na nyɛ Israelfo nkyɛn sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, behyira mo wɔ biribiara a moyɛ mu wɔ asase a morekɔ so akɔfa no so.<verse eid="DEU 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21"/>Sɛ mohyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɔ a, biribiara a mohyɛɛ no ho bɔ no, monyɛ no ntɛm so. Efisɛ ɛdan dɛn ara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛdan mo ka na mubedi bɔne ho fɔ. <verse eid="DEU 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22"/>Nanso sɛ moanhyɛ biribiara ho bɔ a, monyɛɛ bɔne biara. <verse eid="DEU 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23"/>Na sɛ wo ara wufi wo pɛ mu hyɛ bɔ a, hwɛ yiye na di asɛm a woaka no so, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, na woafi wo pɛ mu de wʼano ahyɛ no bɔ.<verse eid="DEU 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24"/>Wutumi di bobe aba dodow biara a wopɛ wɔ wo yɔnko bobeturo mu, nanso mfa bi ngu kɛntɛn mu nkɔ. <verse eid="DEU 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25"/>Saa ara na mubetumi de mo nsa abubu atoko kakra wɔ mo yɔnko afum, nanso ɛnsɛ sɛ mode afoa twa.<verse eid="DEU 23:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1"/>Sɛ ɔbarima ware yere na sɛ nʼani nnye ne ho bio, efisɛ wahu ade bɔne bi wɔ ne ho, na sɛ ɔkyerɛw awaregyae krataa de ma no, na ɔpam no fi ne fi, <verse eid="DEU 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2"/>na ofi fi hɔ na ɔbarima foforo kɔware no, <verse eid="DEU 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3"/>na ne kunu a ɔto so abien no gyaa no anaasɛ owu a, <verse eid="DEU 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4"/>ne kunu a odi kan a ogyaa no no nni ho kwan sɛ ɔware no bio, bere a ne ho agu fi akyi no. Ɛyɛ akyiwade wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so. Mommfa afɔbu mma asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo sɛ agyapade no so.<verse eid="DEU 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5"/>Sɛ ɔbarima aware foforo a, ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔde no kɔ ɔko anaasɛ wɔde dwuma bi di to no so. Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔtena fie afe a ɔnyɛ adwuma biara sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔbɛma ne yere foforo a waware no no anya ahotɔ.<verse eid="DEU 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6"/>Monnnye adeyam bo ne ne boba anaa ne ba no nko ara nsi ka ano, ɛba saa a na moagye ne wura no ano aduan sɛ akagyinamde.<verse eid="DEU 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7"/>Sɛ obi kyere ne yɔnko Israelni na odi no nya sɛ ɔdɔnkɔ anaa ɔtɔn no a, ɛsɛ sɛ owifo no wu. Ɛsɛ sɛ mutu bɔne ase fi mo mu.<verse eid="DEU 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8"/>Monhwɛ ɔhonam ani nsanyare nyinaa yiye na munni ho mmara a Lewifo asɔfo bɛkyerɛ mo no so. Munni ahyɛde a mede ama wɔn no so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="DEU 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9"/>Monkae nea bere a mufi Misraim reba no <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, yɛɛ Miriam.<verse eid="DEU 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10"/>Sɛ wode biribi fɛm wo yɔnko a, nkɔ wo yɔnko fi nkogye akagyinamde. <verse eid="DEU 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11"/>Gyina afikyiri na ma ɔyɔnko a ɔfɛm wʼade no mfa akagyinamde no mmrɛ wo. <verse eid="DEU 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12"/>Sɛ ɔyɔnko no yɛ ohiani a, nkora akagyinamde no nkosi adekyee. <verse eid="DEU 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13"/>Enkosi owiatɔbere no na wode ntama no akɔma wo yɔnko no na ɔde ada. Na ɔbɛda wo ase, na wɔbɛfa no sɛ ade trenee wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Nyankopɔn no, ani so.<verse eid="DEU 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14"/>Nhyɛ ɔpaani mmɔborɔni a ɔyɛ wo nua Israelni anaa ɔhɔho a ɔte mo nkurow no mu bi mu no so. <verse eid="DEU 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15"/>Tua nʼapaade ma no da biara ansa na owia akɔtɔ, efisɛ ɔyɛ ohiani na nʼani da saa akatua no so. Anyɛ saa a, obesu afrɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> atia wo, na wubedi bɔne ho fɔ.<verse eid="DEU 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ wokum awofo wɔ wɔn mma bɔne bi a wɔayɛ ho. Saa ara nso na ɛnsɛ sɛ wokum mma wɔ awofo bɔne bi a wɔayɛ ho. Ɛsɛ sɛ obiara wu wɔ nʼankasa bɔne ho.<verse eid="DEU 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ mubu ahɔho a wɔte mo mu ne nyisaa ntɛnkyew, anaasɛ mugye ɔbea kunafo ntama de di akagyinamu. <verse eid="DEU 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18"/>Daa monkae sɛ, na mo nso moyɛ nkoa wɔ Misraim na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, na ogyee mo. Ɛno nti na mehyɛ mo sɛ monyɛ eyi no.<verse eid="DEU 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19"/>Sɛ moretwa mo mfuw mu nnɔbae, na mo ani pa nnɔbae no bi so a, monnsan nkɔfa. Monnyaw ma ahɔho, nyisaa ne akunafo sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, behyira mo nsa ano nnwuma nyinaa so. <verse eid="DEU 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20"/>Sɛ motew wo ngonnua so aba a, monkɔ so mprenu. Monnyaw aba a aka wɔ so no mma ahɔho, nyisaa ne akunafo. <verse eid="DEU 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21"/>Saa nso na motew wo bobe nturo so aba a, monkɔ so mprenu; na monnyaw aba a aka wɔ so no mma ahɔho, nyisaa ne akunafo. <verse eid="DEU 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22"/>Monkae sɛ, moyɛɛ nkoa wɔ Misraim. Ɛno nti na mehyɛ mo sɛ monyɛ eyi no.<verse eid="DEU 24:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1"/>Sɛ akasakasa si nnipa bi ntam a, wɔmfa asɛm no nkɔ asennii na atemmufo no nni asɛm no. Wobegyaa nea odi bem no na wɔatwe de odi fɔ no aso. <verse eid="DEU 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2"/>Sɛ nea odi fɔ no fata sɛ wotwa no mmaa a, atemmufo no bɛma no ada hɔ na wɔatwa no mmaa dodow a ɛfata ne bɔne no wɔ nʼanim. <verse eid="DEU 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3"/>Nanso ɛnsɛ sɛ otemmufo no ma wotwa mmaa boro aduanan. Sɛ wotwa boro saa a, na wɔagu wo yɔnko Israelni anim ase wɔ wʼanim.<verse eid="DEU 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4"/>Nkyekyere nantwi a ɔreporow atoko ano.<verse eid="DEU 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5"/>Sɛ nuabarimanom baanu te fie na wɔn mu baako wu a wanwo ɔba a, ɛnsɛ sɛ okunafo no kɔware ɔhɔho. Mmom, ne kunu a wawu no nuabarima na ɛsɛ sɛ ɔware okunafo no ma ɔyɛ okunu nua no asɛde. <verse eid="DEU 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6"/>Wɔde abakan a wɔbɛwo no no bɛto nʼagya a wawu no sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a owufo no din rempepa mfi Israel.<verse eid="DEU 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7"/>Na sɛ ɛba sɛ owufo no nuabarima mpɛ sɛ ɔware ne nua no yere no a, ɔbea no bɛkɔ kurow no mpanyimfo nkyɛn wɔ kurow no pon ano akɔka akyerɛ wɔn se, “Me kunu nua no mpɛ sɛ ne nua no din bɛka Israel. Ɔrenyɛ okunu nua asɛde mma me.” <verse eid="DEU 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8"/>Afei, ɔbarima no kurom mpanyimfo bɛfrɛ no akasa akyerɛ no. Sɛ ose pene ara na ɔrempene nti ɔka se, “Mempɛ sɛ meware no a,” <verse eid="DEU 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9"/>okunafo no bɛkɔ ɔbarima no anim a mpanyimfo no nso wɔ hɔ bi. Ɔbɛworɔw ɔbarima no mpaboa baako, ate ntasu agu nʼanim na waka se, “Sɛɛ na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔyɛ ɔbarima a ɔmpɛ sɛ ɔtoa ne nua abusua so.” <verse eid="DEU 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10"/>Wɔbɛfrɛ saa onipa no asefo wɔ Israel se Abusua a Wɔaworɔw wɔn Mpaboa.<verse eid="DEU 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11"/>Sɛ Israelfo mmarima baanu reko na wɔn mu baako yere pɛ sɛ ɔboa ne kunu nti, oso ɔbarima baako no barima mu a, <verse eid="DEU 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12"/>ɛsɛ sɛ motwa ɔbea no nsa no a ahummɔbɔ biara nni mu.<verse eid="DEU 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13"/>Monnkita nsania ahorow abien a baako yɛ duru na baako yɛ hare. <verse eid="DEU 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14"/>Monnkora olonka ahorow abien a baako so na baako su wɔ mo fi. <verse eid="DEU 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15"/>Momfa nsania ne olonka a ɛyɛ pɛpɛ na nokwaredi wɔ mu nsusuw aguade na moanya nkwanna tenten wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo no so. <verse eid="DEU 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16"/>Wɔn a wɔfa nsania bɔne ne nkontompo so kari aguade no yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, akyiwade.<verse eid="DEU 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17"/>Monkae nea Amalekfo yɛɛ mo bere a mufi Misraim reba no. <verse eid="DEU 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18"/>Wɔtow hyɛɛ mo so bere a moabrɛbrɛ na moatotɔ beraw no na wɔn a wɔaka akyi no nso, wɔbobɔɔ wɔn hwehwee fam. Na wonsuro Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="DEU 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, ma mo ahomegye fi mo atamfo nyinaa nsam, wɔ asase a ɔde rema mo sɛ agyapade no so a, ɛsɛ sɛ mosɛe Amalekfo na wɔankae wɔn bio wɔ asase yi so. Mommma mo werɛ mfi eyi da!<verse eid="DEU 25:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Otwa Afɔrebɔde Ne Ntotoso Du Du</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1"/>Sɛ mudu asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rebɛma mo sɛ mo agyapade no so na moko gye, na motena so a, <verse eid="DEU 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2"/>momfa otwakan wɔ otwabere biara mu no ngu kɛntɛn mu na momfa mmra baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛpaw sɛ wɔnkamfo ne din wɔ hɔ no, <verse eid="DEU 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3"/>na monkɔ ɔsɔfo a ɔwɔ hɔ saa bere no nkyɛn nkɔka nkyerɛ no se, “Meda no adi nnɛ akyerɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de me aba asase a ɔkaa ho ntam kyerɛɛ yɛn agyanom no so.” <verse eid="DEU 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4"/>Afei, ɔsɔfo no begye kɛntɛn no afi wo nsam de asi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, afɔremuka no anim. <verse eid="DEU 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5"/>Na wobɛka saa nsɛm yi wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim sɛ, “Na me tete agya Yakob yɛ ɔkwantuni Aramni a ɔkɔtenaa Misraim. Nʼabusua no yɛ ketewaa bi, nanso Misraim hɔ no, wɔdɔɔso bebree bɛyɛɛ ɔman kɛse. <verse eid="DEU 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6"/>Bere a Misraimfo dii yɛn nya nam so ma yɛyɛɛ wɔn nkoa no, <verse eid="DEU 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7"/>yesu frɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn agyanom Nyankopɔn no. Ɔtee yɛn sufrɛ na ohuu yɛn amanehunu, ɔbrɛ ne ɔhyɛ a na yɛwɔ mu. <verse eid="DEU 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8"/>Enti <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam tumi a ɛyɛ nwonwa, ehu a emu yɛ den, nsɛnkyerɛnne a epusuw nnipa ne anwonwasɛm so gyee yɛn fii Misraim. <verse eid="DEU 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9"/>Ɔde yɛn baa ha na ɔde asase yi a nufusu ne ɛwo resen so yi maa yɛn. <verse eid="DEU 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mede akyɛde a ɛyɛ mʼaduankan a wode fi asase mu maa me no rebrɛ wo.” Afei, fa aduan no si <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim na sɔre no. <verse eid="DEU 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11"/>Afei, kɔ na wo ne Lewifo ne ahɔho a wɔte mo mu no nkogye mo ani wɔ nneɛma pa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de ama wo ne wo fifo no ho.<verse eid="DEU 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12"/>Afe a ɛto so abiɛsa a ɛyɛ ntotoso du du afe a woayi wo nnɔbae so ntotoso du du awie no ɛsɛ sɛ mode ma Lewifo, ahɔho, nyisaa ne akunafo sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a wobedidi amee wɔ mo nkurow so. <verse eid="DEU 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13"/>Afei, mompae mu nka wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim se, “Mede akyɛde kronkron a efi me fi ama Lewifo, ahɔho, nyisaa ne akunafo sɛnea wohyɛɛ me no. Mimmuu wʼahyɛde bi so anaa me werɛ mfii wo mmara no mu biara ɛ. <verse eid="DEU 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14"/>Manni akronkronne no bi bere a meretwa adwo no, na bere a na me ho ntew no nso, mamfa me nsa anka bi; na mamfa mu bi nso amma awufo. Matie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, me Nyankopɔn no, na mayɛ biribiara a wohyɛɛ me sɛ menyɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15"/>Fi wo soro tenabea kronkron hɔ hwɛ fam na hyira wo nkurɔfo Israel ne asase a wode ama yɛn no—asase a nufusu ne ɛwo resen wɔ so sɛnea wode ntam hyɛɛ yɛn agyanom bɔ no.”<verse eid="DEU 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Mmara Sodi Ho Nkaebɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, hyɛ mo nnɛ sɛ, munni saa ahyɛde ne mmara yi nyinaa so; momfa mo koma ne mo kra nyinaa nni so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="DEU 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17"/>Moapae mu aka no nnɛ se, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ, mo Nyankopɔn, na mobɛnantew nʼakwan so na mubedi ne mmara so ayɛ osetie ama no. <verse eid="DEU 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka no nnɛ se, moyɛ ne nkurɔfo, nʼagyapade a ne koma da ho sɛnea ɔhyɛɛ bɔ no; ɛno nti, ɛsɛ sɛ mudi nʼahyɛde nyinaa so. <verse eid="DEU 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19"/>Na sɛ moyɛ saa a, ɔbɛyɛ mo kɛse asen ɔman biara. Afei, mubenya nkamfo ne anuonyam a ɛboro aman a wayɛ no nyinaa de so. Mobɛyɛ ɔman a ɛyɛ kronkron ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, sɛnea ɔhyɛɛ bɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 26:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Bepɔw Ebal Afɔremuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1"/>Mose ne Israel mpanyimfo hyɛɛ ɔmanfo no se, “Munni mmara a mede rema mo nnɛ yi nyinaa so. <verse eid="DEU 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2"/>Sɛ mutwa Yordan kodu asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo no so a, monhyehyɛ abo akɛse na momfa akaadoo nsra ho. <verse eid="DEU 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3"/>Sɛ mutwa Yordan kɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo no so, asase a ɛwo ne nufusu resen so no so a, monkyerɛw mmara no nyinaa ngu so sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo agyanom Nyankopɔn, hyɛɛ mo bɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4"/>Na sɛ mutwa Yordan a, monhyehyɛ abo yi wɔ Ebal bepɔw so sɛnea merehyɛ mo nnɛ yi na momfa akaadoo nsra ho. <verse eid="DEU 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5"/>Munsi afɔremuka, abo afɔremuka wɔ hɔ mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no. Mommfa dade biribiara nka. <verse eid="DEU 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6"/>Momfa abo amuamu nsi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, afɔremuka no na mommɔ ɔhyew afɔre wɔ so mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no. <verse eid="DEU 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7"/>Mommɔ asomdwoe afɔre nso wɔ so na momfa anigye nnidi wɔ hɔ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim. <verse eid="DEU 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8"/>Monkyerɛw mmara no mu nhyehyɛe nyinaa pɛpɛɛpɛ ngu abo a wɔde akaadoo asra ho no so.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnome A Efi Bepɔw Ebal So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9"/>Afei, Mose ne Lewifo asɔfo kasa kyerɛɛ Israelfo no se, “Israel, monyɛ komm na muntie! Nnɛ, moabɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, manfo. <verse eid="DEU 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10"/>Monyɛ osetie mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, na munni ne mmara ne nʼahyɛde a mede rema mo nnɛ yi so.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11"/>Saa da no ara, Mose hyɛɛ ɔmanfo no se:<verse eid="DEU 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12"/>Sɛ mutwa Asubɔnten Yordan a Simeon, Lewi, Yuda, Isakar, Yosef ne Benyamin mmusuakuw na wonnyina Gerisim bepɔw so nhyira ɔman no. <verse eid="DEU 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13"/>Ruben, Gad, Aser, Sebulon, Dan ne Naftali mmusuakuw nso nnyina Ebal bepɔw so nnome.<verse eid="DEU 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14"/>Lewifo nteɛteɛ mu nworo ngu nnipa a wɔwɔ Israel nyinaa so se:<verse eid="DEU 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15"/>“Nnome nka onipa a ɔbɛyɛ ohoni a wɔasen anaa nea wɔagu de ahyɛ kokoa mu. Saa ahoni, adwumfo nsa ano nnwuma yi yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyiwade.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:15">Na ɔman no nyinaa begye so se, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16"/>“Nnome nka obiara a obebu nʼagya anaa ne na animtiaa.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:16">Na ɔman no nyinaa begye so se, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17"/>“Nnome nka obiara a opia ɔhye nam so bɔ ne yɔnko korɔn.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:17">Na ɔman no nyinaa begye so se, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔma onifuraefo fom kwan.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:18">Na ɔman no nyinaa begye so se, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19"/>“Nnome nka obiara a osisi ahɔho, nyisaa ne akunafo.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:19">Na ɔman no nyinaa begye so se, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔne nʼagya yere bɛda, efisɛ wagu nʼagya mpa ho fi.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:20">Na ɔman no nyinaa begye so se, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔne aboa bɛda.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:21">Na ɔman no nyinaa begye so se, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔne ne nuabea bɛda, sɛ ɔyɛ nʼagya babea anaa ne na babea.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:22">Na ɔman no nyinaa begye so se, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔne nʼasebea bɛda.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:23">Na ɔman no nyinaa begye so se, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24"/>“Nnome nka obiara a obekum ɔfoforo wɔ kokoa mu.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:24">Na ɔman no nyinaa begye so se, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ogye apaade, kum onipa a ɔnyɛɛ bɔne biara.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:25">Na ɔman no nyinaa begye so se, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26"/>“Nnome nka obiara a wanni mmara nsɛm yi so na wannye anto mu.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:26">Na ɔman no nyinaa begye so se, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Osetie Mu Nhyira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1"/>Na sɛ mutie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, na mudi mmara a mede rema mo nnɛ yi so a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛpagyaw mo wɔ aman a wɔwɔ wiase nyinaa no so. <verse eid="DEU 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2"/>Sɛ mutie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, a mubenya saa nhyira yi nyinaa:<verse eid="DEU 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3"/>Wobehyira mo wɔ mo nkurow ne mo man mu.<verse eid="DEU 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4"/>Wobehyira mo yafunu mu aba, ne mo nsase so nnɔbae, ne mo nyɛmmoa, nantwimma ne nguamma.<verse eid="DEU 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5"/>Wɔde nnuaba nkɛntɛn amaama, ne mmɔre korow a brodo no ahyɛ ma behyira mo.<verse eid="DEU 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6"/>Wobehyira mo fieba mu ne mo adifi mu.<verse eid="DEU 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7"/>Sɛ atamfo tow hyɛ mo so a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bedi wɔn so. Wobefi baabi atow ahyɛ mo so na wɔafa akwan ason so ahwete, afi mo anim.<verse eid="DEU 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8"/>Biribiara a mobɛyɛ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> behyira so na obehyira mo asan. <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, behyira mo wɔ asase a ɔde rema mo no so.<verse eid="DEU 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9"/>Sɛ mudi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, ahyɛde so na moyɛ osetie ma no a, Awurade begyina mo sɛ ne nnipa kronkron sɛnea ɔhyɛɛ mo bɔ sɛ ɔbɛyɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10"/>Afei, asase so nnipa nyinaa behu sɛ, moyɛ nnipa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ne din afrɛ mo na wobesuro mo. <verse eid="DEU 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma mo yiyedi a ɛboro so–mo yafunu mu aba, nyɛmmoa mma ne mo asase so nnɔbae—wɔ asase a ɔhyɛɛ mo agyanom bɔ sɛ ɔde bɛma mo no so.<verse eid="DEU 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi nʼahonya dodow a ɛwɔ soro no mu bɛma osu atɔ wɔ ne bere mu, nam so ahyira mo nnwuma a moyɛ so. Mobɛfɛm aman pii, nanso mo de, moremfɛm hwee mfi wɔn nkyɛn. <verse eid="DEU 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13"/>Sɛ mutie saa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, ahyɛde a mede rema mo nnɛ yi na mudi so pɛpɛɛpɛ a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛyɛ mo eti na ɛnyɛ bodua, na moakorɔn daa. <verse eid="DEU 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ moman fa benkum anaa nifa fi ahyɛde a mede rema mo nnɛ yi biara ho sɛ morekodi anyame foforo akyi asom wɔn.<verse eid="DEU 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asoɔden Ho Nnome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15"/>Na sɛ moantie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anni ne mmara ne nʼahyɛde a mede rema mo nnɛ yi nyinaa so pɛpɛɛpɛ a, saa nnome yi nyinaa bɛba abebunkam afa mo so.<verse eid="DEU 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16"/>Nnome bɛka mo wɔ mo nkuropɔn ne mo man mu.<verse eid="DEU 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17"/>Wɔde nkɛntɛn a aduaba biara nni mu ne mmɔre korow a brodo nni mu bɛdome mo.<verse eid="DEU 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18"/>Wɔbɛdome wo yafunu aba, ne wʼasase so nnɔbae. Ne wo nyɛmmoa mu nantwimma ne nguamma.<verse eid="DEU 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19"/>Wɔbɛdome wo fieba ne wo adifi.<verse eid="DEU 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma nnome, basabasayɛ ne huammɔdi aba ade biara a moyɛ mu, kosi sɛ awiei no wɔbɛsɛe mo koraa sɛ moayɛ bɔne na moagyaw no nti. <verse eid="DEU 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de nyarewa bɛba mo so akosi sɛ ɔbɛsɛe mo nyinaa wɔ asase a morebɛkɔ akɔfa no so. <verse eid="DEU 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ɔyare a ɛbɛma mo afonfɔn bɛka mo. Ɔbɛma atiridii ne ahonhon abɔ mo na wama ɔhyew a ano yɛ den, nnɔbae nyarewa ne kakawirewire aba mo so na ahaw mo ara akosi sɛ mo ase bɛtɔre. <verse eid="DEU 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23"/>Ɔsoro a ɛkata mo ti so no bɛdan sumpii na fam adan dade. <verse eid="DEU 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛdan osutɔ a ɛwɔ mo man mu no mfutuma; ɛbɛtɔ afi soro agu mo so akosi sɛ mobɛsɛe.<verse eid="DEU 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma mo adi nkogu wɔ mo atamfo anim. Mobɛfa baabi akɔtow ahyɛ mo atamfo so, nanso mobɛfa akwan ahorow ason so aguan afi wɔn anim. Mobɛyɛ atantanne ama ahenni a ɛwɔ asase yi so no nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26"/>Mo afunu bɛyɛ nnomaa ne wuram mmoa aduan na obiara nso nni hɔ saa bere no a, ɔbɛpam wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma mpɔmpɔ a esisii wɔ Misraim no bi asisi mo. Na ɔde mpɔmpɔ, ntutui ne ntwom a wɔrentumi nsa bɛbobɔ mo. <verse eid="DEU 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de adammɔ, anifurae ne adwene mu basabasayɛ bɛto mo so. <verse eid="DEU 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29"/>Mode mo nsa bɛkeka awia ketee te sɛnea onifuraefo de ne nsa keka anadwo no. Biribiara a moyɛ no, morenni mu nkonim. Wɔbɛhyɛ mo so, abɔ mo korɔn daa na obiara remmegye mo.<verse eid="DEU 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30"/>Mubesi ɔbea asiwa nso obi bɛhyɛ no ne no ada. Mubesi dan, nanso morentena mu. Mobɛyɛ bobeturo nanso morenni mu aba. <verse eid="DEU 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31"/>Wobekum mo nantwi wɔ mo anim, nanso morennya ne nam bi nwe. Wobegye mo afurum afi mo nsam a wɔrensan mfa mmrɛ mo. Wɔde mo nguan bɛma mo atamfo na morennya ɔboafo a obegye wɔn ama mo. <verse eid="DEU 28:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32"/>Wɔde mo mmabarima ne mo mmabea bɛma ɔman foforo na daa mobɛhwɛ wɔn ara ama mo ani atɔ dwe nanso morentumi nyɛ ho hwee. <verse eid="DEU 28:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33"/>Nnipa a munnim wɔn na wɔbɛfow mo brɛ so ade adi na daa wɔasan ahyɛ mo so. <verse eid="DEU 28:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34"/>Mo ani so ade a mubehu no bɛbɔ mo dam. <verse eid="DEU 28:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma mpɔmpɔ a ɛyɛ yaw a wɔko a ɛnkɔ abobɔ mo nkotodwe ne mo anan ho na atrɛw afi mo nantin akosi mo mpampam.<verse eid="DEU 28:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛpam mo ne mo hene a odi mo so no akɔ ɔman bi a mo ne mo agyanom nnim so so. Ɛhɔ na mobɛsom anyame afoforo, anyame a wɔde nnua ne abo ayɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37"/>Mobɛyɛ atantanne, akyiwade ne aserewde ama aman a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de mobɛkɔ so no nyinaa so.<verse eid="DEU 28:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38"/>Mubedua bebree wɔ mo nsase so, nanso mubetwa kakraa bi, efisɛ mmoadabi bɛwe mo nnɔbae. <verse eid="DEU 28:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39"/>Mobɛyɛ bobe nturo ahwɛ so yiye nanso morennom anaa morenni so aba, efisɛ asunson bedi. <verse eid="DEU 28:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40"/>Mubedua ngonnua afa mo nsase so nyinaa, nanso morennya mu ngo biara, efisɛ ngo aba no bɛtetew agu fam. <verse eid="DEU 28:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41"/>Mobɛwo mmabarima ne mmabea, nanso nyɛ mo na mobɛtetew wɔn, efisɛ wɔbɛkɔ nnommum mu. <verse eid="DEU 28:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42"/>Mmoadabi kuw bɛfa mo asase so nnua ne nnɔbae.<verse eid="DEU 28:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43"/>Ahɔho a wɔte mo mu no bɛkorɔn abunkam mo so, nanso mobɛkɔ so amem akɔ fam. <verse eid="DEU 28:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44"/>Wɔbɛbɔ mo bosea a moremmɔ wɔn bi. Wɔbɛyɛ eti na moayɛ dua.<verse eid="DEU 28:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45"/>Sɛ moanyɛ osetie amma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anni ahyɛde a ɔde ama mo no so a, saa nnome yi nyinaa bɛba mo so na ebedi mo akyi na abunkam afa mo so akosi sɛ wɔbɛsɛe mo. <verse eid="DEU 28:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46"/>Saa nsɛm a ɛyɛ hu yi bɛba sɛ nsɛnkyerɛnne ne kɔkɔbɔ ama mo ne mo asefo daa nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 28:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47"/>Esiane sɛ moamfa anigye ne ahosɛpɛw ansom <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, wɔ bere a esii mo yiye no, nti, <verse eid="DEU 28:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48"/>enti mubefi ɔkɔm ne osukɔm, adagyaw ne ohia buruburoo mu asom mo atamfo a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛsoma wɔn aba mo so no. Wɔbɛhyɛ mo nnade konnua akosi sɛ mobɛsɛe.<verse eid="DEU 28:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ɔman bi a ɛwɔ akyirikyiri baabi, wɔ asase ano, ɔman a monte wɔn kasa no, bɛba mo so na wɔatow ahyɛ mo so te sɛnea ɔkɔre sian no, <verse eid="DEU 28:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50"/>ɔman a wɔn ho yɛ hu na wommu ɔpanyin, na wonni ahummɔbɔ mma mmofra. <verse eid="DEU 28:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51"/>Nʼasraafo bɛtow ahyɛ mo nyɛmmoa ne mo asase so nnɔbae so adi no fuu akosi sɛ mubewuwu. Wɔrennyaw atoko, nsa foforo anaa ngo; mo nyɛmmoa nantwimma anaa nguamma kosi sɛ mobɛsɛe. <verse eid="DEU 28:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52"/>Wobetua mo nkuropɔn nyinaa ano akosi sɛ wɔbɛka mo afasu dennen a mode mo ho too so sɛ ɛbɛbɔ mo ho ban wɔ mo asase no so no nyinaa no agu. Wobetua asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de rema mo no so nkuropɔn no nyinaa ano.<verse eid="DEU 28:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53"/>Esiane ɔhaw ne abɛbrɛsɛ a ɔtamfo de bɛba mo so wɔ bere a wɔatua mo ano no mu no nti, mobɛwe mo yafunu mu aba, mo mmabarima ne mmabea a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn no de ama mo no nam. <verse eid="DEU 28:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54"/>Mpo, mo mu ɔhobrɛaseni a nʼani da hɔ no renhu ɔno ara ne nuabarima anaa ne yere a ɔdɔ no, anaa ne mma a wɔte ase no mmɔbɔ, <verse eid="DEU 28:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55"/>na ɔremma wɔn mu biara ne mma no mu bi nam a ɔrewe no. Esiane sɛ ɛno ara ne nea aka a ɔbɛwe wɔ bere a mo atamfo atua mo nkuropɔn no nyinaa ano rehiahia mo ho no nti. <verse eid="DEU 28:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56"/>Mo mu ɔbea a ɔbrɛ ne ho ase na ɔwɔ nkatede wɔ ne mu, a mpo ɔmpɛ sɛ ɔde ne nantin besi fam no benya ne kunu a ɔdɔ no ne ɔno ara ne mmabarima anaa ne mmabea ho menasepɔw. <verse eid="DEU 28:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57"/>Ɔbea no de awo akyi ade ne abofra a wawo no foforo no besie wɔn sɛnea obetumi awe ne nyinaa wɔ kokoa mu, esiane ɔhaw ne abɛbrɛsɛ a mo atamfo de bɛba mo so, bere a wɔatua mo nkuropɔn ano no nti.<verse eid="DEU 28:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58"/>Sɛ moanni mmara a wɔakyerɛw wɔ saa nhoma yi mu no nyinaa so pɛpɛɛpɛ, na moanni saa onuonyamfo ne ɔnwonwani <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, no din ni a, <verse eid="DEU 28:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ɔyaredɔm a ɛyɛ hu bɛba mo ne mo asefo. Ɛbɛyɛ atoyerɛnkyɛm a ano yɛ den ne ɔyaredɔm a ano yɛ den na ɛbɛtena hɔ akyɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60"/>Ɔde ɔyaredɔm ahorow a ɛbaa wɔ Misraim a ɛbɔɔ mo hu no bɛba bɛtena mo so. <verse eid="DEU 28:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de nyarewa ahorow bebree ne atoyerɛnkyɛm a wɔnkyerɛw wɔ Mmara Nhoma yi mu no bɛbrɛ mo akosi sɛ mobɛsɛe. <verse eid="DEU 28:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62"/>Mo a na modɔɔso te sɛ ɔsoro nsoromma no, mo so bɛtew koraa, efisɛ moantie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no. <verse eid="DEU 28:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63"/>Sɛnea na ɛyɛ Awurade anisɔ sɛ ɔbɛma mo adi yiye na moadɔɔso no, saa ara nso na ɛbɛyɛ no anisɔ sɛ ɔbɛdwerɛw mo na wasɛe mo. Obetutu mo ase afi asase a morekɔ so akɔfa no so.<verse eid="DEU 28:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ mo apansam afra aman nyinaa afi asase ano akosi asase ano. Ɛhɔ na mobɛsom ahɔho anyame a mo anaa mo agyanom nhuu bi da; anyame a wɔde nnua ne abo ayɛ! <verse eid="DEU 28:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65"/>Morennya guankɔbea anaa homebea mma mo anantin wɔ saa aman no so. Ɛhɔ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma mo adwene a ɛpere, aniwa a ayɛ siamoo ne koma a apa abawa. <verse eid="DEU 28:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66"/>Mo asetena bedi nsensɛnmu daa, na ehu bɛhyɛ mo so anadwo ne awia a munnim nea ɛrekɔ so wɔ mo asetena mu. <verse eid="DEU 28:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67"/>Anɔpa mobɛka se, “Sɛ ɛyɛɛ anwummere a!” Na anwummere nso mobɛka se, “Sɛ ɛyɛɛ anɔpa a!” Mobɛka saa, esiane ehu a ɛbɛhyɛ mo koma amaama ne nea atwa mo ho ahyia a mo ani behu no. <verse eid="DEU 28:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma mo atenatena ahyɛn mu asan akɔ Misraim, akwantu a mehyɛɛ sɛ ɛnsɛ sɛ mutu bio no. Ɛhɔ na mode mo ho bɛma mo atamfo sɛ wɔntɔ mo sɛ nkoa, nanso obiara rempɛ sɛ ɔbɛtɔ mo.<verse eid="DEU 28:68"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Apam No Ntimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1"/>Eyinom ne nhyehyɛe a ɛwɔ apam a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose sɛ ɔne Israelfo no nyɛ wɔ Moab nka apam a ɔne wɔn yɛɛ no wɔ Horeb no mu no ho.<verse eid="DEU 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2"/>Mose frɛɛ Israelfo no nyinaa ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 29:2"/>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 29:2">Moahu nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛɛ Farao ne ne mpanyimfo ne ne man nyinaa wɔ Misraim no. <verse eid="DEU 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3"/>Mo ankasa muhuu sɔhwɛ akɛse, nsɛnkyerɛnne a ɛyɛ hu ne anwonwade akɛse no. <verse eid="DEU 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4"/>Nanso de besi nnɛ yi, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmaa mo adwene a ɛte asɛm ase anaa ani a ehu ade anaa aso a ɛte asɛm. <verse eid="DEU 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5"/>Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, mfe aduanan a midii mo anim faa sare so no mu no, mo ntama antetew, na mo mpaboa a ɛhyehyɛ mo anan nso anhwere. <verse eid="DEU 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6"/>Moanni brodo, annom nsa anaa nsa a ano yɛ den. Meyɛɛ saa sɛnea mubehu sɛ mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no.<verse eid="DEU 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7"/>Yeduu ha no, Hesbonhene Sihon ne Basanhene Og ba bɛko tiaa yɛn, nanso yedii wɔn so. <verse eid="DEU 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8"/>Yɛfaa wɔn asase de maa Ruben ne Gad mmusuakuw ne Manase abusuakuw no fa sɛ wɔn agyapade.<verse eid="DEU 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9"/>Ɛno nti, munni saa apam yi so sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a biribiara a mobɛyɛ no bɛyɛ yiye. <verse eid="DEU 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10"/>Mo nyinaa—mo mmusuakuw mpanyimfo, mo atemmufo, mo ahwɛfo ne Israel mmarima nyinaa, nnɛ mugyina <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim; <verse eid="DEU 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11"/>mo ne mo mma ne mo yerenom ne ahɔho a wɔte mo mu a wobu mo nnua, soa mo nsu. <verse eid="DEU 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12"/>Mugyina ha sɛ mo ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, rebɛyɛ apam; apam a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne mo reyɛ nnɛ na ɔde ntam resɔw ano <verse eid="DEU 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13"/>na wasi so gyinae sɛ nnɛ, moyɛ ne nkurɔfo na ɔno nso bɛyɛ mo Nyankopɔn, sɛnea ɔhyɛɛ mo bɔ no na ɔkaa ntam kyerɛɛ mo agyanom Abraham, Isak ne Yakob no. <verse eid="DEU 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14"/>Mereyɛ saa apam yi a ne ntam bata ho a, ɛnyɛ mo nko a, <verse eid="DEU 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15"/>mo ne yɛn gyina ha nnɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, anim na mmom, wɔn a wonni ha nnɛ nso ka ho bi.<verse eid="DEU 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16"/>Mo ankasa munim sɛnea yɛtenaa Misraim ne sɛnea yɛreba ha no yɛfaa aman so besii ha. <verse eid="DEU 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17"/>Muhuu akyiwade ahoni a wɔde nnua ne abo ne dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ ayɛ wɔ wɔn nkyɛn. <verse eid="DEU 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18"/>Monhwɛ yiye sɛ ɔbarima anaa ɔbea anaa abusua biara a ɛwɔ mo mu nnɛ no mu biara koma rennan mfi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, ho nkɔsom saa aman yi anyame; monhwɛ sɛ ntin biara nni mo mu a epuw bɔre a ɛyɛ nwen saa.<verse eid="DEU 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19"/>Sɛ saa onipa no te ntam yi mu nsɛm na ohyira ne ho, na ɔka wɔ ne tirim se, “Me ho sɔnn, ɛmfa ho sɛ menam asoɔden kwan so.” Eyi de atoyerɛnkyɛm bɛba asase a so afɔw ne nea so awo no nyinaa so. <verse eid="DEU 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> remfa nkyɛ saa onipa no. Nʼabufuw ne ne ninkunu bɛdɛw atia no. Nnome a wɔakyerɛw no saa nhoma yi mu no nyinaa bɛba ne so na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛpepa ne din afi ɔsoro ase. <verse eid="DEU 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛtwe no afi Israel mmusuakuw nyinaa mu na wahwie apam no mu nnome nyinaa a wɔakyerɛw wɔ saa mmara nhoma no mu no agu ne so.<verse eid="DEU 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22"/>Mo mma a wɔbɛba wɔ daakye awo ntoatoaso mu no ne wɔn a wofi ahɔho ase a wofi akyirikyiri asase so behu asase no sɛe ne nyarewa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de bɛbrɛ asase no. <verse eid="DEU 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23"/>Wobehu sɛ, wɔn asase no nyinaa adan sufre ne nkyene a wonnua so hwee, na hwee mfifi wɔ so na ahabammono biara nnyina so, a ɛnyɛ yiye na hwee nso nnyin wɔ so; sare ahaban mpo. Ɛbɛyɛ sɛ Sodom ne Gomora, Adma ne Seboim a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛee no nʼabufuwhyew mu no. <verse eid="DEU 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24"/>Aman a atwa ahyia no bebisa se, “Adɛn nti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayɛ saa asase yi saa? Adɛn nti na ne bo fu dennen saa?”<verse eid="DEU 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25"/>Na wɔbɛka akyerɛ wɔn se, “Saa asɛm yi sii, efisɛ nnipa a wɔwɔ asase no so buu apam a wɔne <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn agyanom Nyankopɔn no, yɛe bere a oyii wɔn fii Misraim asase so no. <verse eid="DEU 29:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26"/>Wɔdan kɔsom anyame afoforo wɔkotow wɔn, anyame a wonnim wɔn, anyame a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnsom. <verse eid="DEU 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27"/>Ɛno nti <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuw dɛw tiaa saa asase yi, nam so de nnome a wɔakyerɛw wɔ saa nhoma yi mu no nyinaa baa wɔn so no. <verse eid="DEU 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28"/>Abufuwhyew mu, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tutuu ne nkurɔfo ase fii wɔn asase so twaa wɔn asu de wɔn koguu asase foforo so, sɛnea ɛte mprempren yi.”<verse eid="DEU 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29"/>Kokoamsɛm yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Nyankopɔn no, dea, nanso nneɛma a wɔda no adi no yɛ yɛn ne yɛn asefo dea daa, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a yebedi saa mmara yi mu nsɛm so.<verse eid="DEU 29:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30"/>
  <para style="s1">Awurade Nkyɛn Ba Mu Yiyedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1"/>Sɛ nhyira ne nnome a mede ato mo anim no nyinaa ba mo so, na mode hyɛ mo koma mu wɔ baabiara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛfa mo akɔ, wɔ aman no mu, <verse eid="DEU 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2"/>na mo ne mo mma san ba <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, nkyɛn, na mode mo koma ne mo kra nyinaa yɛ osetie ma no sɛnea merekyerɛ mo nnɛ yi a, <verse eid="DEU 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3"/>ɛno de, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de mo siade bɛma mo, na wahu mo mmɔbɔ, na waboaboa mo ano bio afi amanaman a ɔbɔɔ mo hwete kɔɔ so no nyinaa so, asan de mo aba. <verse eid="DEU 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4"/>Sɛ mpo, wɔapam mo kɔ akyirikyiri asase bi a ɛwɔ ɔsoro ase a, efi hɔ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛboaboa mo ano asan de mo aba. <verse eid="DEU 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5"/>Ɔde mo bɛba asase a ɛyɛ mo agyanom de no so na moafa sɛ agyapade. Ɔbɛma mo adi yiye na moadɔɔso asen mo agyanom. <verse eid="DEU 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, beyi fi a ɛwɔ mo ne mo asefo koma mu no sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a mode mo koma ne mo kra nyinaa bɛdɔ no na moanya nkwa. <verse eid="DEU 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, de saa nnome yi nyinaa begu mo atamfo a wɔtaa mo no so. <verse eid="DEU 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8"/>Mobɛsan atie, adi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛde a mede rema mo nnɛ no nyinaa so. <verse eid="DEU 30:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bɛma biribiara a moyɛ no asi mo yiye. Ɔbɛma mo yafunu mu aba asi yiye pii. Mo nyɛmmoa bɛdɔɔso. Na mo mfuw mu nnɔbae nso bebu so, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, ani begye sɛ ɔbɛma mo adi yiye sɛnea na ɔyɛ mo agyanom no. <verse eid="DEU 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10"/>Sɛ mutie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, nne, na mudi nʼahyɛde ne ne mmara a wɔakyerɛw wɔ saa Mmara Nhoma no mu no so, na mode mo koma ne mo kra dɔ no a, nʼani begye mo yiyedi ho.<verse eid="DEU 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Owu Ne Nkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11"/>Nokware, saa mmara a merehyɛ ama mo nnɛ yi sodi nyɛ den na ɛnyɛ ade a morentumi nyɛ nso. <verse eid="DEU 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12"/>Enni ɔsoro a enti mobɛka se, “Hena na ɔbɛkɔ ɔsoro ama yɛn na wakogye abrɛ yɛn, na yɛate adi so?” <verse eid="DEU 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13"/>Saa ara nso na enni po agya a enti mobɛka se, “Hena na obetwa akɔ ɛpo fa nohɔ ama yɛn na wakogye abrɛ yɛn, na yɛate adi so?” <verse eid="DEU 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14"/>Dabi, asɛm no abɛn wo. Ɛda wʼano na ɛwɔ wo koma mu sɛ mudi so.<verse eid="DEU 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15"/>Muntie, nnɛ, mede nkwa ne yiyedi, owu ne ɔsɛe asi mo anim. <verse eid="DEU 30:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16"/>Na Sɛ mutie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, mmara a merehyɛ ama mo nnɛ yi, nam so dɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, nantew nʼakwan mu, di ne mmara so a, mubenya nkwa na mo ase adɔ, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn behyira mo wɔ asase a morekɔ akɔtena so no so.<verse eid="DEU 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17"/>Nanso sɛ mo koma dan, sɛ moanyɛ osetie, na sɛ wɔtwe mo kɔkotow anyame afoforo, na mosom wɔn a, <verse eid="DEU 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18"/>mepae mu ka kyerɛ mo nnɛ sɛ, nea ɛte biara no wɔbɛsɛe mo; morentena asase a moretwa Yordan akɔ so akɔfa sɛ agyapade no so nkyɛ.<verse eid="DEU 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19"/>Nnɛ mede nkwa ne owu, nhyira ne nnome, asi mo anim sɛ munyi nea mopɛ. Mefrɛ ɔsoro ne asase sɛ nnansefo. Momfa nkwa sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a mo ne mo asefo benya nkwa! <verse eid="DEU 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20"/>Monnɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, monyɛ osetie mma no, na momfa mo ho mma no, efisɛ ɔno ne mo nkwa. Ɛno na mobɛtena ase akyɛ wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa ntam sɛ ɔde bɛma mo tete agyanom; Abraham, Isak ne Yakob no.<verse eid="DEU 30:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Yosua Di Mose Ade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1"/>Bere a Mose kaa saa nsɛm yi kyerɛɛ Israelfo wiee no, <verse eid="DEU 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2"/>ɔkaa bio se, “Mprempren madi mfe ɔha ne aduonu, nti merentumi nni mo anim bio. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ me sɛ merentwa Asubɔnten Yordan. <verse eid="DEU 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3"/>Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, ankasa bedi mo anim atwa. Ɔbɛsɛe aman a wɔte hɔ na mobɛfa wɔn asase no. Yosua ne onipa foforo a obedi mo anim sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ mo bɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛsɛe aman aman a wɔte asase no so no sɛnea ɔsɛee Sihon ne Og a na wɔyɛ Amorifo ahemfo no. <verse eid="DEU 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de nnipa a wɔte hɔ no bɛhyɛ mo nsa na ɛsɛ sɛ mo ne wɔn di no sɛnea mahyɛ mo no. <verse eid="DEU 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6"/>Monyɛ den na mo bo nyɛ duru! Munnsuro wɔn! <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, bedi mo anim. Ɔrenni mo huammɔ na ɔrennyaw mo nso.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7"/>Afei, Mose frɛɛ Yosua ka kyerɛɛ no wɔ Israelfo no nyinaa anim se, “Yɛ den na yɛ nnam, na wo na wode ɔman yi bɛkɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa wɔn agyanom ntam sɛ ɔde bɛma wɔn no so; na wo na wobɛkyɛ ama wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔredi wʼanim. Ɔbɛka wo ho; ɔrenni wo huammɔ na ɔrennyaw wo nti nsuro na mma wo koma ntu!”<verse eid="DEU 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara No Kenkan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9"/>Afei, Mose kyerɛw mmara yi too hɔ; ɔde maa Lewifo asɔfo a wɔsoaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apam adaka no ne Israel mpanyimfo nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10"/>Mose hyɛɛ wɔn se, “Mfe ason biara awiei, Asese Afahyɛ mu no, wɔmfa obiara ka a ɔde no nkyɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11"/>Israelfo nyinaa nhyia wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn no, anim wɔ faako a ɔbɛkyerɛ no, na moakenkan saa mmara yi wɔ wɔn anim ama wɔate. <verse eid="DEU 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12"/>Frɛ nnipa no nyinaa, mmarima, mmea, mmofra ne ahɔho a wɔte mo nkurow so nso sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a wɔbɛte na wobesua sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wosuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, na wobedi mmara no so pɛpɛɛpɛ <verse eid="DEU 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13"/>na ama wɔn mma a wonnim mmara no ate na wɔasua sɛnea ɛsɛ sɛ wosuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn no, mmere dodow a mote asase a moretwa Yordan akɔfa sɛ agyapade no so.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔka Israel Asoɔden Ho Asɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose se, “Wo wu bere aso. Frɛ Yosua na fa no kɔ Ahyiae Ntamadan no mu, faako a mede nʼadwuma bɛhyɛ ne nsa no.” Enti Mose ne Yosua kɔdaa wɔn ho adi wɔ Ahyiae Ntamadan no mu.<verse eid="DEU 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ wɔn wɔ omununkum fadum mu, na omununkum no gyinaa ntamadan no abobow ano. <verse eid="DEU 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose se, “Ɛrenkyɛ wubewu na woakɔka wʼagyanom ho, na ɛrenkyɛ na saa nnipa yi de wɔn ho bɛma anyame hɔho a wɔwɔ asase a wɔrekɔ so no so no. Wobegyaw me na wɔabu apam a me ne wɔn hyehyɛɛ no so. <verse eid="DEU 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17"/>Na saa da no, me bo befuw wɔn na mapo wɔn; mede mʼanim behintaw wɔn na wɔbɛsɛe wɔn. Ɔhaw a emu yɛ den ahorow pii bɛba wɔn so ama wɔabisa se, ‘So ɛnsɛ sɛ saa ɔhaw yi ba, esiane sɛ Onyankopɔn nni yɛn nkyɛn bio no nti?’ <verse eid="DEU 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18"/>Saa bere no mede mʼanim behintaw wɔn esiane wɔn bɔne ahorow a wɔayɛ wɔ anyame afoforo a wɔsom no nti.<verse eid="DEU 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19"/>“Afei, monkyerɛw saa dwom yi mu nsɛm mfa na monkyerɛ Israelfo no, na wɔnto sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ adansede ama me na mede atia wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20"/>Mede wɔn bɛba asase a nufusu ne ɛwo resen wɔ so sɛnea mekaa ntam hyɛɛ wɔn agyanom bɔ no. Na wodidi mee yɛ akɛse a, afei, wɔbɛdan wɔn ani akɔsom anyame afoforo apo me, nam so abu mʼapam no so. <verse eid="DEU 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21"/>Afei, ɔhaw ne akwanside bebree ba wɔn so a, dwom yi bedi adanse atia wɔn, efisɛ wɔn asefo werɛ remfi da. Minim nea wotumi yɛ koraa ansa na mede wɔn bɛba asase a maka ho ntam ahyɛ bɔ no so.” <verse eid="DEU 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22"/>Enti Mose kyerɛw dwom no guu hɔ saa da no na ɔkyerɛɛ Israelfo no.<verse eid="DEU 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Nun babarima Yosua sɛ, “Yɛ den na yɛ nnam, efisɛ wo na wode Israelfo no bɛba asase a mekaa ntam hyɛɛ ho bɔ no so na mʼankasa mɛka mo ho.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24"/>Bere a Mose kyerɛw mmara nsɛm no nyinaa fi mfiase kosii awiei no guu nhoma mu wiei no, <verse eid="DEU 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25"/>ɔde saa ahyɛde yi maa Lewifo a na wɔsoa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apam adaka no: <verse eid="DEU 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26"/>“Momfa saa Mmara Nhoma yi nkɔto <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Nyankopɔn, apam adaka no nkyɛn. Ɛhɔ na ɛbɛda sɛ adansede a etia Israelfo. <verse eid="DEU 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27"/>Efisɛ minim sɛnea moyɛ atuatewfo ne asoɔden. Mpo, me ne mo da so wɔ hɔ yi, moatew <char style="nd">Awurade</char> so atua. Na me wu akyi no, atua bɛn na morentew! <verse eid="DEU 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28"/>Momfrɛ mo mpanyimfo nyinaa ne mo mmusuakuw ntuanofo nyinaa sɛnea metumi akasa akyerɛ wɔn na mafrɛ ɔsoro ne asase de adi adanse atia wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29"/>Minim sɛ me wu akyi no, mobɛsɛe koraa na moaman afi ɔkwan a makyerɛ mo sɛ momfa so no so. Mmere a ɛreba no, amanehunu bɛba mo so, efisɛ monam bɔne a mobɛyɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim no so no bɛhwanyan nʼabufuw.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose Dwom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30"/>Enti Mose kaa dwom no mu nsɛm nyinaa fi ti kosi ti kyerɛɛ Israelfo a wɔahyia hɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 31:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1"/>Monyɛ aso, mo ɔsoro na mɛkasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:1">tie, wo asase, nsɛm a efi mʼanom.<verse eid="DEU 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2"/>Ma me nkyerɛkyerɛ ntɔ sɛ osu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">na me nsɛm nsian sɛ obosu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">sɛ osu a ɛpete gu sare foforo so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">sɛ osu mmoroso wɔ afifide foforo so.<verse eid="DEU 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3"/>Mɛbɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:3">O, monkamfo yɛn Nyankopɔn kɛseyɛ!<verse eid="DEU 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4"/>Ɔne Ɔbotan no, ne nnwuma so nni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">na nʼakwan nyinaa ye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">Onyankopɔn nokwafo a ɔnyɛ mfomso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">Ɔtreneeni ne ɔnokwafo ne no.<verse eid="DEU 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5"/>Porɔwee adidi wɔn mu na wɔnyɛ ne mma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">wɔyɛ awo ntoatoaso akɔntɔnkyefo aniwufo.<verse eid="DEU 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6"/>Saa ne ɔkwan a ɛsɛ sɛ mofa so tua <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka ni ana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">mo nkwaseafo ne adwenharefo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">Ɛnyɛ ɔno ne mo Agya, mo yɛfo no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">Ɛnyɛ ɔno na ɔbɔɔ mo na ɔmaa mo nnyinaso?<verse eid="DEU 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7"/>Monkae tete nna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">munnwen tete awo ntoatoaso no ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Mummisa mo agya na ɔbɛkyerɛ mo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">Mummisa mo mpanyimfo na wɔbɛkyerɛ mo ase.<verse eid="DEU 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8"/>Bere a Ɔsorosoroni no maa amanaman no agyapade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">na ɔkyekyɛɛ adesamma nyinaa mu no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">ɔtotoo ahye maa nnipa no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">sɛnea Israelmma no dodow te.<verse eid="DEU 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9"/>Efisɛ Israelfo yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyɛfa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:9">Yakob yɛ nʼagyapade wɔde maa no.<verse eid="DEU 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10"/>Ohuu no wɔ sare asase so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">asase kesee a hwee nni so so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">Ɔde no sie hwɛɛ ne so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">ɔbɔɔ ne ho ban sɛ nʼaniwa kurutiayisi,<verse eid="DEU 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11"/>sɛ ɔkɔre a ɔhwanyan ne berebuw mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">na ɔbɔ mfamfia fa ne mma ho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">na ɔtrɛw ne ntaban mu buma no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">soaa no kɔɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12"/>Awurade nkutoo na ɔkyerɛɛ no kwan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:12">na ananafo nyame biara nka ne ho.<verse eid="DEU 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13"/>Ɔma no nantew faa asase no nkoko so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">na ɔde mfuw so nnuaba bɔɔ no akɔnhama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">Ɔde ɔbotan mu wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">ne ngo a efi abohemaa mu,<verse eid="DEU 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14"/>nyɛmmoa mu nufusu ne srade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">nguamma ne mmirekyi a wɔadɔ srade,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Basan adwennini a wɔpaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">ne atoko muhumuhu siesiee no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Monom nsa papa a efi bobe mu.<verse eid="DEU 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15"/>Yeshurun dɔɔ srade na onyaa ahoɔden;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">aduan ma wɔyɛɛ duru, yɛɛ pemee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">Wɔtoo Onyankopɔn a ɔbɔɔ wɔn no asaworam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">wɔpoo wɔn Nkwagye Botan no.<verse eid="DEU 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16"/>Wɔma ɔtwee ninkunu wɔ wɔn ananafo anyame no ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">na wɔde wɔn abosom a okyi no hyɛɛ no abufuw.<verse eid="DEU 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17"/>Wɔbɔɔ afɔre maa atoro anyame a wɔnyɛ Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">anyame a na wonnim wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">anyame a wɔbaa nnansa yi ara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">anyame a na mo agyanom nsuro wɔn.<verse eid="DEU 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18"/>Mopaa Ɔbotan a ɔyɛɛ mo agya no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:18">Mo werɛ fii Onyankopɔn a ɔwoo mo no.<verse eid="DEU 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> huu eyi na ɔpoo wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:19">efisɛ ne mmabarima ne ne mmabea hyɛɛ no abufuw.<verse eid="DEU 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20"/>Ɔkae se, “Mede mʼanim behintaw wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">na wɔahu sɛnea wɔn awiei bɛyɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">Efisɛ, wɔyɛ awo ntoatoaso akɔntɔnkyefo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">mma a wonni nokware.<verse eid="DEU 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21"/>Wɔde nea ɛnyɛ Onyame ahyɛ me ninkutwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">na wɔde wɔn ahoni ahuhuw no ahyɛ me abufuw.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Mɛma wɔn ani abere nnipa a wɔnyɛ me nkurɔfo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">Mɛma ɔman a wonni ntease no ahyɛ wɔn abufuw.<verse eid="DEU 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22"/>Efisɛ mʼabufuwhyew befita ogya mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">nea ɛhyew kɔka awufo a wɔwɔ asase ase no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">Ɛbɛsɛe asase ne so nnɔbae</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">na ɛpaapae mmepɔw fapem.<verse eid="DEU 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23"/>“Mɛhɔre amanehunu ahorow no siw wɔ wɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:23">na matow me bɛmma awowɔ wɔn.<verse eid="DEU 32:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24"/>Mede ɔkɔm kɛse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">atiridiinini ne owuyare a ɛsɛe ade;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">mɛsoma nkekammoa se aba wɔn so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">nhurutoa a wɔtow si wɔ mfutuma mu no ano bɔre.<verse eid="DEU 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25"/>Afoa bɛma wɔahwere wɔn mma wɔ abɔnten so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">wɔn afi mu, ehu bɛtɔ wɔn so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">Mmerante ne mmabaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">mmofra ne nkwakoraa ase bɛhyew.<verse eid="DEU 32:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26"/>Mekae se mɛbɔ wɔn ahwete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:26">na mapepa wɔn din afi nnipa adwene mu.<verse eid="DEU 32:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27"/>Nanso misuroo ɔtamfo fɛwdi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">anyɛ a na ɔtamfo ante ase aka se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">‘Yɛn nsa adi nkonim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">Ɛnyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔyɛɛ eyinom nyinaa.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28"/>Israel yɛ ɔman a wonni adwene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:28">Obi nni wɔn mu a ɔwɔ nhumu.<verse eid="DEU 32:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29"/>Sɛ anka wɔyɛ anyansafo na wɔbɛte eyi ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">na wɔahu nea wɔn awiei bɛyɛ ɛ!<verse eid="DEU 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30"/>Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na onipa baako ataa nnipa apem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">na baanu bɛma mpem du aguan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">gye sɛ wɔn Botan atɔn wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">gye sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi wɔn ama.<verse eid="DEU 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31"/>Efisɛ wɔn botan nte sɛ yɛn Botan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">sɛnea yɛn atamfo mpo gye to mu no.<verse eid="DEU 32:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32"/>Wɔn bobe fi Sodom bobe mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">na efi Gomora mfuw mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">Awuduru ahyɛ wɔn bobe aba mma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">na bɔnwoma ahyɛ wɔn kasiaw amaama.<verse eid="DEU 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33"/>Wɔn bobesa yɛ awɔ ano bɔre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:33">aprammiri ano bɔrewerɛmfo.<verse eid="DEU 32:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34"/>“So menkoraa eyi mmoroso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:34">na mensɔw ano wɔ mʼademude mu ana<verse eid="DEU 32:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35"/>Mɛtɔ were; metua so ka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">Wɔn nan bɛwatiri bere a ɛsɛ mu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">wɔn atoyerɛnkyɛm no abɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">na wɔn sɛe taa wɔn.”<verse eid="DEU 32:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bebu ne nkurɔfo atɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">na wasesa nʼadwene wɔ ne nkoa ho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">bere a wahu sɛ wɔn ahoɔden asa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">na ɛnkaa obiara, akoa anaa ɔdehye.<verse eid="DEU 32:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37"/>Obebisa se, “Afei wɔn anyame no wɔ he,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">ɔbotan a wɔde yɛɛ wɔn guankɔbea,<verse eid="DEU 32:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38"/>anyame a wodii wɔn afɔrebɔde mu srade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">na wɔnom wɔn ɔnom afɔrebɔ mu nsa no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">Ma wɔnsɔre mmɛboa mo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">Ma womegye mo!<verse eid="DEU 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39"/>“Afei, munhu sɛ, me ara me ne no!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">Onyame biara nni hɔ sɛ me!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Me na mikum na mema nkwa:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">Me na mipira, na mɛkyekye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">na obi rentumi nnye mfi me nsam.<verse eid="DEU 32:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40"/>Mema me nsa so kyerɛ ɔsoro de nidi sua sɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:40">Sɛ mete ase daa yi,<verse eid="DEU 32:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41"/>sɛ mesew me afoa a ɛpa yerɛwyerɛw no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">na mifi atemmu mu so mu kuaw a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">mɛtɔ mʼatamfo so were</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">na matua wɔn a wokyi me ka.<verse eid="DEU 32:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42"/>Mɛma me bɛmma anom mogya abow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">na mʼafoa adi ɔhonam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">atɔfo ne nnommumfo mogya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">atamfo ntuanofo no ti.”<verse eid="DEU 32:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43"/>Mo aman, mo ne ne nkurɔfo nni ahurusi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">efisɛ ɔbɛtɔ ne nkoa mogya so were;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">ɔbɛtɔ were wɔ nʼatamfo so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">na wapata ama nʼasase ne ne nkurɔfo.<verse eid="DEU 32:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44"/>Mose ne Nun babarima Hosea ba bɛkaa dwom yi mu nsɛm nyinaa kyerɛɛ nnipa no. <verse eid="DEU 32:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45"/>Mose woroo saa dwom no mu nsɛm no kyerɛɛ Israelfo no wiee no, <verse eid="DEU 32:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46"/>ɔka kaa ho se, “Momfa nsɛm a maka akyerɛ mo no nyinaa nsie mo koma mu. Monka nkyerɛ mo mma nso, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a wobedi saa mmara yi mu nsɛm nyinaa so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="DEU 32:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47"/>Saa nkyerɛkyerɛ yi nyɛ nsɛm bi a wɔde rema mo kwa, ɛyɛ mo nkwa! Sɛ mudi so a, mubenyin akyɛ wɔ asase a moretwa Asubɔnten Yordan akɔfa no so.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48"/>Da no ara, Awurade ka kyerɛɛ Mose se, <verse eid="DEU 32:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49"/>“Kɔ Moab, kɔ mmepɔw a ɛwɔ asu no apuei no so, na foro Nebo bepɔw a ɛne Yeriko di nhwɛanim no. To wʼani hwɛ Kanaan asase no, asase a mede rema Israelfo sɛ wɔn agyapade no. <verse eid="DEU 32:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50"/>Bepɔw a woaforo no so hɔ na wobɛkɔ akɔka wʼagyanom ho, sɛnea wo nua Aaron wuu wɔ Hor bepɔw so kɔkaa nʼagyanom ho no. <verse eid="DEU 32:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51"/>Efisɛ mo baanu dii me huammɔ wɔ Israelfo mu wɔ Meriba ne Kades asu ho wɔ Sin sare so. Moanni me kronkronyɛ ho adanse ankyerɛ Israelfo no wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 32:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52"/>Ɛno nti, mubehu asase no afi akyiri, nanso morenkɔ asase a mede rema Israelfo no so.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Mose Hyira Mmusuakuw No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1"/>Eyi ne nhyira a Onyankopɔn nipa Mose de hyiraa Israelfo no ansa na ɔrewu:<verse eid="DEU 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2"/>Ose, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi Sinai bae</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">ofi Seir baa wɔn so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">ɔhran fi Paran bepɔw so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Ɔde akronkronfo pii bae</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">fi anafo fam ne mmepɔw nsian so.<verse eid="DEU 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3"/>Nokware ni, wo na wodɔ nnipa no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">akronkronfo nyinaa wɔ wo nsam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Wɔn nyinaa kotow wo nan ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">na wonya nkyerɛkyerɛ fi wo hɔ,<verse eid="DEU 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4"/>mmara a Mose de maa yɛn no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:4">Yakob nkurɔfo agyapade.<verse eid="DEU 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5"/>Ɔyɛɛ ɔhene wɔ Yeshurun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">bere a nnipa no ntuanofo hyiae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">wɔne Israel mmusuakuw no.<verse eid="DEU 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6"/>“Ma Ruben nya nkwa na onwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">na mma ne nkurɔfo so nhuan.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7"/>Na ɔkaa eyi faa Yuda ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">“Tie, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, tie Yuda sufrɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">fa no brɛ ne nkurɔfo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Ɔde nʼankasa nsa bɔ ne ho ban.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">Ao, yɛ ne boafo tia nʼatamfo!”<verse eid="DEU 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8"/>Asɛm a ɔka faa Lewi abusuakuw ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">“<char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wode ade kronkron</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">ama wʼasomfo nokwafo Lewifo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">Wosɔɔ wɔn hwɛe wɔ Masa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">wɔne wɔn koe wɔ Meriba asu ho.<verse eid="DEU 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9"/>Lewifo tiee wʼasɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">bɔɔ wʼapam no ho ban.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Wodii wo nokware</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">sen sɛnea wodii wɔn awofo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">abusuafo ne wɔn mma nokware.<verse eid="DEU 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10"/>Afei, ma wɔnkyerɛ Yakob wo mmara no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">Ma wɔmfa wo nkyerɛkyerɛ no mma Israelfo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">Wɔde aduhuam bɛba wʼanim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">Abɛbɔ ɔhyew afɔre wɔ afɔremuka so.<verse eid="DEU 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11"/>Hyira Lewifo, Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">na ma wɔn nsa ano nnwuma nsɔ wʼani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Bubu wɔn atamfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">bɔ wɔn atamfo hwe fam a wɔnsɔre bio.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Benyamin abusuakuw ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">“Ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> dɔ nnye ntin wɔ Benyamin nkurɔfo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">efisɛ ɔbɔ wɔn ho ban daa nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">na nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> dɔ no no nhome wɔ ne nwini ase daa.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Yosef mmusuakuw ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> mfa ne sorosoro bosu a ɛsom bo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">ne bun mu nsu a efi asase ase no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">nhyira wɔn nsase.<verse eid="DEU 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14"/>Ɔmfa ne nnepa efi owia mu ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:14">ne adonne a ebetumi apue afi ɔsram so;<verse eid="DEU 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15"/>ne nnɔbae pa a efi tete mmepɔw mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:15">ne nea abu so wɔ nkoko a etim hɔ daa mu<verse eid="DEU 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16"/>ne akyɛde a ɛso nni a efi asase ne ne mayɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">ne adom a efi nea na ɔte nwura a ɛhyew mu no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Saa nhyira yi nyinaa mmra Yosef ti so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">nea ɔyɛ ne nuanom mu ɔheneba no anintɔn mu.<verse eid="DEU 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17"/>Yosef sɛ nantwinini a ɔyɛ abakan wɔ ahenni mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">Ne ahoɔden te sɛ ɔtrɔm mmɛn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Ɔde bɛwowɔ aman no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">wɔn a wɔwɔ asase ano no mpo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Eyinom ne Efraim mpem du du no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">eyinom ne Manase mpempem no.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Sebulon ne Isakar mmusuakuw ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">“Sebulon asefo, munni anigye wɔ mo adifi mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:18">Isakar asefo, munni anigye wɔ mo ntamadan mu.<verse eid="DEU 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19"/>Wɔbɛfrɛ nnipa ahorow akɔ bepɔw no so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">kɔbɔ trenee afɔre wɔ hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">wobefi po mu adenya mmoroso mu ato pon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">afi ademude a ahintaw wɔ nwea mu.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Gad abusuakuw ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">“Nhyira nka obi a ɔtrɛw Gad mantam mu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">Gad te hɔ sɛ gyata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">a ɔretetew abasa anaa eti.<verse eid="DEU 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21"/>Gad nkurɔfo paw asase pa no maa wɔn ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">ɔkannifo kyɛfa na wɔde maa wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">Bere a nkurɔfo no mpanyimfo hyiae no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">wɔyɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> atɛntrenee apɛde no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">ne nʼatemmu a ɛfa Israelfo ho no.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Dan abusuakuw ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:22">“Dan yɛ gyata ba a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">ɔrepue afi Basan.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Naftali abusuakuw ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">“Naftali wɔ adom bebree</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira ayɛ wo ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">ɔtare no anafo fam bɛyɛ wo kyɛfa.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Aser abusuakuw ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">“Mma no mu nea wɔahyira no koraa ne Aser;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">wɔmma ne nuanom mpɛ nʼasɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">na ɔmfa ngo nguare nʼanan ase.<verse eid="DEU 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25"/>Wʼapon ho nkyerewa nyɛ dade ne kɔbere mfrafrae;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">wʼahoɔden ne wo nkwanna bɛsae so.<verse eid="DEU 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26"/>“Onyankopɔn biara nni hɔ sɛ Yeshurun Nyankopɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">a ɔnam ɔsorosoro ne nʼahenni mu mununkum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">so ba bɛboa wo.<verse eid="DEU 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27"/>Onyankopɔn a ɔwɔ hɔ daa yɛ wo guankɔbea;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">nea ɛwɔ ase no ne abasa a ɛwɔ hɔ daa no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">Ɔbɛpam wʼatamfo afi wʼanim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">ɔbɛka se, ‘Sɛe wɔn!’<verse eid="DEU 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28"/>Enti, Israel bɛtena ase dwoodwoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">Yakob benya bammɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">wɔ asase a atoko ne nsa foforo wɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">faako a ɔsoro bosu gugu.<verse eid="DEU 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29"/>Nhyira nka mo, Israel!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Hena na ɔte sɛ mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">nnipa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> agye mo nkwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Ɔyɛ mo nkatabo ne boafo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">ne mo anuonyam afoa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Mo atamfo bɛkotow mo anim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">na moatiatia wɔn sorɔnsorɔmmea.”<verse eid="DEU 33:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Mose Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1"/>Na Mose fi Moab asase tataw so foro kɔɔ Nebo Bepɔw so, san foroo Pisga a etwa Yeriko. Ɛhɔ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛɛ no asase no nyinaa, efi Gilead kosi Dan; <verse eid="DEU 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2"/>Naftali nsase nyinaa; Efraim ne Manase nsase; Yuda nsase nyinaa kosi Ntam Po no ho; <verse eid="DEU 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3"/>Negeb; ne nsase a efi Yeriko Bon, ne Mmɛ Kuropɔn no de kosi Soar tɔnn. <verse eid="DEU 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose se, “Eyi ne asase a mekaa ntam hyɛɛ ho bɔ kyerɛɛ Abraham, Isak ne Yakob se mede bɛma wɔn asefo no. Afei, mama wo de wʼani ahu, nanso worentwa nkɔ so.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5"/>Na Mose, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> somfo no wuu wɔ Moab asase so sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kae no. <verse eid="DEU 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6"/>Wosiee no wɔ obon bi a ɛne Bet-Peor di nhwɛanim, nanso ebesi nnɛ, obiara nnim faako a ne da wɔ. <verse eid="DEU 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7"/>Mose dii mfirihyia ɔha ne aduonu na owui, nanso na nʼani hu ade yiye na ne ho nso yɛ den. <verse eid="DEU 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8"/>Israelfo suu no nnafua aduasa wɔ Moab tataw so ara kosii sɛ nʼayiyɛ kɔɔ awiei.<verse eid="DEU 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9"/>Afei, Nun babarima Yosua nyaa nyansa honhom, efisɛ Mose de ne nsa guu ne so. Enti Israelfo yɛɛ osetie maa no na wɔyɛɛ biribiara sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose no ara pɛ.<verse eid="DEU 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10"/>Mose akyi no, odiyifo biara mmaa Israel a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nim no anim ne anim <verse eid="DEU 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11"/>a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> somaa no ma ɔkɔyɛɛ anwonwade ne nsɛnkyerɛnne a ɛyɛ hu wɔ Misraim asase so de tiaa Farao ne ne mpanyimfo nyinaa wɔ asase no so nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12"/>Na obiara nnaa tumi kɛse anaa ahodwiriw nneyɛe adi te sɛnea Mose yɛɛ wɔ Israel nyinaa ani so no.<verse eid="DEU 34:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34"/>
</usx>
